(1287427, 164766, 25217, '<td valign="top">I like the composition with the tree on the left and lamp on the right, but I hate how the top of the building is cut off... Also, the sky is a bit blank and could use some life. Nice subject matter though. It looks like an interesting building to photograph.</td>', 'I like the composition with the tree on the left and lamp on the right, but I hate how the top of the building is cut off... Also, the sky is a bit blank and could use some life. Nice subject matter though. It looks like an interesting building to photograph.', '2005-04-13 03:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
