(1287436, 164733, 25217, '<td valign="top">Nice textures and lighting, but that''s about it. There doesn''t seem to be a whole lot of subject in this shot. No actual meaning, if you know what I mean. I still like it though.</td>', 'Nice textures and lighting, but that''s about it. There doesn''t seem to be a whole lot of subject in this shot. No actual meaning, if you know what I mean. I still like it though.', '2005-04-13 03:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
