(1287480, 164942, 30861, '<td valign="top">I supect this won''t do well, but I hope it does. I love the purity of the lines, the cartoonish sense of oversaturation, and especially the very precise separation between overhand and hill line on the right, which speaks volumes for the care you spent composing this shot. (Either that or you were lucky as hell, LOL)</td>', 'I supect this won''t do well, but I hope it does. I love the purity of the lines, the cartoonish sense of oversaturation, and especially the very precise separation between overhand and hill line on the right, which speaks volumes for the care you spent composing this shot. (Either that or you were lucky as hell, LOL)', '2005-04-13 04:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287481, 165891, 18552, '<td valign="top">The abandoned house is quite picturesque. It would have been nice to have mostly the house in the picture and not so much sky.</td>', 'The abandoned house is quite picturesque. It would have been nice to have mostly the house in the picture and not so much sky.', '2005-04-13 04:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
