(1287483, 164273, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is a very strong image, and I''m sure the lighthouse is, indeed, abandoned, but for me it doesn''t speak to the challenge that effectively. A strong score but not top-tier for me.</td>', 'This is a very strong image, and I''m sure the lighthouse is, indeed, abandoned, but for me it doesn''t speak to the challenge that effectively. A strong score but not top-tier for me.', '2005-04-13 04:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
