(1287485, 165711, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a great subject for this challenge. I think that this particular shot would look better with more contrast, even if it means losing detail in the dark areas, such as the doorway. It also seems slightly crooked, which is easy to fix. Overall this is a nice shot with excellent composition and colors.</td>', 'This is a great subject for this challenge. I think that this particular shot would look better with more contrast, even if it means losing detail in the dark areas, such as the doorway. It also seems slightly crooked, which is easy to fix. Overall this is a nice shot with excellent composition and colors.', '2005-04-13 04:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
