(1287487, 165865, 30861, '<td valign="top">I wish the bright part of the sky were not so extremely burned out, this is a real flaw in my eyes. I can see a trace of detail there so it should be fixable, since the contrast is if anything too high throughout the image. I think it would work better with the contrast scaled back a notch or two. Still, a strong and gritty image and a good score from me.</td>', 'I wish the bright part of the sky were not so extremely burned out, this is a real flaw in my eyes. I can see a trace of detail there so it should be fixable, since the contrast is if anything too high throughout the image. I think it would work better with the contrast scaled back a notch or two. Still, a strong and gritty image and a good score from me.', '2005-04-13 04:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287488, 166075, 30861, '<td valign="top">I very much like the vaguely "historical", old-timey feel of this shot with the blown sky and background. I''m wishing it had been toned to accentuate that. Nice image!</td>', 'I very much like the vaguely "historical", old-timey feel of this shot with the blown sky and background. I''m wishing it had been toned to accentuate that. Nice image!', '2005-04-13 04:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
