(1287654, 165883, 30018, '<td valign="top">This looks exactly like the old hunting cabin we used when I was a kid.  I had thoughts of returning there for this challenge, but actually found another subject.  This is wonderully represented, and I''m sure part of my scoring is sentimental.  There is outstanding color and greet representation of different textures; exactly what the challenge called for.  Very, Very Nice.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'This looks exactly like the old hunting cabin we used when I was a kid.  I had thoughts of returning there for this challenge, but actually found another subject.  This is wonderully represented, and I''m sure part of my scoring is sentimental.  There is outstanding color and greet representation of different textures; exactly what the challenge called for.  Very, Very Nice.  <8>', '2005-04-13 06:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
