(1287678, 165971, 30018, '<td valign="top">This could have been a great shot, with the warmth of the wooden textures against the cool colors and textures of the rocks surrounding the door, but this entire image lacks punch.  It''s flat and muddy, and needs some serious contrast for starters.  Interesting composition, however &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'This could have been a great shot, with the warmth of the wooden textures against the cool colors and textures of the rocks surrounding the door, but this entire image lacks punch.  It''s flat and muddy, and needs some serious contrast for starters.  Interesting composition, however <5>', '2005-04-13 06:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
