(1287708, 165651, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent subject that would look better with quite a bit more contrast. Just try darkening the shot and then raising the white point to whatever level you like. It''ll look great! :-)</td>', 'This is an excellent subject that would look better with quite a bit more contrast. Just try darkening the shot and then raising the white point to whatever level you like. It''ll look great! :-)', '2005-04-13 06:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287709, 164399, 33352, '<td valign="top">good contrasting  effect</td>', 'good contrasting  effect', '2005-04-13 06:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287712, 165733, 18738, '<td valign="top">I''m all for creativity; this isn''t it.<br/> <br/>The word ''building'' can only be used to describe a body in badly written poetry and in some religious tracts and even those specifically refer to a ''temple''.</td>', 'I''m all for creativity; this isn''t it. The word ''building'' can only be used to describe a body in badly written poetry and in some religious tracts and even those specifically refer to a ''temple''.', '2005-04-13 06:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287713, 165709, 34746, '<td valign="top">Woau! I like this! The tree reflaction on the windows glass, the contrast colors that apear! Congrats</td>', 'Woau! I like this! The tree reflaction on the windows glass, the contrast colors that apear! Congrats', '2005-04-13 06:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287714, 165776, 30018, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites in this challenge.  I love the colors, the textures, the composition, and evern the blast of light which illuminates it all.  I find myself trying to read the ''writings on the wall''. &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'This is one of my favorites in this challenge.  I love the colors, the textures, the composition, and evern the blast of light which illuminates it all.  I find myself trying to read the ''writings on the wall''. <9>', '2005-04-13 06:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287715, 165516, 34746, '<td valign="top">Nice sun reflactions!</td>', 'Nice sun reflactions!', '2005-04-13 06:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287716, 164454, 18738, '<td valign="top">There is a sense of formlessness and clutter around this shot. The muted colours, though attractive, add to this. Perhaps if you''d isolated an element it migh be a stronger image.</td>', 'There is a sense of formlessness and clutter around this shot. The muted colours, though attractive, add to this. Perhaps if you''d isolated an element it migh be a stronger image.', '2005-04-13 06:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287717, 164281, 21714, '<td valign="top">Cool. Nice approach that uses other elements to enahance the shot. Well done.</td>', 'Cool. Nice approach that uses other elements to enahance the shot. Well done.', '2005-04-13 06:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287718, 164990, 4281, '<td valign="top">Hehe, haven''t I seen these houses somewhere before? ;-)<br/> <br/>Anyway, I feel this picture would have benefitted from some noise reduction and I find the red color of the houses to be bit too saturated for my taste. I think a bit of shadow/highlight might have benefitted the image.<br/> <br/>Composition is nice.</td>', 'Hehe, haven''t I seen these houses somewhere before? ;-) Anyway, I feel this picture would have benefitted from some noise reduction and I find the red color of the houses to be bit too saturated for my taste. I think a bit of shadow/highlight might have benefitted the image. Composition is nice.', '2005-04-13 06:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287719, 166098, 34746, '<td valign="top">I like the colors</td>', 'I like the colors', '2005-04-13 06:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287720, 165281, 21714, '<td valign="top">Isn''t that a wonderful idea now? Nice find.</td>', 'Isn''t that a wonderful idea now? Nice find.', '2005-04-13 06:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287721, 165778, 30018, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge.  Great idea, and nice imaage.  Almost looks "toyland like" with the wonderful colors bright colored flowers and the proportion of the house to it''s surroundings.  Great detail and texture, wonderful color, DOF is also working nicely in this one.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge.  Great idea, and nice imaage.  Almost looks "toyland like" with the wonderful colors bright colored flowers and the proportion of the house to it''s surroundings.  Great detail and texture, wonderful color, DOF is also working nicely in this one.  <8>', '2005-04-13 06:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287722, 164626, 19952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot with nice framing. I think it might be even more dramatic if you boosted the contrast, but it came out really well as it is.</td>', 'Beautiful shot with nice framing. I think it might be even more dramatic if you boosted the contrast, but it came out really well as it is.', '2005-04-13 06:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287723, 165352, 21714, '<td valign="top">Some spooky processing there.</td>', 'Some spooky processing there.', '2005-04-13 07:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287725, 166004, 21714, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Love the shadows and light.</td>', 'Cool shot. Love the shadows and light.', '2005-04-13 07:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287726, 165038, 30018, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and a good combination of great textures. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Nice colors and a good combination of great textures. <7>', '2005-04-13 07:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287727, 164339, 18738, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the black and white is working here: everything is too flat. Colour would help us to see the depth. Perhaps even adding a slight tone to the photo might help.</td>', 'I don''t think the black and white is working here: everything is too flat. Colour would help us to see the depth. Perhaps even adding a slight tone to the photo might help.', '2005-04-13 07:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287728, 164622, 21714, '<td valign="top">I like this different approach. Nice shot.</td>', 'I like this different approach. Nice shot.', '2005-04-13 07:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287729, 166022, 30018, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge.  I love the rich warm colors you have captured.  I generally enjoy the inside shots more than those take outside.  You have captured great detail in the textures and the composition captures the eye and holds it.  I want to study this image.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge.  I love the rich warm colors you have captured.  I generally enjoy the inside shots more than those take outside.  You have captured great detail in the textures and the composition captures the eye and holds it.  I want to study this image.  <9>', '2005-04-13 07:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287730, 165283, 19952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rustic image with excellent tonal range. Very nicely done.</td>', 'Beautiful rustic image with excellent tonal range. Very nicely done.', '2005-04-13 07:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
