(1287741, 165230, 31443, '<td valign="top">This image is a bit cluttered i.e. has too many things included in it, the blue bridge does something for it but if the photo had been cropped more from the left.</td>', 'This image is a bit cluttered i.e. has too many things included in it, the blue bridge does something for it but if the photo had been cropped more from the left.', '2005-04-13 07:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287742, 164854, 30018, '<td valign="top">I enjoy looking at this image.  It reminds more than most of the images in this challenge that nothing, man-made, lasts forever.  The different stages of decay, and the soft texture of the moss really grab my eye and hold it.  The added textures of the tree and the stones make my eye happy.  I enjoy studying this image.  Very nicely done.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'I enjoy looking at this image.  It reminds more than most of the images in this challenge that nothing, man-made, lasts forever.  The different stages of decay, and the soft texture of the moss really grab my eye and hold it.  The added textures of the tree and the stones make my eye happy.  I enjoy studying this image.  Very nicely done.  <8>', '2005-04-13 07:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287743, 164428, 35472, '<td valign="top">Great photo, nice title, but the trees are too much i think.</td>', 'Great photo, nice title, but the trees are too much i think.', '2005-04-13 07:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
