(1287750, 166010, 19952, '<td valign="top">Thi is a really excellent subject for this challenge. When you have to shoot through this many power lines, you might be better of to just focus on a smaller section of the house and shoot only that smaller part from closer up. Still, you did a great job finding a nice abandoned house to shoot.</td>', 'Thi is a really excellent subject for this challenge. When you have to shoot through this many power lines, you might be better of to just focus on a smaller section of the house and shoot only that smaller part from closer up. Still, you did a great job finding a nice abandoned house to shoot.', '2005-04-13 07:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287752, 165865, 36119, '<td valign="top">Nice shot</td>', 'Nice shot', '2005-04-13 07:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287753, 164700, 30018, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but can''t you read the sign?  Just kidding.  I love the textures here, Stone, grass, wooden rails, trees, old asphalt roof, and then there''s all the field''s different textures going on as well in the background.  If anything, this might be a little too busy.  Too much going on all at once, but I still like it.&lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Nice image, but can''t you read the sign?  Just kidding.  I love the textures here, Stone, grass, wooden rails, trees, old asphalt roof, and then there''s all the field''s different textures going on as well in the background.  If anything, this might be a little too busy.  Too much going on all at once, but I still like it.<6>', '2005-04-13 07:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287754, 164625, 19952, '<td valign="top">I love the deep, rich tones of this shot. Great subject, great composition and great processing. Really nicely done!</td>', 'I love the deep, rich tones of this shot. Great subject, great composition and great processing. Really nicely done!', '2005-04-13 07:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
