(1287757, 164627, 30018, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  There are only a handful of "different images" in this challenge, and this is one of them.  There''s a couple of extra points for orginiality.  I like the idea, I like the composition, I like the colors.  Very nicely done.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Nice idea.  There are only a handful of "different images" in this challenge, and this is one of them.  There''s a couple of extra points for orginiality.  I like the idea, I like the composition, I like the colors.  Very nicely done.  <8>', '2005-04-13 07:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
