(1287760, 165011, 19952, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful landscape. It seems just a bit overexposed. If you make one of those shadows behind the walls your black point, the shot should look even better. But even without any changes, this is a really gorgeous photo.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful landscape. It seems just a bit overexposed. If you make one of those shadows behind the walls your black point, the shot should look even better. But even without any changes, this is a really gorgeous photo.', '2005-04-13 07:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
