(1287793, 165176, 30018, '<td valign="top">That building looks newer than someo of the building we have around here.  Interesting shot.  I love the very low perspective which includes the rusted steel tracks, gravel and ties.  Interesting enough the rusty color also appears in the buliding behind and draws the eye up into the building as well as down the tracks.  I waiting for the train to come roaring down the track.  Very nicely done. &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'That building looks newer than someo of the building we have around here.  Interesting shot.  I love the very low perspective which includes the rusted steel tracks, gravel and ties.  Interesting enough the rusty color also appears in the buliding behind and draws the eye up into the building as well as down the tracks.  I waiting for the train to come roaring down the track.  Very nicely done. <8>', '2005-04-13 07:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
