(1287801, 166086, 30018, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite images in this challenge.  Possibly a winner.  I love everything about it; the composition, the colors, the textures of grass, steel, wood, pine needles, glass, and even a little block.  Only one thing could have made this a better picture, and I can''t blame you for the weather man''s mistake.  A pretty blue sky would have really made this a masterpiece.  Great shot  &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'One of my favorite images in this challenge.  Possibly a winner.  I love everything about it; the composition, the colors, the textures of grass, steel, wood, pine needles, glass, and even a little block.  Only one thing could have made this a better picture, and I can''t blame you for the weather man''s mistake.  A pretty blue sky would have really made this a masterpiece.  Great shot  <10>', '2005-04-13 07:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
