(1287833, 165282, 30018, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty picture, but I think it relies too much on the beautiful sunset lit sky to carry it.  The idea, as I understood it, was to capture the colors and textures of the ''abandoned building''.  Although this is a stunning image, In my mind, I don''t think it really meets the challenge.</td>', 'This is a pretty picture, but I think it relies too much on the beautiful sunset lit sky to carry it.  The idea, as I understood it, was to capture the colors and textures of the ''abandoned building''.  Although this is a stunning image, In my mind, I don''t think it really meets the challenge.', '2005-04-13 07:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
