(1287840, 165933, 30018, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture of texture and interesting combination of the warm colored rust on the cold colored paint. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Wonderful capture of texture and interesting combination of the warm colored rust on the cold colored paint. <7>', '2005-04-13 07:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287841, 165378, 35548, '<td valign="top">I love the remains of the yellow sign on the front of this building.  I think you would have had a stronger image if focused more on the sign and how it relates to the building, rather than doing the three quarter view of the side of the building.</td>', 'I love the remains of the yellow sign on the front of this building.  I think you would have had a stronger image if focused more on the sign and how it relates to the building, rather than doing the three quarter view of the side of the building.', '2005-04-13 07:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287842, 165037, 32608, '<td valign="top">nice composition and exposure.  Sepia is perfect.</td>', 'nice composition and exposure.  Sepia is perfect.', '2005-04-13 07:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287843, 164622, 35548, '<td valign="top">You almost got it.</td>', 'You almost got it.', '2005-04-13 07:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287845, 164174, 30018, '<td valign="top">I like this, although it has my head leaning to the left a little.  Strong title, which helps add meaning to the image.  But even without the title, it has lots of texture, and an interesting array of colors, and designs. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'I like this, although it has my head leaning to the left a little.  Strong title, which helps add meaning to the image.  But even without the title, it has lots of texture, and an interesting array of colors, and designs. <7>', '2005-04-13 07:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287847, 165685, 30018, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  A little bright for me, lacking contrast and good feel for texture.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'Great composition.  A little bright for me, lacking contrast and good feel for texture.  <5>', '2005-04-13 08:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287850, 165938, 31443, '<td valign="top">I remember this name! Nice angle and contrast...</td>', 'I remember this name! Nice angle and contrast...', '2005-04-13 08:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287851, 165271, 35548, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photo. I like how you worked with all of the different shapes and how they relate to each other. That being said, if it were my image I may have eleminated the bottom row of bricks.  (artist call)  7</td>', 'This is a very nice photo. I like how you worked with all of the different shapes and how they relate to each other. That being said, if it were my image I may have eleminated the bottom row of bricks.  (artist call)  7', '2005-04-13 08:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287852, 164438, 30018, '<td valign="top">Broken Memories?  Hmmm, would like to hear the rest of that story.  Nice image! &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Broken Memories?  Hmmm, would like to hear the rest of that story.  Nice image! <6>', '2005-04-13 08:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287853, 165976, 32997, '<td valign="top">Beautiful-love the inclusion of the train tracks..great context .</td>', 'Beautiful-love the inclusion of the train tracks..great context .', '2005-04-13 08:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287854, 165946, 32608, '<td valign="top">good idea.  great photo.</td>', 'good idea.  great photo.', '2005-04-13 08:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287856, 164040, 30018, '<td valign="top">Concrere and steel.  Very cold colors.   This looks like a bad place.  Nice capture.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Concrere and steel.  Very cold colors.   This looks like a bad place.  Nice capture.  <6>', '2005-04-13 08:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287857, 165503, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice colors....</td>', 'Nice colors....', '2005-04-13 08:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287858, 164794, 30018, '<td valign="top">Looks like this was quite a treasure at one time.  Now your image is a treasure.  I love the textures, and colors.  Nicely done.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Looks like this was quite a treasure at one time.  Now your image is a treasure.  I love the textures, and colors.  Nicely done.  <7>', '2005-04-13 08:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287859, 165675, 31443, '<td valign="top">Too small....</td>', 'Too small....', '2005-04-13 08:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287860, 165708, 31443, '<td valign="top">Tad too dark although the effect of abandonment shows well that way...the texture of the wood showing would have been nicer</td>', 'Tad too dark although the effect of abandonment shows well that way...the texture of the wood showing would have been nicer', '2005-04-13 08:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287861, 164198, 30018, '<td valign="top">Maybe the most famous of all ''Abandoned Buildings''.  This however looks much like the snapshot I took a few years ago.</td>', 'Maybe the most famous of all ''Abandoned Buildings''.  This however looks much like the snapshot I took a few years ago.', '2005-04-13 08:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287864, 164103, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a great subject for this challenge and the composition is excellent. The contrast seems a bit flat though, so you might want to set one of the light spots on the roof as your white point and then set the window as the black point to give the image a wider tonal range. Still, really nice job with this shot.</td>', 'This is a great subject for this challenge and the composition is excellent. The contrast seems a bit flat though, so you might want to set one of the light spots on the roof as your white point and then set the window as the black point to give the image a wider tonal range. Still, really nice job with this shot.', '2005-04-13 08:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287865, 166074, 35548, '<td valign="top">I feel the "domed" thing on the right is an important element for this image to work properly, therefore it should have been handled as if it was important rather than cutting it off.  Shooting closer to the building will have strengthened this image if you felt like you wished to get more emotionally involved with the subjectl</td>', 'I feel the "domed" thing on the right is an important element for this image to work properly, therefore it should have been handled as if it was important rather than cutting it off.  Shooting closer to the building will have strengthened this image if you felt like you wished to get more emotionally involved with the subjectl', '2005-04-13 08:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287867, 163918, 35548, '<td valign="top">Needs finer focus for any hope of working.</td>', 'Needs finer focus for any hope of working.', '2005-04-13 08:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287869, 165388, 30018, '<td valign="top">Wow, look at all the textures, and colors going on here.  It''s almost a little too busy, but it''s an image I enjoy studying, looking for the little hidden stories of someone''s life.  There is a lot of interesting things going on in this image.  For instance, how did that lightbulb survive the crashing roof?  Too many different textures to even list.  And lots of color too.  Sure am glad this was not a B&amp;W photo.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Wow, look at all the textures, and colors going on here.  It''s almost a little too busy, but it''s an image I enjoy studying, looking for the little hidden stories of someone''s life.  There is a lot of interesting things going on in this image.  For instance, how did that lightbulb survive the crashing roof?  Too many different textures to even list.  And lots of color too.  Sure am glad this was not a B&W photo.  <8>', '2005-04-13 08:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287870, 165427, 35548, '<td valign="top">I like how you printed this image although I think is a tiny bit dark.  The distortion of the building works against the image. (opinion)</td>', 'I like how you printed this image although I think is a tiny bit dark.  The distortion of the building works against the image. (opinion)', '2005-04-13 08:11:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1287871, 165389, 30018, '<td valign="top">Daring image.  I thought of doing something very similiar to this but didn''t think it would be recieved well.  This is very nice.  One little hot spot where detail was lost in the corner brick, but otherwise, some very interesting textures and colors going on here.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Daring image.  I thought of doing something very similiar to this but didn''t think it would be recieved well.  This is very nice.  One little hot spot where detail was lost in the corner brick, but otherwise, some very interesting textures and colors going on here.  <7>', '2005-04-13 08:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287872, 165333, 35548, '<td valign="top">Framing is to tight for my liking.  I would love this building if the photographer showed more personel involvement.</td>', 'Framing is to tight for my liking.  I would love this building if the photographer showed more personel involvement.', '2005-04-13 08:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287875, 164865, 35720, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this house is abandoned, so it is a question about weather it fits this challenge or not. Nice and well framed shot though.</td>', 'I don''t think this house is abandoned, so it is a question about weather it fits this challenge or not. Nice and well framed shot though.', '2005-04-13 08:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287877, 165712, 35548, '<td valign="top">I like this image very much. All of the visual elemenst seem to work, I would like to see a little more detail in the dark area to the left.  Nice framing as well.</td>', 'I like this image very much. All of the visual elemenst seem to work, I would like to see a little more detail in the dark area to the left.  Nice framing as well.', '2005-04-13 08:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287878, 165769, 28801, '<td valign="top">The people in the picture have really given it life.</td>', 'The people in the picture have really given it life.', '2005-04-13 08:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287880, 165736, 35548, '<td valign="top">The framing of the stairs is very nice, It works as a B&amp;W image. 6</td>', 'The framing of the stairs is very nice, It works as a B&W image. 6', '2005-04-13 08:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287883, 164660, 28801, '<td valign="top">Creative, nice angle you have made what would otherwise be boring look interesting. Well done.</td>', 'Creative, nice angle you have made what would otherwise be boring look interesting. Well done.', '2005-04-13 08:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287884, 166098, 35548, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I like this photo very much. The building has a lot to offer from the distance that you took the photo. Color, Testure, Shapes  and the placement of the image in the frame makes this simple image work for me.</td>', 'Hmmm, I like this photo very much. The building has a lot to offer from the distance that you took the photo. Color, Testure, Shapes  and the placement of the image in the frame makes this simple image work for me.', '2005-04-13 08:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287885, 165742, 30018, '<td valign="top">I once had a great teacher that said, "Never use color unless it enhances the image".  I think color would have enhanced this image.  It''s a beautiful shot, but I''m sure color would have helped seperate the leaves from the wood.  I''m dying to see the warmth of those logs and wooden siding, and the cool textures in the ivy.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'I once had a great teacher that said, "Never use color unless it enhances the image".  I think color would have enhanced this image.  It''s a beautiful shot, but I''m sure color would have helped seperate the leaves from the wood.  I''m dying to see the warmth of those logs and wooden siding, and the cool textures in the ivy.  <7>', '2005-04-13 08:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287886, 164123, 30018, '<td valign="top">Different!  I like that.  Bumping up for originality.  Great textures in the rocks and moss.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Different!  I like that.  Bumping up for originality.  Great textures in the rocks and moss.  <8>', '2005-04-13 08:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287887, 165379, 8643, '<td valign="top">Good strong image.  Maybe you could have brought out some more detail in the shadow but still one of the best.</td>', 'Good strong image.  Maybe you could have brought out some more detail in the shadow but still one of the best.', '2005-04-13 08:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287888, 164472, 35548, '<td valign="top">This style life is to isolated and uninteresting for it to mean anything to te viewer. Good placement within the frame.</td>', 'This style life is to isolated and uninteresting for it to mean anything to te viewer. Good placement within the frame.', '2005-04-13 08:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287892, 165949, 35548, '<td valign="top">Not crazy about the cat, but I think the wall that it is sitting on should have been the center of your involvement.</td>', 'Not crazy about the cat, but I think the wall that it is sitting on should have been the center of your involvement.', '2005-04-13 08:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287893, 164887, 30018, '<td valign="top">I gotta tell ya.  I find the person in the background, distracting.  I love the texture of the brick, and the arching doorway, but my eye is drawn away from all that wonderful texture and color to the small unimportant and distracting person in the background.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'I gotta tell ya.  I find the person in the background, distracting.  I love the texture of the brick, and the arching doorway, but my eye is drawn away from all that wonderful texture and color to the small unimportant and distracting person in the background.  <5>', '2005-04-13 08:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287895, 163945, 8643, '<td valign="top">Good composition, nice angle on the ruin.  Very effective light, nice reflections, the key light (and its reflection) is positioned just right.  One of the best.</td>', 'Good composition, nice angle on the ruin.  Very effective light, nice reflections, the key light (and its reflection) is positioned just right.  One of the best.', '2005-04-13 08:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287896, 166103, 8643, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, a very effective image.</td>', 'Excellent composition, a very effective image.', '2005-04-13 08:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287897, 164739, 24951, '<td valign="top">Would have scored this between 8-10 but found the inclusion of the person much to distracting.</td>', 'Would have scored this between 8-10 but found the inclusion of the person much to distracting.', '2005-04-13 08:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287899, 165575, 30018, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.   I like it a lot, but just wonder what it would have looked like being a little darker and with more contrast.  The top of the image is a bit hot for me, as the details get lost.  I think added contrast would hellp bring out more details in the woods and grasses of this image.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Interesting image.   I like it a lot, but just wonder what it would have looked like being a little darker and with more contrast.  The top of the image is a bit hot for me, as the details get lost.  I think added contrast would hellp bring out more details in the woods and grasses of this image.  <6>', '2005-04-13 08:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287900, 164273, 8643, '<td valign="top">Nice strong image - I hope it does well.</td>', 'Nice strong image - I hope it does well.', '2005-04-13 08:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287902, 165877, 35720, '<td valign="top">The cows are here the main subject but not the abondened house, so it doesn''t quite fit to this challenge. But a very nice shot though!</td>', 'The cows are here the main subject but not the abondened house, so it doesn''t quite fit to this challenge. But a very nice shot though!', '2005-04-13 08:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287904, 166076, 30018, '<td valign="top">That''s not funny.  I have been looking for houses, and just recently was shown one very similiar to this.</td>', 'That''s not funny.  I have been looking for houses, and just recently was shown one very similiar to this.', '2005-04-13 08:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287905, 165800, 8643, '<td valign="top">Strong image, good DoF - which you needed.  Nicely balanced in thirds.</td>', 'Strong image, good DoF - which you needed.  Nicely balanced in thirds.', '2005-04-13 08:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287907, 165753, 30018, '<td valign="top">And it glows!</td>', 'And it glows!', '2005-04-13 08:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287911, 165679, 28801, '<td valign="top">It certainly looks like it would be!</td>', 'It certainly looks like it would be!', '2005-04-13 08:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287917, 165454, 30018, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  One of the few that are different.  Bumping up for orginality &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Nice shot.  One of the few that are different.  Bumping up for orginality <7>', '2005-04-13 08:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287918, 163829, 14671, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and excellent clarity but the photo itself lacks interest.  It doesn''t say to me that the building s abandoned but they just bricked up some windows.  As well the title doesn''t suit the challenge topic for abandoned buildings.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and excellent clarity but the photo itself lacks interest.  It doesn''t say to me that the building s abandoned but they just bricked up some windows.  As well the title doesn''t suit the challenge topic for abandoned buildings.', '2005-04-13 08:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287919, 166135, 30018, '<td valign="top">Kinda makes ya wonder what happened...</td>', 'Kinda makes ya wonder what happened...', '2005-04-13 08:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287921, 164281, 30018, '<td valign="top">Now this is nice.  Although you didn''t capture the textures of the building itself, this is a very intersting image.  One of the few that is different from the rest.  Bumping up for originality. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Now this is nice.  Although you didn''t capture the textures of the building itself, this is a very intersting image.  One of the few that is different from the rest.  Bumping up for originality. <7>', '2005-04-13 08:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287922, 166055, 14671, '<td valign="top">Very blurry.  The building itself doesn''t look abandoned but looks more like something you''d see in the country.  The windows look all in tact which would suggest that it is just a low income house instead of abandoned.</td>', 'Very blurry.  The building itself doesn''t look abandoned but looks more like something you''d see in the country.  The windows look all in tact which would suggest that it is just a low income house instead of abandoned.', '2005-04-13 08:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287924, 165011, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very nice image, but relying too much on the wonderful scenic background.  I would really like to see more detail, color and texture in the ''abandoned building''.</td>', 'Very nice image, but relying too much on the wonderful scenic background.  I would really like to see more detail, color and texture in the ''abandoned building''.', '2005-04-13 08:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287926, 165744, 30018, '<td valign="top">Kinda makes ya wonder what happned...</td>', 'Kinda makes ya wonder what happned...', '2005-04-13 08:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287927, 163745, 14671, '<td valign="top">A beautiful photo but this is more ruins then abandoned, altho it could have been abandoned at one time.  I think this would make an excellent print.  Great colors and clarity and excellent use of the RoT. Well done and good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'A beautiful photo but this is more ruins then abandoned, altho it could have been abandoned at one time.  I think this would make an excellent print.  Great colors and clarity and excellent use of the RoT. Well done and good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-13 08:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287928, 165683, 30018, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Different than most of the shots.  But lacking depth and contrast.  Seems muddy and flat to me.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Different than most of the shots.  But lacking depth and contrast.  Seems muddy and flat to me.', '2005-04-13 08:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287931, 164780, 14671, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this building does not look abandoned.  It looks like a basement being excavated.  Perhaps more DoF would hav made for a better photo so the background looked a little more clear.</td>', 'In my opinion this building does not look abandoned.  It looks like a basement being excavated.  Perhaps more DoF would hav made for a better photo so the background looked a little more clear.', '2005-04-13 08:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287932, 164728, 30018, '<td valign="top">Wonderful warm colors and great wood textures.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Wonderful warm colors and great wood textures.  <7>', '2005-04-13 08:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287933, 165769, 14671, '<td valign="top">I find the people to be very distracting.  I do like the fact that there is very little color in this photo tho.</td>', 'I find the people to be very distracting.  I do like the fact that there is very little color in this photo tho.', '2005-04-13 08:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287934, 164833, 30018, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  One of the few that is different and original.  Nice colors, lighting, and textures. &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Nice shot.  One of the few that is different and original.  Nice colors, lighting, and textures. <8>', '2005-04-13 08:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287935, 165995, 32608, '<td valign="top">red way over done.</td>', 'red way over done.', '2005-04-13 08:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287936, 164963, 29154, '<td valign="top">Basic editing ??</td>', 'Basic editing ??', '2005-04-13 08:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287937, 165679, 30018, '<td valign="top">Cool lighting, nice textures, and great composition, but haven''t we seen this is a drawing somewhere.  Just kidding of course.  Very nicely done.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Cool lighting, nice textures, and great composition, but haven''t we seen this is a drawing somewhere.  Just kidding of course.  Very nicely done.  <8>', '2005-04-13 08:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287938, 165794, 14671, '<td valign="top">In my opinion the photo is not very clear and does not suggest to me that this is an abandoned building.  It appears to be more like a building being demolished.  I do like the B&amp;W but unfortunately the clarity makes it hard to look at.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'In my opinion the photo is not very clear and does not suggest to me that this is an abandoned building.  It appears to be more like a building being demolished.  I do like the B&W but unfortunately the clarity makes it hard to look at.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-13 08:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287939, 164372, 14671, '<td valign="top">Altho a somewhat nice photo the clarity is off.  Beautiful colors but the focus takes so much away from the natural beauty of the shot.  The building you have chosen doesn''t look abandoned but out of place with the flowers.  God luck with this challenge.</td>', 'Altho a somewhat nice photo the clarity is off.  Beautiful colors but the focus takes so much away from the natural beauty of the shot.  The building you have chosen doesn''t look abandoned but out of place with the flowers.  God luck with this challenge.', '2005-04-13 08:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287940, 165894, 318, '<td valign="top">Klassík! :)</td>', 'Klassík! :)', '2005-04-13 08:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287941, 164624, 33652, '<td valign="top">Nice framing</td>', 'Nice framing', '2005-04-13 08:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287942, 165651, 14671, '<td valign="top">interesting photo but way to washed out.  It lacks clarity because of the contrast level and the shadow from the tree is very distracting.  Good luck with this challenge.</td>', 'interesting photo but way to washed out.  It lacks clarity because of the contrast level and the shadow from the tree is very distracting.  Good luck with this challenge.', '2005-04-13 08:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
