(1288104, 166089, 19952, '<td valign="top">I really love the lighting in this shot - especially the way it looks like you have a spotlight on the silhouetted subject. This is an absolutely outstanding photo.</td>', 'I really love the lighting in this shot - especially the way it looks like you have a spotlight on the silhouetted subject. This is an absolutely outstanding photo.', '2005-04-13 10:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
