(1288126, 165966, 35675, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  I like this shot in the Black and White.</td>', 'Nice job.  I like this shot in the Black and White.', '2005-04-13 10:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288127, 165770, 35804, '<td valign="top">GREAT perspective, love the nice warm hues and texture...one of the better pictures I think.</td>', 'GREAT perspective, love the nice warm hues and texture...one of the better pictures I think.', '2005-04-13 10:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288128, 164273, 6668, '<td valign="top">very nice shot, only complain is I would have liked to see a little more of the lighthouse, perhaps a little closer, still very nice.8</td>', 'very nice shot, only complain is I would have liked to see a little more of the lighthouse, perhaps a little closer, still very nice.8', '2005-04-13 10:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288129, 165733, 29154, '<td valign="top">This is not a building .......</td>', 'This is not a building .......', '2005-04-13 10:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288130, 164828, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very Cool Image.  Lots of wonderful textures and full of brilliant colors.  Great composition filled with an array of colors and I love the bright white bark on the tree in contrast to the dark tower.  Very nice capture.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Very Cool Image.  Lots of wonderful textures and full of brilliant colors.  Great composition filled with an array of colors and I love the bright white bark on the tree in contrast to the dark tower.  Very nice capture.  <8>', '2005-04-13 10:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288131, 164577, 35675, '<td valign="top">good use made of that angle. nice shot.</td>', 'good use made of that angle. nice shot.', '2005-04-13 10:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288132, 165156, 36335, '<td valign="top">I just became a member, so I''m new at this.  Here it goes.  I think this picture is great. I''m not sure it looks abandoned, but the angle of the shot, the lighting and contrast make it very intriguing. I like the beam of light that appears to be breaking through the dark sky to illuminate the old building.  All of the darkness gives it an ominous look while the lighting draws you to the front of the building. I think this is a good picture.</td>', 'I just became a member, so I''m new at this.  Here it goes.  I think this picture is great. I''m not sure it looks abandoned, but the angle of the shot, the lighting and contrast make it very intriguing. I like the beam of light that appears to be breaking through the dark sky to illuminate the old building.  All of the darkness gives it an ominous look while the lighting draws you to the front of the building. I think this is a good picture.', '2005-04-13 10:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288133, 165795, 35675, '<td valign="top">almost a little too contrasty but otherwise very appealing. nice job.</td>', 'almost a little too contrasty but otherwise very appealing. nice job.', '2005-04-13 10:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288135, 165768, 6668, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting subject, though it lacks contrast in my opinion to really make the ruins of the building stand out.</td>', 'This is an interesting subject, though it lacks contrast in my opinion to really make the ruins of the building stand out.', '2005-04-13 10:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288138, 165946, 30018, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on this challenge.  Nice texture, good color, but how wonderful this would have been if photographed in a nest or somewhere in nature.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'Interesting take on this challenge.  Nice texture, good color, but how wonderful this would have been if photographed in a nest or somewhere in nature.  <5>', '2005-04-13 10:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288139, 166055, 35675, '<td valign="top">isnt it great when the sun cast the light in all the right places. nice shot.</td>', 'isnt it great when the sun cast the light in all the right places. nice shot.', '2005-04-13 10:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288140, 164281, 13381, '<td valign="top">This has the color tones of film, and you do a good job of pulling off the medium format look here.   It reminds me a lot of the stuff I see at //www.makinghappy.com/ .  You''ll have nitpickers who suggest that the clothes pins make this place not abandoned, or that the focus should be on the building, but I think you''ve achieved your goal here.  The building itself isn''t visually very remarkable, but it serves as a good backdrop for the photo.  I like it a lot. :)</td>', 'This has the color tones of film, and you do a good job of pulling off the medium format look here.   It reminds me a lot of the stuff I see at //www.makinghappy.com/ .  You''ll have nitpickers who suggest that the clothes pins make this place not abandoned, or that the focus should be on the building, but I think you''ve achieved your goal here.  The building itself isn''t visually very remarkable, but it serves as a good backdrop for the photo.  I like it a lot. :)', '2005-04-13 10:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288141, 165534, 35675, '<td valign="top">nice shot, but a little too dark i think.</td>', 'nice shot, but a little too dark i think.', '2005-04-13 10:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288143, 164703, 13381, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and tones. Very nice.</td>', 'Beautiful light and tones. Very nice.', '2005-04-13 10:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288145, 165659, 35804, '<td valign="top">I really like the dramatic lighting and color of this, nice.</td>', 'I really like the dramatic lighting and color of this, nice.', '2005-04-13 10:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288146, 165362, 35675, '<td valign="top">nice job!  I wish there was a little more room at the top, Im usually not that picky but it is just at the point of looking cut off.  other than that I really love this shot!</td>', 'nice job!  I wish there was a little more room at the top, Im usually not that picky but it is just at the point of looking cut off.  other than that I really love this shot!', '2005-04-13 10:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288149, 165781, 30018, '<td valign="top">A little bright (light) causing a lack of details in the texture of the building.</td>', 'A little bright (light) causing a lack of details in the texture of the building.', '2005-04-13 10:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288152, 164970, 35675, '<td valign="top">Sometimes the sun makes a great shot but other times the gloom makes it better. nice job</td>', 'Sometimes the sun makes a great shot but other times the gloom makes it better. nice job', '2005-04-13 10:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288153, 165284, 33379, '<td valign="top">thats great</td>', 'thats great', '2005-04-13 10:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
