(1288211, 165769, 35804, '<td valign="top">One of the better pictures thus far, the people aren''t at all distracting, they only add to the "feeling" of this photo...a feeling of resignation perhaps? Or maybe acceptance? This is nice because it makes me wonder.</td>', 'One of the better pictures thus far, the people aren''t at all distracting, they only add to the "feeling" of this photo...a feeling of resignation perhaps? Or maybe acceptance? This is nice because it makes me wonder.', '2005-04-13 10:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
