(1288215, 165262, 19841, '<td valign="top">This may have been more interesting closer up, so we could see some of the textures.  Or maybe at more of an angle.  MIght as well crop off most of the sky, too, since there''s nothing much going on.  Then it is a more dramtic shape.   This location looks like a goldmine for creative photos.</td>', 'This may have been more interesting closer up, so we could see some of the textures.  Or maybe at more of an angle.  MIght as well crop off most of the sky, too, since there''s nothing much going on.  Then it is a more dramtic shape.   This location looks like a goldmine for creative photos.', '2005-04-13 10:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288216, 164600, 34789, '<td valign="top">good looking photo i like how the paint is chipped and the glass is cracked</td>', 'good looking photo i like how the paint is chipped and the glass is cracked', '2005-04-13 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288219, 163854, 22533, '<td valign="top">Cool building, but I think B&amp;W would have done better, or even color. The sky is too blown out.</td>', 'Cool building, but I think B&W would have done better, or even color. The sky is too blown out.', '2005-04-13 10:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
