(1288230, 164990, 34789, '<td valign="top">Great color and picture, very great looking sky and the color contrast of the buildings and the sky really attract your eye to the buildings</td>', 'Great color and picture, very great looking sky and the color contrast of the buildings and the sky really attract your eye to the buildings', '2005-04-13 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
