(1288237, 164828, 36335, '<td valign="top">Old building in the midst of all that color.  I like it.  Would have been nice if the light would have shown just a bit more on the building, like it did the tree.</td>', 'Old building in the midst of all that color.  I like it.  Would have been nice if the light would have shown just a bit more on the building, like it did the tree.', '2005-04-13 10:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
