(1288356, 164062, 24065, '<td valign="top">This is a charming old home.  My suggestions for improvement would be to try to get a wider angle, and take the photo early in the AM or late in the day so the sky won''t be blown out. and the house won''t be so dark.  There''s only so much we can do in basic editing, but I think those 2 things might have helped.  :)</td>', 'This is a charming old home.  My suggestions for improvement would be to try to get a wider angle, and take the photo early in the AM or late in the day so the sky won''t be blown out. and the house won''t be so dark.  There''s only so much we can do in basic editing, but I think those 2 things might have helped.  :)', '2005-04-13 11:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288357, 165901, 21714, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning. I like how the barn is shaped like part of the mountains and the colours reflecting the ground. There''s a watercolors feeling to it. And the clarity and sharpness of the image blens them rather nicely. Excellent work.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning. I like how the barn is shaped like part of the mountains and the colours reflecting the ground. There''s a watercolors feeling to it. And the clarity and sharpness of the image blens them rather nicely. Excellent work.', '2005-04-13 11:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288362, 164657, 19952, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous photo. Being as picky as possible, I''d like it if the foreground were a little lighter, but that''s a small nitpick of a really outstanding picture.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous photo. Being as picky as possible, I''d like it if the foreground were a little lighter, but that''s a small nitpick of a really outstanding picture.', '2005-04-13 11:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288364, 164984, 14671, '<td valign="top">In my opinion if you cropped off about 1.5-2 inches off the left side of the photo it would have made for a beter submission.  As it looks, it looks kinda blown out from the contrast of the sun on the left side and loses a lot of clarity/definition in the rest of the photo.  The tree in the foreground is not needed to make this photo and I find it to be very distracting.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'In my opinion if you cropped off about 1.5-2 inches off the left side of the photo it would have made for a beter submission.  As it looks, it looks kinda blown out from the contrast of the sun on the left side and loses a lot of clarity/definition in the rest of the photo.  The tree in the foreground is not needed to make this photo and I find it to be very distracting.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-13 11:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288368, 164836, 14671, '<td valign="top">I''m not fond of this picture.  It looks more like a bridge underpass and not a building which in my opinion doesn''t meet the challenge.  Altho the structure is very nice the runners are to distracting to get a feeling for the picture.  I do like the B&amp;W conversion tho as I think it adds to the age of the structure.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m not fond of this picture.  It looks more like a bridge underpass and not a building which in my opinion doesn''t meet the challenge.  Altho the structure is very nice the runners are to distracting to get a feeling for the picture.  I do like the B&W conversion tho as I think it adds to the age of the structure.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-13 11:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
