(1288411, 164350, 14671, '<td valign="top">To me this photo doesn''t suggest abandoned but dirty or neglected.  I like the composition of the shot and it makes my eyes flow thru which is rare to see in a challenge.  I also find the photo to be a bit on the bright side and could have been toned down a little.  Good luck on this challenge.</td>', 'To me this photo doesn''t suggest abandoned but dirty or neglected.  I like the composition of the shot and it makes my eyes flow thru which is rare to see in a challenge.  I also find the photo to be a bit on the bright side and could have been toned down a little.  Good luck on this challenge.', '2005-04-13 11:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288414, 166027, 32378, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this cropped tighter, especially on the left.</td>', 'I would have liked this cropped tighter, especially on the left.', '2005-04-13 11:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288415, 164372, 35804, '<td valign="top">This seems to be more about the tulips...nice picture though.</td>', 'This seems to be more about the tulips...nice picture though.', '2005-04-13 11:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288416, 164942, 36378, '<td valign="top">Someone did a Drive-In!  YES!  Nice shot.  I love the way you included the old worn screen in the background.</td>', 'Someone did a Drive-In!  YES!  Nice shot.  I love the way you included the old worn screen in the background.', '2005-04-13 11:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288417, 164803, 24065, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and the lighting is wonderful.  The textures make the photo so interesting.  The only distraction in the photo is the blown-out sky, which we couldn''t do anything about in basic editing!  (I hate basic editing!)  BOL</td>', 'Nice perspective and the lighting is wonderful.  The textures make the photo so interesting.  The only distraction in the photo is the blown-out sky, which we couldn''t do anything about in basic editing!  (I hate basic editing!)  BOL', '2005-04-13 11:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288419, 165858, 35804, '<td valign="top">I like the strong contrast of this picture, but there seems to be some "dust" in those clouds?</td>', 'I like the strong contrast of this picture, but there seems to be some "dust" in those clouds?', '2005-04-13 11:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288421, 165639, 2741, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo with a certain style to it. Unique. 7.</td>', 'This is a good photo with a certain style to it. Unique. 7.', '2005-04-13 11:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288422, 166137, 24065, '<td valign="top">Great colors and the textures are so inviting.  I''ll be interested to see what more experienced photographers say, but I''m wondering if a closer crop on the 2nd &amp; 3rd windows would have made the shot more interesting.  My eyes are going all over the place trying to find something to "land" on.  Hope this is helpful feedback :)</td>', 'Great colors and the textures are so inviting.  I''ll be interested to see what more experienced photographers say, but I''m wondering if a closer crop on the 2nd & 3rd windows would have made the shot more interesting.  My eyes are going all over the place trying to find something to "land" on.  Hope this is helpful feedback :)', '2005-04-13 11:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288424, 165086, 2741, '<td valign="top">The only 10 I gave out. I hope this does well.</td>', 'The only 10 I gave out. I hope this does well.', '2005-04-13 11:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288427, 166137, 32378, '<td valign="top">This seems either over processed or shot in too harsh a light.</td>', 'This seems either over processed or shot in too harsh a light.', '2005-04-13 11:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288428, 165253, 35548, '<td valign="top">Very nice image, you did a nice job with the printing as well.</td>', 'Very nice image, you did a nice job with the printing as well.', '2005-04-13 11:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288429, 165642, 24065, '<td valign="top">The textures and colors are very interesting.  I think a closer crop on the left and top may have helped.  :)  Hope this feedback will be helpful.</td>', 'The textures and colors are very interesting.  I think a closer crop on the left and top may have helped.  :)  Hope this feedback will be helpful.', '2005-04-13 11:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288434, 164286, 35804, '<td valign="top">Lovely light in the greens out front...I just love peely paint  and old wood...very nice.</td>', 'Lovely light in the greens out front...I just love peely paint  and old wood...very nice.', '2005-04-13 11:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288439, 165376, 117, '<td valign="top">10 perfect</td>', '10 perfect', '2005-04-13 11:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288440, 165360, 24065, '<td valign="top">I love what you''ve achieved here in basic editing -- and I want to know how you did it!!!!  I couldn''t get this look without adding layers in modes other than normal!  The colors are rich and wonderful.  I''m sure others will disagree, but I think I would crop out the concrete block building and pull in closer on the barn section.  It''s just a thought :)  Seriously, teach me how you did this!</td>', 'I love what you''ve achieved here in basic editing -- and I want to know how you did it!!!!  I couldn''t get this look without adding layers in modes other than normal!  The colors are rich and wonderful.  I''m sure others will disagree, but I think I would crop out the concrete block building and pull in closer on the barn section.  It''s just a thought :)  Seriously, teach me how you did this!', '2005-04-13 11:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288443, 165744, 35548, '<td valign="top">This image has more to it than meets the first look,  I like the placement of the tree right off and I think the tree becomes the main focus of this image.  The well in the foreground seems to be trying to pull the image together so that the building becomes more important than the tree.  I am confused as the viewer as what you want me to see....... I like the feel of the over all image....but in some way it leaves me unmoved.....</td>', 'This image has more to it than meets the first look,  I like the placement of the tree right off and I think the tree becomes the main focus of this image.  The well in the foreground seems to be trying to pull the image together so that the building becomes more important than the tree.  I am confused as the viewer as what you want me to see....... I like the feel of the over all image....but in some way it leaves me unmoved.....', '2005-04-13 11:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288445, 165366, 35804, '<td valign="top">You have suceeded in making this ruin of a building appear beautiful, romantic, appealing, etc. by using the soft focus and sepia tonig...beautiful.</td>', 'You have suceeded in making this ruin of a building appear beautiful, romantic, appealing, etc. by using the soft focus and sepia tonig...beautiful.', '2005-04-13 11:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288447, 166051, 35548, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the lighting is working for this image.</td>', 'Not sure if the lighting is working for this image.', '2005-04-13 11:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288448, 165576, 31541, '<td valign="top">Like this picture - the textures are great.  The sky takes away from the pic a bit though (too washed out).  Perhaps cropping lower would help.</td>', 'Like this picture - the textures are great.  The sky takes away from the pic a bit though (too washed out).  Perhaps cropping lower would help.', '2005-04-13 11:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288449, 165709, 27555, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection, color, and pattern. This is a good shot.</td>', 'Nice reflection, color, and pattern. This is a good shot.', '2005-04-13 11:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288450, 165427, 31541, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but it doesn''t look very abandoned - is it really?</td>', 'Nice picture, but it doesn''t look very abandoned - is it really?', '2005-04-13 11:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288451, 165427, 117, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if you used a fish eye on this or it was just your lens you can correct this with transform perspective in photoshop if that was not the case.</td>', 'I don''t know if you used a fish eye on this or it was just your lens you can correct this with transform perspective in photoshop if that was not the case.', '2005-04-13 11:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288452, 164803, 35804, '<td valign="top">Very soft and pretty light, it makes something hard and crusty appear soft and forlorn...the flowers are nice too.</td>', 'Very soft and pretty light, it makes something hard and crusty appear soft and forlorn...the flowers are nice too.', '2005-04-13 11:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288453, 166024, 35548, '<td valign="top">I like this image....but it doesn''t make me feel much about the building rather I think the building is making me relate more to it''s surroundings.</td>', 'I like this image....but it doesn''t make me feel much about the building rather I think the building is making me relate more to it''s surroundings.', '2005-04-13 11:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288456, 165336, 24065, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the gate is wonderful.  And I love the tones you''ve chosen for the photo.  I think it might have been a stronger presentation if it had been cropped closer on the sides.  The blown out lights keep my eyes going back and forth instead of focusing on the wonderful gate and boards in the barn.  Hope this feedback is helpful :)</td>', 'The lighting on the gate is wonderful.  And I love the tones you''ve chosen for the photo.  I think it might have been a stronger presentation if it had been cropped closer on the sides.  The blown out lights keep my eyes going back and forth instead of focusing on the wonderful gate and boards in the barn.  Hope this feedback is helpful :)', '2005-04-13 11:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288457, 166037, 2741, '<td valign="top">One of my few 7 votes. This is a good execution. Good Luck.</td>', 'One of my few 7 votes. This is a good execution. Good Luck.', '2005-04-13 11:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288458, 164626, 24065, '<td valign="top">Ah, no fair!!  All I have in Alabama is old barns!!  :)</td>', 'Ah, no fair!!  All I have in Alabama is old barns!!  :)', '2005-04-13 11:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288459, 165999, 35548, '<td valign="top">I think the image needs more work in the sharpness area.  I know this is not as easy as it sounds, but I thing your subject would have been more powerful if the lighting was better.</td>', 'I think the image needs more work in the sharpness area.  I know this is not as easy as it sounds, but I thing your subject would have been more powerful if the lighting was better.', '2005-04-13 11:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288460, 165660, 2741, '<td valign="top">Seems over-saturated.</td>', 'Seems over-saturated.', '2005-04-13 11:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288462, 165736, 24065, '<td valign="top">I love the composition, tones and subject.  I am distracted by the blownout lights in the window.  I know in basic editing there wasn''t much you could do about that.  Maybe taking it late in the afternoon or early in the AM?  Still, one of the best ones in the competition!</td>', 'I love the composition, tones and subject.  I am distracted by the blownout lights in the window.  I know in basic editing there wasn''t much you could do about that.  Maybe taking it late in the afternoon or early in the AM?  Still, one of the best ones in the competition!', '2005-04-13 11:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288465, 165282, 35548, '<td valign="top">Powerful sky.....but it makes saying something about the building less important.  Nice image overall though.</td>', 'Powerful sky.....but it makes saying something about the building less important.  Nice image overall though.', '2005-04-13 11:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288466, 164494, 35804, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and shadow, lovely golden tones...the sky in the upper left corner is a bit distracting, maybe a different crop would have made a difference? I still like this very much though.</td>', 'Beautiful light and shadow, lovely golden tones...the sky in the upper left corner is a bit distracting, maybe a different crop would have made a difference? I still like this very much though.', '2005-04-13 11:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288467, 165899, 35548, '<td valign="top">The image is a little busy for me to understand what you want to say to me.. Good job on the printing.</td>', 'The image is a little busy for me to understand what you want to say to me.. Good job on the printing.', '2005-04-13 11:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288469, 165679, 2741, '<td valign="top">Good use of lines and depth. 7</td>', 'Good use of lines and depth. 7', '2005-04-13 11:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288471, 166084, 117, '<td valign="top">Need just a little better focus.</td>', 'Need just a little better focus.', '2005-04-13 11:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288475, 164633, 35548, '<td valign="top">I like this image...it seems to be very green and I have to be honest I''m not sure how to fix that.  (black jacket and shoes have excessive green on them)  Dark areas are a little bogged down.. 5</td>', 'I like this image...it seems to be very green and I have to be honest I''m not sure how to fix that.  (black jacket and shoes have excessive green on them)  Dark areas are a little bogged down.. 5', '2005-04-13 11:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288480, 165711, 36335, '<td valign="top">This picture would look so good with an old timer standing or sitting in the doorway.  I like the picture except the black space of the door in the middle needs something.</td>', 'This picture would look so good with an old timer standing or sitting in the doorway.  I like the picture except the black space of the door in the middle needs something.', '2005-04-13 11:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288481, 166031, 35548, '<td valign="top">Interesting point of view on buildings infact in makes me smile... Nice job in the printing and I like the B&amp;W print of the subject.</td>', 'Interesting point of view on buildings infact in makes me smile... Nice job in the printing and I like the B&W print of the subject.', '2005-04-13 11:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288483, 165894, 2741, '<td valign="top">Great Color. Sharpness &amp; Detail make it life like. 7.</td>', 'Great Color. Sharpness & Detail make it life like. 7.', '2005-04-13 11:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288484, 165877, 36335, '<td valign="top">This picture is more about the animals then the buildings.  I like the picture, it just doesn''t seem to meet the challenge of abandoned buildings.</td>', 'This picture is more about the animals then the buildings.  I like the picture, it just doesn''t seem to meet the challenge of abandoned buildings.', '2005-04-13 11:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288485, 164828, 34194, '<td valign="top">Nice shot I like the color and lighting but is it truly abandoned? As an image it rates highest so far for me.</td>', 'Nice shot I like the color and lighting but is it truly abandoned? As an image it rates highest so far for me.', '2005-04-13 11:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288488, 165659, 2741, '<td valign="top">Intresting colors and light casting. 7</td>', 'Intresting colors and light casting. 7', '2005-04-13 11:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288489, 165733, 35804, '<td valign="top">I get it but I don''t think many will...sometimes being different can be like shooting yourself in the foot depending on your peers. I do wish I could see the entire ear though.</td>', 'I get it but I don''t think many will...sometimes being different can be like shooting yourself in the foot depending on your peers. I do wish I could see the entire ear though.', '2005-04-13 11:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288492, 165661, 35548, '<td valign="top"><br/>Very interesting and different image....I like the rock formation in the background maybe because I''m a guy......:-)........Don''t know if you used a Tri pod for this but if you didn''t I think you would have had a sharper image if you didn''t. 5</td>', 'Very interesting and different image....I like the rock formation in the background maybe because I''m a guy......:-)........Don''t know if you used a Tri pod for this but if you didn''t I think you would have had a sharper image if you didn''t. 5', '2005-04-13 11:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288499, 165773, 29154, '<td valign="top">Good use of negative space. Great color too !</td>', 'Good use of negative space. Great color too !', '2005-04-13 12:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288500, 165901, 2741, '<td valign="top">Nice scenic approach. 7</td>', 'Nice scenic approach. 7', '2005-04-13 12:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
