(1288756, 165367, 34396, '<td valign="top">Out of focus.  I don''t care for the colors.  Sky looks overexposed.</td>', 'Out of focus.  I don''t care for the colors.  Sky looks overexposed.', '2005-04-13 14:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288757, 164827, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the lighting -- very evocative.</td>', 'Nice use of the lighting -- very evocative.', '2005-04-13 14:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288758, 165480, 33652, '<td valign="top">Colourful. Well done.</td>', 'Colourful. Well done.', '2005-04-13 14:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288764, 164657, 5664, '<td valign="top">Really good picture, I think it is not hurting to have picture correct horizontal and if you use levels in PS that is not good bit better color adjustment better to do that in curve, after better color adjustment I like to see picture bit darker or in B&amp;W whit hard tone, to get this old house mood .. ir</td>', 'Really good picture, I think it is not hurting to have picture correct horizontal and if you use levels in PS that is not good bit better color adjustment better to do that in curve, after better color adjustment I like to see picture bit darker or in B&W whit hard tone, to get this old house mood .. ir', '2005-04-13 14:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288765, 165035, 34396, '<td valign="top">I like how the building seems to have a "Wise Guy" face.  The shadow makes a perfect nose.  Almost as if it is saying "You talkin ta Me?"  I like it!</td>', 'I like how the building seems to have a "Wise Guy" face.  The shadow makes a perfect nose.  Almost as if it is saying "You talkin ta Me?"  I like it!', '2005-04-13 14:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288766, 165891, 6668, '<td valign="top">There is too much sky in this photo, in my opinion, I would have focused more on the house and less on the sky. The focus also seems a little soft.</td>', 'There is too much sky in this photo, in my opinion, I would have focused more on the house and less on the sky. The focus also seems a little soft.', '2005-04-13 14:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288767, 164309, 35804, '<td valign="top">Look at that texture! Nice framed, great detail and sharpness, beautiful tones, B&amp;W perfection.</td>', 'Look at that texture! Nice framed, great detail and sharpness, beautiful tones, B&W perfection.', '2005-04-13 14:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288768, 164540, 6668, '<td valign="top">This looks like it could be an interesting image, but it is just too small to tell.</td>', 'This looks like it could be an interesting image, but it is just too small to tell.', '2005-04-13 14:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288769, 166003, 31541, '<td valign="top">Nice detail.  Not sure I like the angle though.  Seems like the horizon is higher on the right side - gives it an off kilter look.</td>', 'Nice detail.  Not sure I like the angle though.  Seems like the horizon is higher on the right side - gives it an off kilter look.', '2005-04-13 14:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288771, 165684, 30208, '<td valign="top">Looks good but a little too dark, makes it hard to see the barn.</td>', 'Looks good but a little too dark, makes it hard to see the barn.', '2005-04-13 14:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288773, 165982, 35645, '<td valign="top">Nice color. I think a lot of the details would have been lost if you''d chosen B&amp;W. Good clarity.</td>', 'Nice color. I think a lot of the details would have been lost if you''d chosen B&W. Good clarity.', '2005-04-13 14:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288774, 165375, 36355, '<td valign="top">Great colors.</td>', 'Great colors.', '2005-04-13 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288775, 165805, 35804, '<td valign="top">Neat picture but I find the "tilt" of the room a little bothersome...and I want to see the whole noggin. I really like the light and shadow, very nice.</td>', 'Neat picture but I find the "tilt" of the room a little bothersome...and I want to see the whole noggin. I really like the light and shadow, very nice.', '2005-04-13 14:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288777, 165933, 36177, '<td valign="top">Nice texture and shadows. I also like the composition.</td>', 'Nice texture and shadows. I also like the composition.', '2005-04-13 14:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288778, 165344, 29148, '<td valign="top">Good angle for a building that may not have had much to photograph.</td>', 'Good angle for a building that may not have had much to photograph.', '2005-04-13 14:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288781, 164990, 36355, '<td valign="top">The best of the bunch, so far.</td>', 'The best of the bunch, so far.', '2005-04-13 14:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288782, 166094, 34396, '<td valign="top">At first glance I thought this looked pretty cool.  I love the clouds and the brush growing out of the roof.  Then image starts to "sparkle" at me.  I don''t know if it is too much sharpening, or some other process, but there are white specks all over the ground, and roof which are distracting.</td>', 'At first glance I thought this looked pretty cool.  I love the clouds and the brush growing out of the roof.  Then image starts to "sparkle" at me.  I don''t know if it is too much sharpening, or some other process, but there are white specks all over the ground, and roof which are distracting.', '2005-04-13 14:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288783, 164577, 13879, '<td valign="top">I find this one really striking. Love the composition, the building looks very imposing.  The Tones complement the image well &amp; suit the Challenge. Good Stuff</td>', 'I find this one really striking. Love the composition, the building looks very imposing.  The Tones complement the image well & suit the Challenge. Good Stuff', '2005-04-13 14:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
