(1288789, 164286, 34396, '<td valign="top">I like how we look through the shot into the house.  It gives the photograph real "depth"  I also love the crisp colors.  Good job</td>', 'I like how we look through the shot into the house.  It gives the photograph real "depth"  I also love the crisp colors.  Good job', '2005-04-13 14:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
