(1288808, 165976, 35804, '<td valign="top">I like this one but am slightly bothered by the chopped off gable, and maybe  a different crop? Perhaps cutting out the lamp and trees and just focus on the building and tracks....it''s hard because that lamp is really nice. I do really likr the contrast and the subtle color and light.</td>', 'I like this one but am slightly bothered by the chopped off gable, and maybe  a different crop? Perhaps cutting out the lamp and trees and just focus on the building and tracks....it''s hard because that lamp is really nice. I do really likr the contrast and the subtle color and light.', '2005-04-13 14:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288810, 165721, 36355, '<td valign="top">You know, I bet you waited hours for the perfect cloud to arrive and complete this composition. This almost looks too real, like I''m right there.  Absolutely my favorite, to this point in voting. 10!</td>', 'You know, I bet you waited hours for the perfect cloud to arrive and complete this composition. This almost looks too real, like I''m right there.  Absolutely my favorite, to this point in voting. 10!', '2005-04-13 14:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
