(1288814, 164372, 35645, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see a tighter crop to eliminate the house on the right. Nice colors in the flowers, but I think the focus should have been on the building rather than the (admittedly very pretty) flowers.</td>', 'Would have liked to see a tighter crop to eliminate the house on the right. Nice colors in the flowers, but I think the focus should have been on the building rather than the (admittedly very pretty) flowers.', '2005-04-13 14:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
