(1289129, 165367, 15207, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame this shot is so blurry - it''s a really nice composition and a break from the norm. I really like the clearning in the trees and the angle you shot it. Maybe try using a tripod and taking several images of the same thing, experimenting with focus. This works well as a monochromatic shot - but may have been even better in straight black and white, increasing contrast slightly in PhotoShop if you have it. 4</td>', 'It''s a shame this shot is so blurry - it''s a really nice composition and a break from the norm. I really like the clearning in the trees and the angle you shot it. Maybe try using a tripod and taking several images of the same thing, experimenting with focus. This works well as a monochromatic shot - but may have been even better in straight black and white, increasing contrast slightly in PhotoShop if you have it. 4', '2005-04-13 16:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
