(1289165, 165640, 33560, '<td valign="top">The strength of the photo would have been the beautiful texture of the peeling paint, IMO;  but it all seems a little out of focus. It''s hard to argue that the composition is strong.  Or that the lighting is unusually good, although I notice some pleasing soft shadows.  I''m afraid the blued-out face sort of ruins what little attraction the peeling paint had  - might have been interesting before it was ''defaced.''</td>', 'The strength of the photo would have been the beautiful texture of the peeling paint, IMO;  but it all seems a little out of focus. It''s hard to argue that the composition is strong.  Or that the lighting is unusually good, although I notice some pleasing soft shadows.  I''m afraid the blued-out face sort of ruins what little attraction the peeling paint had  - might have been interesting before it was ''defaced.''', '2005-04-13 16:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
