(1289232, 163929, 6999, '<td valign="top">There are certain graphic elements tto this that i really like - the contrast of the barbed wire and the fence, the lines of the wire and the lines of the windows, and the block areas of subject. it must be said that it doesn''t speak immediately of abandonment (and in a challenge with so many entries, many voters might be looking for any reason to put an image out of contention). For me, it lacks a sense of detail, of anything beyond that purely grahic quality.</td>', 'There are certain graphic elements tto this that i really like - the contrast of the barbed wire and the fence, the lines of the wire and the lines of the windows, and the block areas of subject. it must be said that it doesn''t speak immediately of abandonment (and in a challenge with so many entries, many voters might be looking for any reason to put an image out of contention). For me, it lacks a sense of detail, of anything beyond that purely grahic quality.', '2005-04-13 16:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289234, 165496, 31831, '<td valign="top">A great old building with a tree blocking the view. I can''t see around it ;)</td>', 'A great old building with a tree blocking the view. I can''t see around it ;)', '2005-04-13 16:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289237, 165781, 23053, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t seem to be about abandoned buildings at all...is it just me?  Not a bad portrait, but not a good fit for the challenge in my mind.</td>', 'This doesn''t seem to be about abandoned buildings at all...is it just me?  Not a bad portrait, but not a good fit for the challenge in my mind.', '2005-04-13 16:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289240, 166099, 35548, '<td valign="top">There is to much here for my eye to process....If you moved in closer to the subject you my have found so interesting details that would not be so obvious...of course this is a matter of choice the viewer does not have as the photographer is the one making the choices....these old buildings are dinosaurs and I think photos like this make good visual histories of the past.....If thats what you were going for you did a nice job....as a viewer I like seeing things that I have never experienced and hope that the image will talk to me in a special way, this image does not draw me into it enough for me to experience it. 4</td>', 'There is to much here for my eye to process....If you moved in closer to the subject you my have found so interesting details that would not be so obvious...of course this is a matter of choice the viewer does not have as the photographer is the one making the choices....these old buildings are dinosaurs and I think photos like this make good visual histories of the past.....If thats what you were going for you did a nice job....as a viewer I like seeing things that I have never experienced and hope that the image will talk to me in a special way, this image does not draw me into it enough for me to experience it. 4', '2005-04-13 16:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289241, 164988, 22970, '<td valign="top">I would of loved to see more details in the abandoned buildings. Nice shot but the subjects are very dark.</td>', 'I would of loved to see more details in the abandoned buildings. Nice shot but the subjects are very dark.', '2005-04-13 16:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289242, 164259, 23053, '<td valign="top">I don''t mind the subject, but I do mind the composition.  Perhaps some different perspective could have intensified the image.</td>', 'I don''t mind the subject, but I do mind the composition.  Perhaps some different perspective could have intensified the image.', '2005-04-13 16:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289245, 166089, 28875, '<td valign="top">For me a strong image, nice work.</td>', 'For me a strong image, nice work.', '2005-04-13 16:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289246, 166037, 23053, '<td valign="top">Nice photo...I like the green on red and the detail of the wall and window.</td>', 'Nice photo...I like the green on red and the detail of the wall and window.', '2005-04-13 16:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289248, 164160, 6999, '<td valign="top">The soft-focus quality (that sense of the spreading of the highlights) is well executed, although not to my taste. I''m seriously unsure about your cropping - so tight to the building leaves it no room to ''breathe'' compositionally, and the cutting in half of the truck is simply a shame. There are details in the side of that building that are excellently caught, but that composition remains a problem for me: your audience''s eye, it should alwas be remembered, will drift out of frame as soon as you give them a chance - placing elements of your primary subject that close to the edge is an open invitation. Nevertheless, there''s enough good stuff here to put you in the upper half of the scores from me.</td>', 'The soft-focus quality (that sense of the spreading of the highlights) is well executed, although not to my taste. I''m seriously unsure about your cropping - so tight to the building leaves it no room to ''breathe'' compositionally, and the cutting in half of the truck is simply a shame. There are details in the side of that building that are excellently caught, but that composition remains a problem for me: your audience''s eye, it should alwas be remembered, will drift out of frame as soon as you give them a chance - placing elements of your primary subject that close to the edge is an open invitation. Nevertheless, there''s enough good stuff here to put you in the upper half of the scores from me.', '2005-04-13 16:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289250, 164198, 35645, '<td valign="top">Not technically abandoned... I hear they give tours. Aside from that, out of focus; small size makes detail hard to see. Needs tighter crop.</td>', 'Not technically abandoned... I hear they give tours. Aside from that, out of focus; small size makes detail hard to see. Needs tighter crop.', '2005-04-13 16:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289251, 166041, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very nice find and nice detail. I don''t care to much for the border especially with that tight of a crop. I think a solid white border a bit smaller would of be better. With that said, I still like you photograph. Composed well and lighting good.</td>', 'Very nice find and nice detail. I don''t care to much for the border especially with that tight of a crop. I think a solid white border a bit smaller would of be better. With that said, I still like you photograph. Composed well and lighting good.', '2005-04-13 16:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289253, 165805, 31831, '<td valign="top">The building is great, I really like the peeling paint and volume of light. The apparition, though a good idea and placement is a bit too visible. 7</td>', 'The building is great, I really like the peeling paint and volume of light. The apparition, though a good idea and placement is a bit too visible. 7', '2005-04-13 16:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289254, 165943, 35548, '<td valign="top">This image gets my attention....perhaps it is the angle of the view or the color of the surface of the image....It has a unique look to it and I am not sure why I like it. 6<br/></td>', 'This image gets my attention....perhaps it is the angle of the view or the color of the surface of the image....It has a unique look to it and I am not sure why I like it. 6', '2005-04-13 16:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289256, 165684, 31831, '<td valign="top">Would see more detail in a closer crop, of course. Too dark.</td>', 'Would see more detail in a closer crop, of course. Too dark.', '2005-04-13 16:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289257, 164074, 33560, '<td valign="top">Very Cute.</td>', 'Very Cute.', '2005-04-13 16:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289259, 165642, 23053, '<td valign="top">Great subject, I would just like to see a different viewpoint.  Maybe if you could reposition yourself when shooting to avoid the blown out sky in the upper left and really focus in on the windows, it would be a stronger photo.</td>', 'Great subject, I would just like to see a different viewpoint.  Maybe if you could reposition yourself when shooting to avoid the blown out sky in the upper left and really focus in on the windows, it would be a stronger photo.', '2005-04-13 16:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289260, 165409, 31831, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle!</td>', 'Interesting angle!', '2005-04-13 16:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289261, 165480, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but the hue shift it a bit overwhelming to my eyes. Seems to be to much of a purplish hue to the picture.</td>', 'Nice composition but the hue shift it a bit overwhelming to my eyes. Seems to be to much of a purplish hue to the picture.', '2005-04-13 16:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289262, 164986, 23053, '<td valign="top">The subject is good, but the composition, crop, and framing are all off.  This shot looks more like something that an insurance adjuster would take rather than a photographer.</td>', 'The subject is good, but the composition, crop, and framing are all off.  This shot looks more like something that an insurance adjuster would take rather than a photographer.', '2005-04-13 16:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289263, 166109, 35427, '<td valign="top">the best so far</td>', 'the best so far', '2005-04-13 16:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289267, 165753, 34192, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Looks like  sepia was somehow used while leaving the green in tritone maybe?  Compositionally this is a little weak but the DOF and focus are good. The border works for this image. 6 for now but will pass again after seeing the others.</td>', 'Interesting.  Looks like  sepia was somehow used while leaving the green in tritone maybe?  Compositionally this is a little weak but the DOF and focus are good. The border works for this image. 6 for now but will pass again after seeing the others.', '2005-04-13 16:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289273, 164848, 36251, '<td valign="top">like the sunset</td>', 'like the sunset', '2005-04-13 16:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289276, 164803, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light, wonderfully captured - although I''m not sure the herd of voters is going to give your image the time to see that. I find the blockiness of the sky a shame - would have thought a more gently graduated element there would have been more sympathetic - though I understand the restrictions. Strong compositionally - perhaps, for me, even too bluntly so. I also wonder if there''s quite enough allowed for the restrictions of the medium here - the file and image size, and the inevitable result that images that rely on complex interaction of elements and detail are like to loose that impact under those restrictions. nice work though; would like to see it at a more natural size and resolution.</td>', 'Wonderful light, wonderfully captured - although I''m not sure the herd of voters is going to give your image the time to see that. I find the blockiness of the sky a shame - would have thought a more gently graduated element there would have been more sympathetic - though I understand the restrictions. Strong compositionally - perhaps, for me, even too bluntly so. I also wonder if there''s quite enough allowed for the restrictions of the medium here - the file and image size, and the inevitable result that images that rely on complex interaction of elements and detail are like to loose that impact under those restrictions. nice work though; would like to see it at a more natural size and resolution.', '2005-04-13 16:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289277, 165284, 34192, '<td valign="top">something intriguing about this image.  I think for me at least its the colors.  You did a great job on that. I like the crop.  Wish it wasn''t limited to 640 so I could REALLY see the image.</td>', 'something intriguing about this image.  I think for me at least its the colors.  You did a great job on that. I like the crop.  Wish it wasn''t limited to 640 so I could REALLY see the image.', '2005-04-13 16:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289278, 165709, 34838, '<td valign="top">That looks really cool!!</td>', 'That looks really cool!!', '2005-04-13 16:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289279, 164281, 33560, '<td valign="top">The problem is that the shiny white clotheslines suggest that these particular clothespins might belong to an inhabited building.  If so, then we might call the abandoned building in the background a minor element. ...    But we''re not going to do any of that.  I like the tension between the clothespins and the background.</td>', 'The problem is that the shiny white clotheslines suggest that these particular clothespins might belong to an inhabited building.  If so, then we might call the abandoned building in the background a minor element. ...    But we''re not going to do any of that.  I like the tension between the clothespins and the background.', '2005-04-13 16:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289282, 164668, 35548, '<td valign="top">I don''t think   the angle you photographed this image at is the best way to look at it....(I know this is subjective).....the problem here is my eye does not know where to land or what to look...this gives me the impression that you were not involved very much in taking the photo...(subjective again)</td>', 'I don''t think   the angle you photographed this image at is the best way to look at it....(I know this is subjective).....the problem here is my eye does not know where to land or what to look...this gives me the impression that you were not involved very much in taking the photo...(subjective again)', '2005-04-13 16:49:33.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1289283, 165364, 33560, '<td valign="top">Very droll title.</td>', 'Very droll title.', '2005-04-13 16:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289284, 165233, 34192, '<td valign="top">pretty cool!  I love the way the tree has taken over.  Does that mean its not adandoned? :) colors work well here.</td>', 'pretty cool!  I love the way the tree has taken over.  Does that mean its not adandoned? :) colors work well here.', '2005-04-13 16:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289285, 165530, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strong appreciation of the graphic nature of your scene shown here. I would personally want to add more punch to the image as a whole - just expanding the histogram a touch would add that - for the sake of impact for a challenge.</td>', 'Strong appreciation of the graphic nature of your scene shown here. I would personally want to add more punch to the image as a whole - just expanding the histogram a touch would add that - for the sake of impact for a challenge.', '2005-04-13 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289291, 164953, 34192, '<td valign="top">love the way the background makes the subject pop.</td>', 'love the way the background makes the subject pop.', '2005-04-13 16:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289292, 165237, 23053, '<td valign="top">Ahh...interesting interpretation.  I wanted to find a movie theater showing ''Miss Congeniality 2'' and photograph that, but no such luck.</td>', 'Ahh...interesting interpretation.  I wanted to find a movie theater showing ''Miss Congeniality 2'' and photograph that, but no such luck.', '2005-04-13 16:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289293, 166104, 31831, '<td valign="top">Perhaps you thought: If the right side is cropped (doesn''t add much), then the doorway is centered (which is a 1/3 violation)...I like this photo, especially the area above the door. And good details. 7</td>', 'Perhaps you thought: If the right side is cropped (doesn''t add much), then the doorway is centered (which is a 1/3 violation)...I like this photo, especially the area above the door. And good details. 7', '2005-04-13 16:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289298, 165534, 31831, '<td valign="top">Too dark yet a wonderful angle.</td>', 'Too dark yet a wonderful angle.', '2005-04-13 16:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289299, 164984, 34192, '<td valign="top">i''m left wondering the significance of the tree since it takes such a commanding position in this image.  I found the O!</td>', 'i''m left wondering the significance of the tree since it takes such a commanding position in this image.  I found the O!', '2005-04-13 16:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289301, 165687, 35472, '<td valign="top">It''s a great shot, but its a bit noisy and trees are disturbing too much:(</td>', 'It''s a great shot, but its a bit noisy and trees are disturbing too much:(', '2005-04-13 16:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289302, 165800, 31831, '<td valign="top">WOW. How many cans did you buy? ;) 9</td>', 'WOW. How many cans did you buy? ;) 9', '2005-04-13 16:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289307, 163833, 33560, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the contrast between buildings.  When you offer it as a print after winning the challenge, I hope you choose to clone out the pesky wire.  Otherwise this strikes me as being about as good as it gets in this challenge, and there are a lot of very good entries.  Excellent.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I absolutely love the contrast between buildings.  When you offer it as a print after winning the challenge, I hope you choose to clone out the pesky wire.  Otherwise this strikes me as being about as good as it gets in this challenge, and there are a lot of very good entries.  Excellent. ', '2005-04-13 16:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289308, 166077, 31831, '<td valign="top">Like the photo and the frame!</td>', 'Like the photo and the frame!', '2005-04-13 16:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289310, 165679, 35645, '<td valign="top">Great perspective! Good choice of B&amp;W for this shot. Nice lighting.</td>', 'Great perspective! Good choice of B&W for this shot. Nice lighting.', '2005-04-13 16:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289314, 165709, 35645, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition. I love that everything is clear, especially the reflection in the window. Nice colors.</td>', 'Very interesting composition. I love that everything is clear, especially the reflection in the window. Nice colors.', '2005-04-13 16:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289315, 163854, 34763, '<td valign="top">A beuatiful subject, looks like a little blown out in the background. Needs a little more contrast with shadows.</td>', 'A beuatiful subject, looks like a little blown out in the background. Needs a little more contrast with shadows.', '2005-04-13 16:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289316, 166087, 34192, '<td valign="top">really not sure about the title and its relation.  However, this shot drew me to comment on first pass.  I find it interesting and intriguing.  I want to know more - not many of the shots in the challenge lead me there.  What is it?  Why was it abandoned?  The DOF, POV are good.  Not too sure about the crop but I have no idea what oyu were working for.  I think the color/contrast works well.  7 but will pass a second time.</td>', 'really not sure about the title and its relation.  However, this shot drew me to comment on first pass.  I find it interesting and intriguing.  I want to know more - not many of the shots in the challenge lead me there.  What is it?  Why was it abandoned?  The DOF, POV are good.  Not too sure about the crop but I have no idea what oyu were working for.  I think the color/contrast works well.  7 but will pass a second time.', '2005-04-13 16:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289317, 165858, 33515, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and DOF. It could have used a little wider angle to include more of the house. 6</td>', 'Nice contrast and DOF. It could have used a little wider angle to include more of the house. 6', '2005-04-13 16:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289319, 165210, 31831, '<td valign="top">Awesome angle and color.</td>', 'Awesome angle and color.', '2005-04-13 16:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289321, 165336, 35645, '<td valign="top">Good lighting. Interesting viewpoint.</td>', 'Good lighting. Interesting viewpoint.', '2005-04-13 16:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289322, 165721, 33515, '<td valign="top">The colors here are wonderful.</td>', 'The colors here are wonderful.', '2005-04-13 16:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289323, 165792, 34763, '<td valign="top">Bright lively colors but focus and depth of field on building could have been sharper.</td>', 'Bright lively colors but focus and depth of field on building could have been sharper.', '2005-04-13 16:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289327, 165375, 35645, '<td valign="top">Love the color and crispness of this one.</td>', 'Love the color and crispness of this one.', '2005-04-13 16:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289329, 163837, 33515, '<td valign="top">I just don''t get the feeling of any thing abandoned</td>', 'I just don''t get the feeling of any thing abandoned', '2005-04-13 16:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289331, 164865, 9576, '<td valign="top">Hardly  Abandoned ?</td>', 'Hardly  Abandoned ?', '2005-04-13 16:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289332, 166106, 35472, '<td valign="top">why B&amp;W? it''s beautiful, but it has obvious lack of colours. still 7</td>', 'why B&W? it''s beautiful, but it has obvious lack of colours. still 7', '2005-04-13 16:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289333, 163769, 31831, '<td valign="top">Like the details at the top/side. The light at end is a bit harsh (distracting).</td>', 'Like the details at the top/side. The light at end is a bit harsh (distracting).', '2005-04-13 16:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289337, 165801, 6999, '<td valign="top">The contrivance of this reminds me of the work of Boyd Webb. It has that superb technical finesse - and that is seriously meant, as this is impeccable - but it seems ... well, to <i>remove</i> meaning from it, rather than to add it. A matter of personal taste only, but there you have it.</td>', 'The contrivance of this reminds me of the work of Boyd Webb. It has that superb technical finesse - and that is seriously meant, as this is impeccable - but it seems ... well, to remove meaning from it, rather than to add it. A matter of personal taste only, but there you have it.', '2005-04-13 16:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289338, 164350, 36357, '<td valign="top">BW here would make this shot outstanding. . otherwise, nice shot</td>', 'BW here would make this shot outstanding. . otherwise, nice shot', '2005-04-13 16:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289341, 164854, 34763, '<td valign="top">Great subject. Sun glare on and thru tree too distractive. Sky blown out too much. This photo has a lot of possibilities with more contrast. Good selection</td>', 'Great subject. Sun glare on and thru tree too distractive. Sky blown out too much. This photo has a lot of possibilities with more contrast. Good selection', '2005-04-13 17:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289342, 165389, 23053, '<td valign="top">Great texture and striking color.</td>', 'Great texture and striking color.', '2005-04-13 17:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289345, 165671, 36357, '<td valign="top">Branches in foreground seem to distract</td>', 'Branches in foreground seem to distract', '2005-04-13 17:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289346, 164828, 33560, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  First, it''s a landscape shot with a building in it.  Next, it''s titled ''silent sentry'' which suggests habitation....  Well, never mind.  I like the strong lighting.  I like the composition.  I like the building and its placement in the photo.</td>', 'Hmm.  First, it''s a landscape shot with a building in it.  Next, it''s titled ''silent sentry'' which suggests habitation....  Well, never mind.  I like the strong lighting.  I like the composition.  I like the building and its placement in the photo.', '2005-04-13 17:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289347, 163918, 33515, '<td valign="top">Not feeling it, lack of focus as well.</td>', 'Not feeling it, lack of focus as well.', '2005-04-13 17:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289348, 164281, 31831, '<td valign="top">Reverse DOF? Like the lines too.</td>', 'Reverse DOF? Like the lines too.', '2005-04-13 17:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289350, 164051, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is awesome!    What interesting composition this is.    You''ve accomplished a lot in making one of 498 abandoned buildings really stand out!  I love it!</td>', 'Wow!  This is awesome!    What interesting composition this is.    You''ve accomplished a lot in making one of 498 abandoned buildings really stand out!  I love it!', '2005-04-13 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289354, 165336, 34763, '<td valign="top">great selection. Subdue the glare from the door so it doesn''t lighten the inside of the door jam and you will have a great photo.</td>', 'great selection. Subdue the glare from the door so it doesn''t lighten the inside of the door jam and you will have a great photo.', '2005-04-13 17:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289356, 166055, 31831, '<td valign="top">Another angle? Would like to see more of the building.</td>', 'Another angle? Would like to see more of the building.', '2005-04-13 17:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289357, 164657, 2775, '<td valign="top">Awesome...</td>', 'Awesome...', '2005-04-13 17:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289359, 164657, 21714, '<td valign="top">Totally out of this world shot. The contrast between the forreground and background is amazing and you have done an excellent job to bring that out in this image. I also love the fine details in this one. Well done.</td>', 'Totally out of this world shot. The contrast between the forreground and background is amazing and you have done an excellent job to bring that out in this image. I also love the fine details in this one. Well done.', '2005-04-13 17:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289360, 165674, 33379, '<td valign="top">great shot!!</td>', 'great shot!!', '2005-04-13 17:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289363, 163910, 33379, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2005-04-13 17:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289364, 164370, 31831, '<td valign="top">Terrific 8</td>', 'Terrific 8', '2005-04-13 17:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289366, 165693, 33379, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2005-04-13 17:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289367, 164160, 34763, '<td valign="top">Great feeling of an old photo from the depression era. Color great and soft appearance adds to old look. Well done.</td>', 'Great feeling of an old photo from the depression era. Color great and soft appearance adds to old look. Well done.', '2005-04-13 17:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289368, 164385, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!    I love the way you have it cropped.   The building itself, even tho its abndoned and rundown, it''s architecture is so interesting and appealing.  I love it!!!</td>', 'This is awesome!    I love the way you have it cropped.   The building itself, even tho its abndoned and rundown, it''s architecture is so interesting and appealing.  I love it!!!', '2005-04-13 17:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289369, 164980, 31831, '<td valign="top">Quite a bit of noise, ghosts? Framing is good.</td>', 'Quite a bit of noise, ghosts? Framing is good.', '2005-04-13 17:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289370, 166017, 32754, '<td valign="top">That purple tone doesn''t seem to help this picture..maybe if the the green weren''t there to compete..?  Just a thought: maybe if the lavender were less saturated?</td>', 'That purple tone doesn''t seem to help this picture..maybe if the the green weren''t there to compete..?  Just a thought: maybe if the lavender were less saturated?', '2005-04-13 17:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289372, 165968, 23053, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred this image with the trees cropped out above the wall.</td>', 'I think I would have preferred this image with the trees cropped out above the wall.', '2005-04-13 17:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289373, 164988, 31831, '<td valign="top">Closer crop would provide more detail.</td>', 'Closer crop would provide more detail.', '2005-04-13 17:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289375, 164633, 21714, '<td valign="top">Not really sure about how the person has been captured here, but the surroundings are totally awesome. There''s a very rich quality to this image. I love the way his jacket and shoes have come out. It''s only facial expression that I am a bit unsure about. Overall, good job.</td>', 'Not really sure about how the person has been captured here, but the surroundings are totally awesome. There''s a very rich quality to this image. I love the way his jacket and shoes have come out. It''s only facial expression that I am a bit unsure about. Overall, good job.', '2005-04-13 17:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289378, 165481, 34763, '<td valign="top">looks in good condition. Is it abandoned or just not used every day? Colors and setting very good.</td>', 'looks in good condition. Is it abandoned or just not used every day? Colors and setting very good.', '2005-04-13 17:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289379, 166136, 31831, '<td valign="top">Range on the home? Good clarity, would like to see more.</td>', 'Range on the home? Good clarity, would like to see more.', '2005-04-13 17:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289382, 164990, 21714, '<td valign="top">There''s a nice balance of colours in this one. I love the blues and reds in this one. Composition wise, I am not too sure, but there''s something rather magical about this shot.</td>', 'There''s a nice balance of colours in this one. I love the blues and reds in this one. Composition wise, I am not too sure, but there''s something rather magical about this shot.', '2005-04-13 17:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
