(1289662, 164840, 21375, '<td valign="top">Great DOF</td>', 'Great DOF', '2005-04-13 18:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289663, 166097, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is interesting, the white contrast with the rusty tin roof.   I like the way the color in the grass compliments the rusty roof.   I think your picture stands out.  Quite an acomplishment with 498 entries, right??   :)   Good job!</td>', 'This is interesting, the white contrast with the rusty tin roof.   I like the way the color in the grass compliments the rusty roof.   I think your picture stands out.  Quite an acomplishment with 498 entries, right??   :)   Good job!', '2005-04-13 18:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289664, 164657, 16230, '<td valign="top">Very well done! This one should do well.</td>', 'Very well done! This one should do well.', '2005-04-13 18:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289666, 164735, 21375, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t ya just love to hear the stories those old walls could tell?  Great scenery.  Good job.</td>', 'Wouldn''t ya just love to hear the stories those old walls could tell?  Great scenery.  Good job.', '2005-04-13 18:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289668, 166104, 21375, '<td valign="top">You have captured the subject (abandoned) extremely well.  The building even appears to be "sad".  Good job.  Love the coloring.</td>', 'You have captured the subject (abandoned) extremely well.  The building even appears to be "sad".  Good job.  Love the coloring.', '2005-04-13 18:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289670, 165496, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmygoodness. . . who could abandon such a COOL HOUSE!!!   Makes me wish I had a million dollars and could buy it and restore it.    Can''t you just see a porch swing, cute curtains in the windows and flowers in the front yard???    This is awesome!   This abndoned building stands out -- even amongst 498 entries and me with Clicker''s cramp from voting so long  :)    Excellent choice for your composition!   And very well done!  10</td>', 'Ohmygoodness. . . who could abandon such a COOL HOUSE!!!   Makes me wish I had a million dollars and could buy it and restore it.    Can''t you just see a porch swing, cute curtains in the windows and flowers in the front yard???    This is awesome!   This abndoned building stands out -- even amongst 498 entries and me with Clicker''s cramp from voting so long  :)    Excellent choice for your composition!   And very well done!  10', '2005-04-13 18:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289676, 165206, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a cool looking building!    I love the way you have cropped it too.   Also, the tiny red door gives you a persepctive of how big the building really is.   I love it.   Good job!!</td>', 'What a cool looking building!    I love the way you have cropped it too.   Also, the tiny red door gives you a persepctive of how big the building really is.   I love it.   Good job!!', '2005-04-13 18:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289678, 164869, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a picturesque scene -- in an abandoned building sort of way  :)    The water really adds interest to your picture, and so does the contrasting red color of the house.   I love it!!!!</td>', 'What a picturesque scene -- in an abandoned building sort of way  :)    The water really adds interest to your picture, and so does the contrasting red color of the house.   I love it!!!!', '2005-04-13 18:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289680, 165029, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  It''s hard to imagine someone abandoning that COOL building!   I want it!!!   And it''s on such neat land too!    I love this one.</td>', 'Wow!  It''s hard to imagine someone abandoning that COOL building!   I want it!!!   And it''s on such neat land too!    I love this one.', '2005-04-13 18:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289681, 165176, 21375, '<td valign="top">I like your use of the tracks to "pull" the viewer into the photo.</td>', 'I like your use of the tracks to "pull" the viewer into the photo.', '2005-04-13 18:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289683, 165971, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really like the "Posted" sign on the door.   It gives you the feeling of there being a story behind that house that used to belong to someone.   I like your crop too.</td>', 'I really like the "Posted" sign on the door.   It gives you the feeling of there being a story behind that house that used to belong to someone.   I like your crop too.', '2005-04-13 18:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289684, 164953, 33560, '<td valign="top">Sometimes it seems that this is the direction in which the world is headed.  First, it''s permanent stone construction designed to last a thousand years.  Next it''s wood construction designed to last a hundred. Finally it''s metal construction designed to last until it''s built, almost.  This triumph of the cheap, disfunctional, and ephemeral over the beautiful and permanent seems too often to be the essense of ''progress.''   Capturing the progress of this march as documented by buildings, I find very interesting.  Nice work.</td>', 'Sometimes it seems that this is the direction in which the world is headed.  First, it''s permanent stone construction designed to last a thousand years.  Next it''s wood construction designed to last a hundred. Finally it''s metal construction designed to last until it''s built, almost.  This triumph of the cheap, disfunctional, and ephemeral over the beautiful and permanent seems too often to be the essense of ''progress.''   Capturing the progress of this march as documented by buildings, I find very interesting.  Nice work.', '2005-04-13 18:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289685, 164827, 34778, '<td valign="top">its really dark</td>', 'its really dark', '2005-04-13 18:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289686, 164779, 16230, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... I think someone else entered a photo of this same building. Anyway, you did a good job. The birds add a nice touch.</td>', 'Hmmm... I think someone else entered a photo of this same building. Anyway, you did a good job. The birds add a nice touch.', '2005-04-13 18:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289687, 165053, 21375, '<td valign="top">My eyes went immediately to the tall brick building and wondered what was abandoned, and then I noticed the structure at the bottom.  I don''t know how ya would fix it, but it seems that the "center of attention" is not the "abandoned" building.</td>', 'My eyes went immediately to the tall brick building and wondered what was abandoned, and then I noticed the structure at the bottom.  I don''t know how ya would fix it, but it seems that the "center of attention" is not the "abandoned" building.', '2005-04-13 18:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
