(1289801, 165129, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice subject. I like the tone of the shot. I like how you''ve got the barrell and tree in the foreground, it adds some interest to the shot. I think you''ve chosen a nice composition here. Works pretty good. Just a tiny nitpick, I wish the top peak weren''t cut off, bit I don''t feel it is a major problem at all, very minor. Good job.</td>', 'Nice subject. I like the tone of the shot. I like how you''ve got the barrell and tree in the foreground, it adds some interest to the shot. I think you''ve chosen a nice composition here. Works pretty good. Just a tiny nitpick, I wish the top peak weren''t cut off, bit I don''t feel it is a major problem at all, very minor. Good job.', '2005-04-13 19:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
