(1289846, 164725, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very nice! I like this shot a lot. Interesting little subject, simple and uncluttered by any distraction. Great focus. The slant of the shed is great. It looks like it could collapse at any moment, and it makes for nice lines opposing the angle of the straight roof. The weeds are cool. Their color is pleasing and is a great compliment to the colors and texture of the wood on the shed. They also match the angle of the slant of the shed, extending those lines. Makes for a nice trail for the eye to follow. Good job.</td>', 'Very nice! I like this shot a lot. Interesting little subject, simple and uncluttered by any distraction. Great focus. The slant of the shed is great. It looks like it could collapse at any moment, and it makes for nice lines opposing the angle of the straight roof. The weeds are cool. Their color is pleasing and is a great compliment to the colors and texture of the wood on the shed. They also match the angle of the slant of the shed, extending those lines. Makes for a nice trail for the eye to follow. Good job.', '2005-04-13 19:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289847, 165736, 21714, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.</td>', 'Very nice composition.', '2005-04-13 19:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
