(1289867, 165971, 23141, '<td valign="top">I like this picture, but I find the twigs in the foreground distracting.  Your contrast seems a bit off - the picture is murky.  I don''t like the perfect glass globe amidst all the decay.  The thing I find most interesting in this picture is the ironwork on the door.  Perhaps a different composition would help that stand out more.</td>', 'I like this picture, but I find the twigs in the foreground distracting.  Your contrast seems a bit off - the picture is murky.  I don''t like the perfect glass globe amidst all the decay.  The thing I find most interesting in this picture is the ironwork on the door.  Perhaps a different composition would help that stand out more.', '2005-04-13 19:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
