(1289900, 165946, 35513, '<td valign="top">I know this may seem to literal, but I would like this picture better if it was actually of a building.  However, the photograph itself is of good quality.</td>', 'I know this may seem to literal, but I would like this picture better if it was actually of a building.  However, the photograph itself is of good quality.', '2005-04-13 19:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
