(1289906, 165630, 31738, '<td valign="top">I think a closer view would of made it more interesting.</td>', 'I think a closer view would of made it more interesting.', '2005-04-13 19:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289907, 165661, 35513, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this picture.  I love the white spots on the wall that are picked up by the light coming through the doorway.</td>', 'I really enjoy this picture.  I love the white spots on the wall that are picked up by the light coming through the doorway.', '2005-04-13 19:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289914, 166054, 31738, '<td valign="top">I feel that maybe this would look better in color then in b&amp;w. The main focus of this challenge is the colors and texture of the ruins.</td>', 'I feel that maybe this would look better in color then in b&w. The main focus of this challenge is the colors and texture of the ruins.', '2005-04-13 19:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289917, 166123, 35513, '<td valign="top">A few more minutes into the sunset and I think that this would have been a truly gorgeous picture!  Why is it always so hard for the sun to be where you want it to?? :-)</td>', 'A few more minutes into the sunset and I think that this would have been a truly gorgeous picture!  Why is it always so hard for the sun to be where you want it to?? :-)', '2005-04-13 19:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289918, 164700, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the quality of this pic, but the tree seems to be the focal center, rather than the abandoned building, which we don''t see much of.</td>', 'I like the quality of this pic, but the tree seems to be the focal center, rather than the abandoned building, which we don''t see much of.', '2005-04-13 19:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289919, 165426, 35169, '<td valign="top">Of course I don''t know what the obstacles were,  but maybe if you cropped with a part the green tree at the edge of the frame it would feel more balence and be more dynamic.  Great ruins, excellent detail and color</td>', 'Of course I don''t know what the obstacles were,  but maybe if you cropped with a part the green tree at the edge of the frame it would feel more balence and be more dynamic.  Great ruins, excellent detail and color', '2005-04-13 19:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289920, 165231, 26526, '<td valign="top">Like the subdued tone of this photograph. Great perspective.</td>', 'Like the subdued tone of this photograph. Great perspective.', '2005-04-13 19:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289921, 164583, 6999, '<td valign="top">Detail and basic exposure is good here. You might usefully consider some ideas of composition, and simplicity of subject matter, I think.</td>', 'Detail and basic exposure is good here. You might usefully consider some ideas of composition, and simplicity of subject matter, I think.', '2005-04-13 19:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289922, 166012, 35513, '<td valign="top">I love the mood of this picture.  Very dark and forlorn.</td>', 'I love the mood of this picture.  Very dark and forlorn.', '2005-04-13 19:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289923, 164947, 35169, '<td valign="top">very suttle, i like it.</td>', 'very suttle, i like it.', '2005-04-13 19:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289924, 165222, 31738, '<td valign="top">I feel that maybe this would look better in color then in b&amp;w. The main focus of this challenge is the colors and texture of the ruins. &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'I feel that maybe this would look better in color then in b&w. The main focus of this challenge is the colors and texture of the ruins. <5>', '2005-04-13 19:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289926, 165038, 36060, '<td valign="top">Very good shot indeed.</td>', 'Very good shot indeed.', '2005-04-13 19:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289927, 165651, 35513, '<td valign="top">Picture quality is what''s hurting here.</td>', 'Picture quality is what''s hurting here.', '2005-04-13 19:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289928, 165505, 23141, '<td valign="top">I like this picture - that red roof really sticks in my mind.  I like the posts sticking up from the snow.  I don''t like the border...  a bit too distracting.  Something plainer would have framed your picture better, I think, and I don''t like how the border overlaps the posts and the corner of the smaller building.  Let it breathe!  :)  Straightening the horizon would improve the image, too.</td>', 'I like this picture - that red roof really sticks in my mind.  I like the posts sticking up from the snow.  I don''t like the border...  a bit too distracting.  Something plainer would have framed your picture better, I think, and I don''t like how the border overlaps the posts and the corner of the smaller building.  Let it breathe!  :)  Straightening the horizon would improve the image, too.', '2005-04-13 19:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289929, 165226, 26526, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. Tone a little dark. Perhaps a green tint to fit your title?</td>', 'Great perspective. Tone a little dark. Perhaps a green tint to fit your title?', '2005-04-13 19:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289935, 164198, 31738, '<td valign="top">I would of liked this if it was closer but I do like the way the island stands out from the rest because of this difference in colors. Good luck. &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'I would of liked this if it was closer but I do like the way the island stands out from the rest because of this difference in colors. Good luck. <6>', '2005-04-13 19:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289937, 165379, 35169, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot. More color and light may have been better.  some of the image is lost in the forground for it.  I still like it alot</td>', 'beautiful shot. More color and light may have been better.  some of the image is lost in the forground for it.  I still like it alot', '2005-04-13 19:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289938, 164584, 6999, '<td valign="top">Light - that''s what lets this down. It could, in my view, be less over-exposed (this looks like what the makers of cameras think is an OK exposure), and the angle of light to your subject, an essential for communicating any sense of depth, of texture. This is obviously a fine subject for the challenge - but this presentation of it does it no favours</td>', 'Light - that''s what lets this down. It could, in my view, be less over-exposed (this looks like what the makers of cameras think is an OK exposure), and the angle of light to your subject, an essential for communicating any sense of depth, of texture. This is obviously a fine subject for the challenge - but this presentation of it does it no favours', '2005-04-13 19:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289939, 166124, 31738, '<td valign="top">Nice colors here. Spooky place to be.</td>', 'Nice colors here. Spooky place to be.', '2005-04-13 19:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289940, 166017, 23141, '<td valign="top">A strange purple and green combination.  You may have been better off choosing black and white on this one ;)</td>', 'A strange purple and green combination.  You may have been better off choosing black and white on this one ;)', '2005-04-13 19:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289942, 164438, 35169, '<td valign="top">forcus is too much in the foreground and makes it difficult to focus my eyes on the rest ofo the image.</td>', 'forcus is too much in the foreground and makes it difficult to focus my eyes on the rest ofo the image.', '2005-04-13 19:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289945, 165414, 35169, '<td valign="top">You met the challenge on this one.  peeling paper and details, color tone, good job</td>', 'You met the challenge on this one.  peeling paper and details, color tone, good job', '2005-04-13 19:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289946, 164273, 36060, '<td valign="top">Great shot</td>', 'Great shot', '2005-04-13 19:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289947, 164971, 23141, '<td valign="top">Looks like you ran into the same problem I did - what line to square the image up by when the whole building is caddywhompus?  I like this picture, a lot.  However, the roof line not levelling with the frame is distracting to me.  I''d like to see greater saturation, too!</td>', 'Looks like you ran into the same problem I did - what line to square the image up by when the whole building is caddywhompus?  I like this picture, a lot.  However, the roof line not levelling with the frame is distracting to me.  I''d like to see greater saturation, too!', '2005-04-13 19:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289949, 166012, 35169, '<td valign="top">love it, how elegant a portrayal. one of the best in the B&amp;W''s in this challenge</td>', 'love it, how elegant a portrayal. one of the best in the B&W''s in this challenge', '2005-04-13 20:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1289950, 165733, 23141, '<td valign="top">I know death happens, but I bet a lot of folks here won''t be into this...</td>', 'I know death happens, but I bet a lot of folks here won''t be into this...', '2005-04-13 20:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
