(1290099, 164286, 33947, '<td valign="top">Excellent light through window and on plants in foreground. Good contrast, realistic color, and sharp. Nice tight composition.</td>', 'Excellent light through window and on plants in foreground. Good contrast, realistic color, and sharp. Nice tight composition.', '2005-04-13 21:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
