(1290740, 165983, 35169, '<td valign="top">Should be about the buildings, not about the sunset.  Its a beautiful image, the sunset makes it.</td>', 'Should be about the buildings, not about the sunset.  Its a beautiful image, the sunset makes it.', '2005-04-14 01:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
