(1290818, 165236, 35513, '<td valign="top">Because of the focus on the wood,  I''m not really sure what I''m supposed to be looking at.  I think I would have preferred it if the focus was on the brick or the tree roots instead.  Or perhaps a shot from farther back that encapsulated more of the structure.</td>', 'Because of the focus on the wood,  I''m not really sure what I''m supposed to be looking at.  I think I would have preferred it if the focus was on the brick or the tree roots instead.  Or perhaps a shot from farther back that encapsulated more of the structure.', '2005-04-14 02:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
