(1290822, 165498, 20168, '<td valign="top">Flat composition without a lot of visual appeal except for the lovely contrasting colors.  Perhaps an angle which shows the barn next to the empty tree and empty sky, thrusting its roofline upwards...?</td>', 'Flat composition without a lot of visual appeal except for the lovely contrasting colors.  Perhaps an angle which shows the barn next to the empty tree and empty sky, thrusting its roofline upwards...?', '2005-04-14 02:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
