(1290841, 165363, 20168, '<td valign="top">Small size photo.  The top corner cut off in the crop is distracting to my eye.  There must be an intimate story in this midst of this huge building which would point us to the former glory of the place.  Sky needs some clouds to give this story a more interesting backdrop.</td>', 'Small size photo.  The top corner cut off in the crop is distracting to my eye.  There must be an intimate story in this midst of this huge building which would point us to the former glory of the place.  Sky needs some clouds to give this story a more interesting backdrop.', '2005-04-14 02:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
