(1290849, 165748, 35513, '<td valign="top">I love this pic.  What an adorable little structure!!  I love the plants that are growing between the rocks.  And the image itself is nice and clear.  The photographer has done a good job letting the building speak for itself.</td>', 'I love this pic.  What an adorable little structure!!  I love the plants that are growing between the rocks.  And the image itself is nice and clear.  The photographer has done a good job letting the building speak for itself.', '2005-04-14 02:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
