(1290948, 165998, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good subject, though framing it so very tightly leaves little sense of context and is inclined to make it just another ruined house shot. Control of light on the building, light and shade is good; a shame about the over-exposed sky''s colour and very bright foreground - but those damn basic rules ...</td>', 'Good subject, though framing it so very tightly leaves little sense of context and is inclined to make it just another ruined house shot. Control of light on the building, light and shade is good; a shame about the over-exposed sky''s colour and very bright foreground - but those damn basic rules ...', '2005-04-14 04:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1290951, 164647, 26526, '<td valign="top">Great composition with the fire escape to the right. Just enough bright blue sky to lend color to an otherwise drab brick building.</td>', 'Great composition with the fire escape to the right. Just enough bright blue sky to lend color to an otherwise drab brick building.', '2005-04-14 04:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1290952, 166027, 32117, '<td valign="top">good<br/>the nude trees in the foreground add to the effect</td>', 'goodthe nude trees in the foreground add to the effect', '2005-04-14 04:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1290953, 165770, 26526, '<td valign="top">Like the warm colors used in this photograph. Excellent perspective and composition. Softer focus works well. Looks old and abandoned.</td>', 'Like the warm colors used in this photograph. Excellent perspective and composition. Softer focus works well. Looks old and abandoned.', '2005-04-14 04:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1290954, 165254, 6999, '<td valign="top">A more interesting composition than many. Some odd noise along the shop-front, almost like you''ve lightened that area. Like the use of the tree shadow in foreground.</td>', 'A more interesting composition than many. Some odd noise along the shop-front, almost like you''ve lightened that area. Like the use of the tree shadow in foreground.', '2005-04-14 04:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1290957, 166102, 26526, '<td valign="top">Like how this castle is lighted from within. Very interesting perspective used on the outside walls.</td>', 'Like how this castle is lighted from within. Very interesting perspective used on the outside walls.', '2005-04-14 04:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1290958, 164370, 6999, '<td valign="top">Is the toning perhaps a little heavy? Together with what feels like a heavily reduced dynamic range - all midtones, and few highlights or real shadow - it sems like an attempt to reproduce the feel of aged photographs; which point I get, though I wonder if the effect hasn''t removed too much of the sense of detail I would want to see in a very straightforward ''portrait'' like this.</td>', 'Is the toning perhaps a little heavy? Together with what feels like a heavily reduced dynamic range - all midtones, and few highlights or real shadow - it sems like an attempt to reproduce the feel of aged photographs; which point I get, though I wonder if the effect hasn''t removed too much of the sense of detail I would want to see in a very straightforward ''portrait'' like this.', '2005-04-14 04:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1290959, 165693, 32117, '<td valign="top">hey the rich colors are taking about the worn out look!<br/>while d street light masts are taking away that seclusion that d photograph needed</td>', 'hey the rich colors are taking about the worn out look!while d street light masts are taking away that seclusion that d photograph needed', '2005-04-14 04:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1290960, 166012, 36060, '<td valign="top">Very good shot indeed.</td>', 'Very good shot indeed.', '2005-04-14 04:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1290963, 165379, 6999, '<td valign="top">I would personally have waited until that little cloud had passed, as it could easily be taken for smoke from that chimney. Kind of harsh light - I don''t see much detail in the shadow areas without forcing the brightness of my screen. Good strong simple composition.</td>', 'I would personally have waited until that little cloud had passed, as it could easily be taken for smoke from that chimney. Kind of harsh light - I don''t see much detail in the shadow areas without forcing the brightness of my screen. Good strong simple composition.', '2005-04-14 04:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1290967, 165770, 6999, '<td valign="top">You should get points at least for not providing a simple portrait of the building. It''s reasonably easy to see your intent here, I believe - good deep depth of field and that succession of doorways; but I feel that the light and shade through those doorways doesn''t help to distinguish each from the other - and no doubt the basic rules aren''t helping you here either.</td>', 'You should get points at least for not providing a simple portrait of the building. It''s reasonably easy to see your intent here, I believe - good deep depth of field and that succession of doorways; but I feel that the light and shade through those doorways doesn''t help to distinguish each from the other - and no doubt the basic rules aren''t helping you here either.', '2005-04-14 04:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1290969, 166047, 26526, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and color. Like the title. Bumping it up to 8.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and color. Like the title. Bumping it up to 8.', '2005-04-14 04:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1290971, 164214, 26526, '<td valign="top">Dramatic color and pov. Like the stormy sky. Title fits.</td>', 'Dramatic color and pov. Like the stormy sky. Title fits.', '2005-04-14 04:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
