(1290988, 164717, 26526, '<td valign="top">Nice color use. Good composition. It is a very busy photograph with growing vegetation everywhere. I found that somewhat distracting from the abandoned building.</td>', 'Nice color use. Good composition. It is a very busy photograph with growing vegetation everywhere. I found that somewhat distracting from the abandoned building.', '2005-04-14 05:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
