(1290996, 166018, 26526, '<td valign="top">A nice photograph. Like the color. Nothing stood out in this photograph to grab my attention. Why the lower score. Keep trying!</td>', 'A nice photograph. Like the color. Nothing stood out in this photograph to grab my attention. Why the lower score. Keep trying!', '2005-04-14 05:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
