(1291119, 166091, 24951, '<td valign="top">Too bad the car is there 7</td>', 'Too bad the car is there 7', '2005-04-14 08:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291122, 165795, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation of the challenge.  I find the photo to be a little on the dark side and a bit to much USM.  That is not a bad thing tho because I find it adds a certain uniqueness to this photo.  The trees in the front are very distracting and altho the photo itself doesn''t suggest abandoned it is above average from what I have seen in this challenge.  I just noticed as well that it appears to be off level but that could be the angle of the shot. either way well done and good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice interpretation of the challenge.  I find the photo to be a little on the dark side and a bit to much USM.  That is not a bad thing tho because I find it adds a certain uniqueness to this photo.  The trees in the front are very distracting and altho the photo itself doesn''t suggest abandoned it is above average from what I have seen in this challenge.  I just noticed as well that it appears to be off level but that could be the angle of the shot. either way well done and good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-14 08:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291124, 165427, 34059, '<td valign="top">it doesn''t look abandoned, and i don''t like the eye fish look...</td>', 'it doesn''t look abandoned, and i don''t like the eye fish look...', '2005-04-14 08:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291125, 164827, 34852, '<td valign="top">I like the effect of the hat in the spot light.</td>', 'I like the effect of the hat in the spot light.', '2005-04-14 08:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291126, 166027, 25390, '<td valign="top">nice photoshop work</td>', 'nice photoshop work', '2005-04-14 08:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291129, 165770, 14671, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this appears to me more like a ruin then an abandoned building.  The photo itself looks a little OoF but that could be due to the contrast.  I think it may have also looked better if the shot was from straight on(centered) and didn''t lean to the right at the top of the photo.  Good luck with this challenge.</td>', 'In my opinion this appears to me more like a ruin then an abandoned building.  The photo itself looks a little OoF but that could be due to the contrast.  I think it may have also looked better if the shot was from straight on(centered) and didn''t lean to the right at the top of the photo.  Good luck with this challenge.', '2005-04-14 08:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291132, 164382, 34059, '<td valign="top">sorry, I can''t see the abandoned building and I can''t understand what the "dog" is about</td>', 'sorry, I can''t see the abandoned building and I can''t understand what the "dog" is about', '2005-04-14 08:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291133, 166010, 14671, '<td valign="top">I''m not fond of the angle of this shot.  I find it makes the photo look lop sided or unbalanced.  The wires in the shot also are also very distracting and the photo generally looks more like a snap shot the a planned shot.  Perhaps a more thought out subject would have scored better in this challenge.  good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m not fond of the angle of this shot.  I find it makes the photo look lop sided or unbalanced.  The wires in the shot also are also very distracting and the photo generally looks more like a snap shot the a planned shot.  Perhaps a more thought out subject would have scored better in this challenge.  good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-14 08:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291135, 166117, 14671, '<td valign="top">The contrast in this photo has made it look a little OoF.  I also find that there is something blurry in the bottom right corner that is very distracting.  Perhaps this building shot from a different angle would have done better for my vote.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'The contrast in this photo has made it look a little OoF.  I also find that there is something blurry in the bottom right corner that is very distracting.  Perhaps this building shot from a different angle would have done better for my vote.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-14 08:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291138, 166038, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W conversion but the contrast from the sky is overpowering the photo. It adds a blurry hue.  The photo itself isn'' level which would suggest that you need to watch the level of your camera when shooting or rotate the image in processing.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice B&W conversion but the contrast from the sky is overpowering the photo. It adds a blurry hue.  The photo itself isn'' level which would suggest that you need to watch the level of your camera when shooting or rotate the image in processing.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-14 08:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291141, 165805, 14671, '<td valign="top">A very unique entry into this challenge I personally don''t like the figure in the picture altho it is well done, I find it more distracting then its worth.  The angle of the photo looks off as well.  Great room tho for this challenge.   Well done and good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'A very unique entry into this challenge I personally don''t like the figure in the picture altho it is well done, I find it more distracting then its worth.  The angle of the photo looks off as well.  Great room tho for this challenge.   Well done and good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-14 08:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291145, 164540, 34059, '<td valign="top">too small and out of focus</td>', 'too small and out of focus', '2005-04-14 08:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291147, 166133, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but doesn''t have any uniqueness to it.  I also find it lacks clarity probably because of the trees.  Good luck with this challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot but doesn''t have any uniqueness to it.  I also find it lacks clarity probably because of the trees.  Good luck with this challenge.', '2005-04-14 08:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291148, 164062, 34059, '<td valign="top">it''s a pity it''s too dark</td>', 'it''s a pity it''s too dark', '2005-04-14 08:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291152, 165969, 14671, '<td valign="top">Image size is key and in my opinion this is way to small.  I also find that it appears to be blurry or OoF but that may be caused by the photo size being crunched down to this small.  Personally I would have cropped about .5 inches from the right side to remove that railing on the bottom right as wel as the white corner on the top right.  I find these two things are very distracting and don''t need to be in the photo.  Perhaps reading the thread on photo processing have help with your resizing issue.  Good luck with this challenge.</td>', 'Image size is key and in my opinion this is way to small.  I also find that it appears to be blurry or OoF but that may be caused by the photo size being crunched down to this small.  Personally I would have cropped about .5 inches from the right side to remove that railing on the bottom right as wel as the white corner on the top right.  I find these two things are very distracting and don''t need to be in the photo.  Perhaps reading the thread on photo processing have help with your resizing issue.  Good luck with this challenge.', '2005-04-14 08:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291155, 165237, 34059, '<td valign="top">why is this abandoned? i can see electricity, clean pillows...</td>', 'why is this abandoned? i can see electricity, clean pillows...', '2005-04-14 09:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291158, 165526, 14671, '<td valign="top">Good shot and probably one of a kind for this challenge but I''m just not ond of the shot.  I looks like an insurance adjusters shot for a payout and the only reason it is abandoned is because it cannot be lived in at this moment.  Excellent colors and clarity tho.  Good luck in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Bump up score</td>', 'Good shot and probably one of a kind for this challenge but I''m just not ond of the shot.  I looks like an insurance adjusters shot for a payout and the only reason it is abandoned is because it cannot be lived in at this moment.  Excellent colors and clarity tho.  Good luck in this challenge. Bump up score', '2005-04-14 09:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291163, 166002, 14671, '<td valign="top">The whole photo is leaning top right and is very distracting.  I also find the pole in the front to be unnecessary and out of place.  Perhaps a rotation of 1 or 2 degrees ccw and a B&amp;W conversion may have helped this photo out.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'The whole photo is leaning top right and is very distracting.  I also find the pole in the front to be unnecessary and out of place.  Perhaps a rotation of 1 or 2 degrees ccw and a B&W conversion may have helped this photo out.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-14 09:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291166, 165893, 14671, '<td valign="top">With the foreground being so OoF I makes it very hard to see what it was focusing on in the background.  A great technique but in this shot it didn''t work out.  Perhaps a tripod would have made the difference if one wasn''t used.  It may have also looked better if it was centered.  Good luck with this challenge.</td>', 'With the foreground being so OoF I makes it very hard to see what it was focusing on in the background.  A great technique but in this shot it didn''t work out.  Perhaps a tripod would have made the difference if one wasn''t used.  It may have also looked better if it was centered.  Good luck with this challenge.', '2005-04-14 09:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291170, 166076, 14671, '<td valign="top">Too much zoom.  When zooming in like this from a distance will cause the photo to be a sligt bit OoF.  I also find there to be to much green and lacking clarity which again could be due to the distance from which the shot was taken from.    Perhaps a tripod and a tighter crop would have made for a nicer photo.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'Too much zoom.  When zooming in like this from a distance will cause the photo to be a sligt bit OoF.  I also find there to be to much green and lacking clarity which again could be due to the distance from which the shot was taken from.    Perhaps a tripod and a tighter crop would have made for a nicer photo.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-14 09:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291172, 166099, 14671, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  The contrast may be a little on the bright side but the photo appears to be well thought out and very well planed.  One of the nicest photos I have seen yet in this challenge.  Excellent clarity and nce B&amp;W conversion.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Great shot.  The contrast may be a little on the bright side but the photo appears to be well thought out and very well planed.  One of the nicest photos I have seen yet in this challenge.  Excellent clarity and nce B&W conversion.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  <9>', '2005-04-14 09:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291177, 165733, 14671, '<td valign="top">Took me a sec. to understand the point of the photo and I doubt you ill score very hi in this challenge but most definiately a unique perspective on this challenge.  Excellent clarity and contrast and love the B&amp;W conversion.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;9&gt;  My highest scoring photo yet.  congrats.</td>', 'Took me a sec. to understand the point of the photo and I doubt you ill score very hi in this challenge but most definiately a unique perspective on this challenge.  Excellent clarity and contrast and love the B&W conversion.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  <9>  My highest scoring photo yet.  congrats.', '2005-04-14 09:19:27.000000', NULL, 1);
