(1291178, 164943, 14735, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I think I woul;d have liked it better if you increased the contrast. Using curves you can get greater seperstion of light and dark. Just me. 6</td>', 'Nice shot but I think I woul;d have liked it better if you increased the contrast. Using curves you can get greater seperstion of light and dark. Just me. 6', '2005-04-14 09:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291182, 165781, 25095, '<td valign="top">nice first entry but I feel it is the wrong challenge.  This is supposed to be abandoned buildings...again nice image though.</td>', 'nice first entry but I feel it is the wrong challenge.  This is supposed to be abandoned buildings...again nice image though.', '2005-04-14 09:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291183, 165188, 33515, '<td valign="top">A little more wide angle to get the top of the sign and more of the foreground. Now, it seens to me, to tight.</td>', 'A little more wide angle to get the top of the sign and more of the foreground. Now, it seens to me, to tight.', '2005-04-14 09:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291184, 166012, 25095, '<td valign="top">Totally awesome.  Love the entire image, your tones are great and subject fits like no others.  Good luck</td>', 'Totally awesome.  Love the entire image, your tones are great and subject fits like no others.  Good luck', '2005-04-14 09:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291185, 165770, 33515, '<td valign="top">Nice color and textures, might have been better if you could see the floor at the bottom of the first door way. Nice 7</td>', 'Nice color and textures, might have been better if you could see the floor at the bottom of the first door way. Nice 7', '2005-04-14 09:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291187, 164963, 25095, '<td valign="top">Love this, I like how I was drawn around to all the broken windows and shapes then I saw the tree.  Amazing it is growing there.  Great color and angle.</td>', 'Love this, I like how I was drawn around to all the broken windows and shapes then I saw the tree.  Amazing it is growing there.  Great color and angle.', '2005-04-14 09:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291188, 164687, 25095, '<td valign="top">seems to dark for my likings but I have tried a similiar shot and know the difficulty here. Good luck</td>', 'seems to dark for my likings but I have tried a similiar shot and know the difficulty here. Good luck', '2005-04-14 09:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291190, 164372, 25095, '<td valign="top">while the image is great I don''t get the feel of the building being abandoned.  I think there is too much of the foreground that draws from the building.  Good effort and gerat picture otherwise.</td>', 'while the image is great I don''t get the feel of the building being abandoned.  I think there is too much of the foreground that draws from the building.  Good effort and gerat picture otherwise.', '2005-04-14 09:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291191, 164828, 33515, '<td valign="top">More DOF so the foreground was in sharp focus and I would have given a 9 or 10. The colors and framing of this photo are great, I really like this.</td>', 'More DOF so the foreground was in sharp focus and I would have given a 9 or 10. The colors and framing of this photo are great, I really like this.', '2005-04-14 09:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291192, 166083, 25095, '<td valign="top">interesting twist to the challenge.  I get idea you were going with but not sure how well it''s going to do...good luck</td>', 'interesting twist to the challenge.  I get idea you were going with but not sure how well it''s going to do...good luck', '2005-04-14 09:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291196, 165516, 25095, '<td valign="top">love the lighting...sky seems a little blown out but not too bad.  good luck</td>', 'love the lighting...sky seems a little blown out but not too bad.  good luck', '2005-04-14 09:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291198, 164198, 25095, '<td valign="top">not really abandoned is it? don''t they do tours and stuff there?  OTher than that a different angle would probably cut out the clutter in the background. good luck</td>', 'not really abandoned is it? don''t they do tours and stuff there?  OTher than that a different angle would probably cut out the clutter in the background. good luck', '2005-04-14 09:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291199, 164584, 25095, '<td valign="top">I would have liked it more with out the people cause you have a great subject and wonderful lighting and colors...also do wonder what b/w would look like. good luck</td>', 'I would have liked it more with out the people cause you have a great subject and wonderful lighting and colors...also do wonder what b/w would look like. good luck', '2005-04-14 09:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291200, 165367, 25095, '<td valign="top">mabye not abandoned but certainly blurry.</td>', 'mabye not abandoned but certainly blurry.', '2005-04-14 09:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291203, 165642, 25095, '<td valign="top">wonderful.  love the entire image.  So mad I couldn''t shoot this challenge, have tons to choose from near my home.  Good luck.</td>', 'wonderful.  love the entire image.  So mad I couldn''t shoot this challenge, have tons to choose from near my home.  Good luck.', '2005-04-14 09:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291204, 165518, 25095, '<td valign="top">love the b/w. good luck</td>', 'love the b/w. good luck', '2005-04-14 09:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291205, 165943, 25095, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge and your title perfect.  Great use of color (or lack there of) Good luck</td>', 'meets the challenge and your title perfect.  Great use of color (or lack there of) Good luck', '2005-04-14 09:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291208, 164382, 25095, '<td valign="top">?</td>', '?', '2005-04-14 09:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291212, 165639, 30605, '<td valign="top">The lines challenge was a couples weeks ago. Can''t find the connection with the challenge. The title doesn''t help either. Very nice photo though.</td>', 'The lines challenge was a couples weeks ago. Can''t find the connection with the challenge. The title doesn''t help either. Very nice photo though.', '2005-04-14 09:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291213, 165897, 19841, '<td valign="top">the roofline of the pillbox runs into the skyline, making the composition rather flat.  If you had taken the photo from just a little lower, so that the pillbox would stand above the trees, it would have been more dramatic.</td>', 'the roofline of the pillbox runs into the skyline, making the composition rather flat.  If you had taken the photo from just a little lower, so that the pillbox would stand above the trees, it would have been more dramatic.', '2005-04-14 09:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291216, 163995, 20941, '<td valign="top">certainly meets the challenge! . focus is a little soft and maybe too much of the foreground in this image, but a good find</td>', 'certainly meets the challenge! . focus is a little soft and maybe too much of the foreground in this image, but a good find', '2005-04-14 10:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291221, 165623, 20941, '<td valign="top">pretty good composition except i would have cropped more off the bottom so that the concrete wall were not in the image as it gives the feeling that the image is not straight. good subject.</td>', 'pretty good composition except i would have cropped more off the bottom so that the concrete wall were not in the image as it gives the feeling that the image is not straight. good subject.', '2005-04-14 10:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291222, 165675, 35720, '<td valign="top">It seems to me that this is a very good photo, but it is much too small to critizise and rate very high. I would have liked to see it larger.</td>', 'It seems to me that this is a very good photo, but it is much too small to critizise and rate very high. I would have liked to see it larger.', '2005-04-14 10:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291224, 165859, 19841, '<td valign="top">A little more depth of field would have shown off the textures better.  You have made the place look pretty darn creepy, though!</td>', 'A little more depth of field would have shown off the textures better.  You have made the place look pretty darn creepy, though!', '2005-04-14 10:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291225, 164624, 21714, '<td valign="top">There are things that I really about the image and then there are things that make me wonder why. I like old paint and texture. I like the framing. But I can''t quite make out how you have tried to focus on this one. And also I am trying to figure out if you did that on purpose, I mean focussing on the ''wall'' rather than the window frame.</td>', 'There are things that I really about the image and then there are things that make me wonder why. I like old paint and texture. I like the framing. But I can''t quite make out how you have tried to focus on this one. And also I am trying to figure out if you did that on purpose, I mean focussing on the ''wall'' rather than the window frame.', '2005-04-14 10:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291227, 166082, 20941, '<td valign="top">cool find! I''m guessing that the subject "building" is not very deep therefore not possible to see more of it in this image which may have been an even better image for this challenge, but i like it!</td>', 'cool find! I''m guessing that the subject "building" is not very deep therefore not possible to see more of it in this image which may have been an even better image for this challenge, but i like it!', '2005-04-14 10:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291230, 166103, 21714, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. The door makes the image exciting. I like the vibrant colours, but I think the amount of sharpening makes it a bit uneasy on the eyes. Good job.</td>', 'Nice capture. The door makes the image exciting. I like the vibrant colours, but I think the amount of sharpening makes it a bit uneasy on the eyes. Good job.', '2005-04-14 10:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291231, 165968, 20941, '<td valign="top">appears to be more of a wall than a building from this vantage point, but a nice shot</td>', 'appears to be more of a wall than a building from this vantage point, but a nice shot', '2005-04-14 10:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291233, 165285, 21714, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Nicely balanced with both lines and colours. I love the different elements that pop-out. Excellent.</td>', 'Very cool. Nicely balanced with both lines and colours. I love the different elements that pop-out. Excellent.', '2005-04-14 10:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291234, 166124, 14671, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors but I find it lacks clarity altho that could be due to the size.  Nice composition and perfect weather/contrast to the sky.  I think it would make for a great postcard or calendar shot.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'Excellent colors but I find it lacks clarity altho that could be due to the size.  Nice composition and perfect weather/contrast to the sky.  I think it would make for a great postcard or calendar shot.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-14 10:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291235, 165902, 20941, '<td valign="top">nice composition and certainly meets the challenge, makes me wonder what the whole castle looks like and if it would be better if more of it were in your image. a good find</td>', 'nice composition and certainly meets the challenge, makes me wonder what the whole castle looks like and if it would be better if more of it were in your image. a good find', '2005-04-14 10:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291236, 165614, 21714, '<td valign="top">I like the angle, choice of focal length and the composition a lot. Also, the treatment makes the viewer make a connection the the scene and the cat (if that makes any sense). Nice.</td>', 'I like the angle, choice of focal length and the composition a lot. Also, the treatment makes the viewer make a connection the the scene and the cat (if that makes any sense). Nice.', '2005-04-14 10:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291237, 164730, 9696, '<td valign="top">very nice with the background lighting.  i like it.</td>', 'very nice with the background lighting.  i like it.', '2005-04-14 10:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291238, 165661, 14671, '<td valign="top">A well composed shot but I''m not fond of the picture.  Perhaps if the whole inside was lighter it would have a greater impact.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'A well composed shot but I''m not fond of the picture.  Perhaps if the whole inside was lighter it would have a greater impact.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-14 10:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291240, 164584, 35720, '<td valign="top">Great shot, very nice abandoned houses and beautiful sky. The only thing that bothers me is the people in the photo, I think it would have been better without it. I will give you 7.</td>', 'Great shot, very nice abandoned houses and beautiful sky. The only thing that bothers me is the people in the photo, I think it would have been better without it. I will give you 7.', '2005-04-14 10:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291241, 166091, 21714, '<td valign="top">I like this image mainly because of the unusual composition to show part of a vehicle giving a nice rich blue. The wall and what''s behind the opening is rather interesting too.</td>', 'I like this image mainly because of the unusual composition to show part of a vehicle giving a nice rich blue. The wall and what''s behind the opening is rather interesting too.', '2005-04-14 10:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291242, 165997, 9696, '<td valign="top">it looks so abandoned and lonely.</td>', 'it looks so abandoned and lonely.', '2005-04-14 10:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291243, 165070, 9696, '<td valign="top">It really concise with the title.  Good shot.</td>', 'It really concise with the title.  Good shot.', '2005-04-14 10:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291244, 165684, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice photo and a great take on this challenge but in my opinion there is to much sky and the building should be the prodominant subject in this photo.  I feel that to much went into the sky and you lost a lot of detail on the building which is a little to dark and unclear.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice photo and a great take on this challenge but in my opinion there is to much sky and the building should be the prodominant subject in this photo.  I feel that to much went into the sky and you lost a lot of detail on the building which is a little to dark and unclear.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-14 10:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291246, 164966, 21714, '<td valign="top">From whatever you have done, maybe the angle you chose to shoot it from with a wide-angle and the colours present in it, the scene becomes something I can actually feel. Looking at it makes me even feel the sun on my shoulders. Feels like I am breathing the air there. Don''t know what it is, but I am instantly taken there.</td>', 'From whatever you have done, maybe the angle you chose to shoot it from with a wide-angle and the colours present in it, the scene becomes something I can actually feel. Looking at it makes me even feel the sun on my shoulders. Feels like I am breathing the air there. Don''t know what it is, but I am instantly taken there.', '2005-04-14 10:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291247, 165386, 14671, '<td valign="top">The challenge to me or at least in my opinion is about abandoned buildings not ruins so in my opinion I don''t feel that this fits the challenge.  It is a well composed shot with excellent color and clarity with an excellent view.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'The challenge to me or at least in my opinion is about abandoned buildings not ruins so in my opinion I don''t feel that this fits the challenge.  It is a well composed shot with excellent color and clarity with an excellent view.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-14 10:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291248, 165712, 9696, '<td valign="top">like the overall lighting.</td>', 'like the overall lighting.', '2005-04-14 10:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291250, 165357, 14671, '<td valign="top">To me this would suggest ruins not abandoned.   also find that because of the sun the colors all look yellow which I find very distracting as it puts a blurrish hue onto the photo.  Perhaps a different time of day would have made for a better photo.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'To me this would suggest ruins not abandoned.   also find that because of the sun the colors all look yellow which I find very distracting as it puts a blurrish hue onto the photo.  Perhaps a different time of day would have made for a better photo.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-14 10:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291252, 165381, 9696, '<td valign="top">like the overall shot.  beautiful</td>', 'like the overall shot.  beautiful', '2005-04-14 10:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291253, 165927, 19841, '<td valign="top">You might have bothered to crop off the time stamp.</td>', 'You might have bothered to crop off the time stamp.', '2005-04-14 10:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291254, 163821, 21714, '<td valign="top">Great composition. But I do feel that you could actually get rid of the bit at the top where you see the background. What I like about is how the coop acts as a screen. The foreground with beautiful colours are again seen though the window like it''s been projected there. I really like this one.</td>', 'Great composition. But I do feel that you could actually get rid of the bit at the top where you see the background. What I like about is how the coop acts as a screen. The foreground with beautiful colours are again seen though the window like it''s been projected there. I really like this one.', '2005-04-14 10:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291258, 165733, 19010, '<td valign="top">is this you bear?.. outside of the box is OK but I think it help if the box is atleast somewhere in sight... This is a bit of a streatch for me as far as abondoned buildings go..</td>', 'is this you bear?.. outside of the box is OK but I think it help if the box is atleast somewhere in sight... This is a bit of a streatch for me as far as abondoned buildings go..', '2005-04-14 10:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291259, 163828, 30173, '<td valign="top">Fine composition</td>', 'Fine composition', '2005-04-14 10:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291260, 165530, 9696, '<td valign="top">Like it.  a bit close up would look better though</td>', 'Like it.  a bit close up would look better though', '2005-04-14 10:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291261, 165943, 14671, '<td valign="top">The angle from which the photo was taken from makes the picture a little hard to look at.  Is gives an off balance feel to the photo and makes it hard to comment on.  I like the color or the lack there of and it does have some interesting details but gain the angle of the building in the photo makes it a dud to me.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'The angle from which the photo was taken from makes the picture a little hard to look at.  Is gives an off balance feel to the photo and makes it hard to comment on.  I like the color or the lack there of and it does have some interesting details but gain the angle of the building in the photo makes it a dud to me.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-14 10:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291262, 164382, 19010, '<td valign="top">is this you bear?.. outside of the box is OK but I think it help if the box is atleast somewhere in sight... This is a bit of a streatch for me as far as abondoned buildings go..</td>', 'is this you bear?.. outside of the box is OK but I think it help if the box is atleast somewhere in sight... This is a bit of a streatch for me as far as abondoned buildings go..', '2005-04-14 10:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291263, 164236, 35548, '<td valign="top">This would be a great image if you paid a little more attention to the framing and tried to get all of the major parts of the image in a better balance. The Focus does not seem right but it may be in the processing that you did.  Good try....5</td>', 'This would be a great image if you paid a little more attention to the framing and tried to get all of the major parts of the image in a better balance. The Focus does not seem right but it may be in the processing that you did.  Good try....5', '2005-04-14 10:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291264, 166012, 14671, '<td valign="top">Great shot but the angle is off and it makes it very distracting.  I like the B&amp;W conversion and the fact that it is centered.  I find it gives this photo a certain characteristic.  Well done and good luck with this challenge.</td>', 'Great shot but the angle is off and it makes it very distracting.  I like the B&W conversion and the fact that it is centered.  I find it gives this photo a certain characteristic.  Well done and good luck with this challenge.', '2005-04-14 10:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291265, 164766, 19010, '<td valign="top">Good image but composition dasn''t work for me. I feel this was cropped to tight. I would like to have ssen the top of the building.</td>', 'Good image but composition dasn''t work for me. I feel this was cropped to tight. I would like to have ssen the top of the building.', '2005-04-14 10:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291267, 165347, 9696, '<td valign="top">it looks lonely and abandoned.</td>', 'it looks lonely and abandoned.', '2005-04-14 10:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291269, 166079, 35645, '<td valign="top">Composition could have been better - you cut off one end of the house. Also, because of positioning, it seems like the gate is the center of attention.  Entire image is out of focus.</td>', 'Composition could have been better - you cut off one end of the house. Also, because of positioning, it seems like the gate is the center of attention.  Entire image is out of focus.', '2005-04-14 10:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291270, 166077, 14671, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if its the zoom that was used to get the shot or the contrast but it is blown out either way.  An interesting take on this challenge but the photo lacks clarity.  Might I suggest using a tripod when zooming in so much.  It may also be a cropping and resizing issue if you weren''t zoomed in.  Good luck with this challenge.</td>', 'I''m not sure if its the zoom that was used to get the shot or the contrast but it is blown out either way.  An interesting take on this challenge but the photo lacks clarity.  Might I suggest using a tripod when zooming in so much.  It may also be a cropping and resizing issue if you weren''t zoomed in.  Good luck with this challenge.', '2005-04-14 10:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291271, 164062, 35645, '<td valign="top">This could have been a really good photo. Subject placement is good, but I can''t see a darned thing! The image is way too dark. Also out of focus.</td>', 'This could have been a really good photo. Subject placement is good, but I can''t see a darned thing! The image is way too dark. Also out of focus.', '2005-04-14 10:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291272, 166003, 9696, '<td valign="top">wow!</td>', 'wow!', '2005-04-14 10:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291273, 164796, 35645, '<td valign="top">Good focus. Good subject placement. Would have liked to see this one in color.</td>', 'Good focus. Good subject placement. Would have liked to see this one in color.', '2005-04-14 10:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291275, 165803, 34556, '<td valign="top">The wires detract too much.</td>', 'The wires detract too much.', '2005-04-14 10:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291276, 165995, 9696, '<td valign="top">it look old and abandoned</td>', 'it look old and abandoned', '2005-04-14 10:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291277, 165512, 14671, '<td valign="top">A slight bit OoF.  The sun coming in from the right side is aslo very distracting.  Perhaps a different time of day would have made for a better photo.  Good luck with this challenge.</td>', 'A slight bit OoF.  The sun coming in from the right side is aslo very distracting.  Perhaps a different time of day would have made for a better photo.  Good luck with this challenge.', '2005-04-14 10:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291278, 165076, 35645, '<td valign="top">Overprocessed. It''s lost a little of its clarity b/c of the applied color. Would have preferred to see this in B&amp;W or in its natural color.</td>', 'Overprocessed. It''s lost a little of its clarity b/c of the applied color. Would have preferred to see this in B&W or in its natural color.', '2005-04-14 10:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291279, 164725, 9696, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2005-04-14 10:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291280, 165686, 34556, '<td valign="top">You were on  the right track with this one. I like the composition. The contrast is a bit too much (darken the highlights and brighten the shadows). More minor the roof bit int he upper left of the window detracts.</td>', 'You were on  the right track with this one. I like the composition. The contrast is a bit too much (darken the highlights and brighten the shadows). More minor the roof bit int he upper left of the window detracts.', '2005-04-14 10:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291282, 166041, 9696, '<td valign="top">good shot</td>', 'good shot', '2005-04-14 10:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291283, 165627, 11897, '<td valign="top">A little too much in the foreground, more of the building could help maybe.</td>', 'A little too much in the foreground, more of the building could help maybe.', '2005-04-14 10:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291284, 165333, 35645, '<td valign="top">Foreground is way too busy and distracting. Would have been a much better shot to step around the trees to shoot. The fact that the tree on the right is extrememly out of focus is very distracting. A different crop could help with that. I like that the building itself is in focus, and I like seeing htat you captured this place when the trees were budding out. Gives the photo less of a feel of ruin and decay.</td>', 'Foreground is way too busy and distracting. Would have been a much better shot to step around the trees to shoot. The fact that the tree on the right is extrememly out of focus is very distracting. A different crop could help with that. I like that the building itself is in focus, and I like seeing htat you captured this place when the trees were budding out. Gives the photo less of a feel of ruin and decay.', '2005-04-14 10:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291286, 166027, 14671, '<td valign="top">This photo doesn''t interest me.  The main subject should be an abandoned building but I see more landscape and sky then I do building.  I like the editing work you have done and the photo has excellent colors and clarity but I personally would have liked to see more building.</td>', 'This photo doesn''t interest me.  The main subject should be an abandoned building but I see more landscape and sky then I do building.  I like the editing work you have done and the photo has excellent colors and clarity but I personally would have liked to see more building.', '2005-04-14 10:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291287, 163745, 11897, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, great lighting and nice and sharp.</td>', 'Wonderful shot, great lighting and nice and sharp.', '2005-04-14 10:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
