(1291289, 165313, 35645, '<td valign="top">Unfortunatetly, all I can see here is sky, grass, and an out of focus, too dark , too small building. The tree limbs in the upper right corner should be cropped out. The angle seems ok, but a closer, tighter, lighter shot would have scored much higher from me.</td>', 'Unfortunatetly, all I can see here is sky, grass, and an out of focus, too dark , too small building. The tree limbs in the upper right corner should be cropped out. The angle seems ok, but a closer, tighter, lighter shot would have scored much higher from me.', '2005-04-14 10:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
