(1291429, 164350, 20941, '<td valign="top">you took a shot that seems to meet the challenge which is not a very attractive subject. this image is not very pleasing to my eye, but i like the effect of the over exposure from the light in the window with the shadows in dark areas giving it that creepy abandoned look</td>', 'you took a shot that seems to meet the challenge which is not a very attractive subject. this image is not very pleasing to my eye, but i like the effect of the over exposure from the light in the window with the shadows in dark areas giving it that creepy abandoned look', '2005-04-14 11:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291432, 164833, 20941, '<td valign="top">good entry! just what i was hoping to see more of in this challenge. good subject and composition and capture light and shadow that enhances the empty forelorn look of abondoned buildings. grat job!</td>', 'good entry! just what i was hoping to see more of in this challenge. good subject and composition and capture light and shadow that enhances the empty forelorn look of abondoned buildings. grat job!', '2005-04-14 11:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291433, 164605, 35548, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph</td>', 'Nice photograph', '2005-04-14 11:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291436, 164700, 14671, '<td valign="top">A little to bright and a little to much contrast.  I find it has blown out some of the details in the photo.  The composition isn''t bad as it does draw my eyes into the photo. Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'A little to bright and a little to much contrast.  I find it has blown out some of the details in the photo.  The composition isn''t bad as it does draw my eyes into the photo. Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-14 11:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291437, 164796, 35548, '<td valign="top">I like this photo very much. Framing is very good and print quality is the way I like it.:-)</td>', 'I like this photo very much. Framing is very good and print quality is the way I like it.:-)', '2005-04-14 11:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291438, 165315, 20941, '<td valign="top">doesn''t look too abandoned, but enough for me as i like the capture of light and shadow in b/w. cool composition and subject</td>', 'doesn''t look too abandoned, but enough for me as i like the capture of light and shadow in b/w. cool composition and subject', '2005-04-14 11:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291440, 166014, 32695, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, the color tone of the image is very nice.  The structure of the building is very nice, and the angle at which it was taken is very good.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, the color tone of the image is very nice.  The structure of the building is very nice, and the angle at which it was taken is very good.', '2005-04-14 11:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291441, 164622, 14671, '<td valign="top">Interesting take but I would have perfered to see more of the building.  I think this photo would have done better in a windows challenge.  I do however like the reflection of the sun in the galss and think it adds a certain uniqueness to the photo.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'Interesting take but I would have perfered to see more of the building.  I think this photo would have done better in a windows challenge.  I do however like the reflection of the sun in the galss and think it adds a certain uniqueness to the photo.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-14 11:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291442, 165679, 28750, '<td valign="top">This photo is just great. The photo whould maybe be better íf you had taken it from the handrail of your left. than you would not have the light in left corner.<br/>I give you 8</td>', 'This photo is just great. The photo whould maybe be better íf you had taken it from the handrail of your left. than you would not have the light in left corner.I give you 8', '2005-04-14 11:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291443, 165938, 32695, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, I like how the trees come around the building.  The colors of the trees are very nice, and the building is neat, i like how you can see the texture of the brick on the building.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, I like how the trees come around the building.  The colors of the trees are very nice, and the building is neat, i like how you can see the texture of the brick on the building.', '2005-04-14 11:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291444, 165707, 20941, '<td valign="top">great subject and capture of light in the darkness of an empty barn. pretty much what i expected to see more of in this challenge. nice job</td>', 'great subject and capture of light in the darkness of an empty barn. pretty much what i expected to see more of in this challenge. nice job', '2005-04-14 11:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291446, 164540, 33515, '<td valign="top">Now I''m not trying to be a jerk here, but go to Learn located in the blue bar on the top of the page and in the drop down window click on Tutorials. Almost all the way down that page under DPChallenge read the Using Photoshop to Prepare Photos for DPC Challenges. This will help you size your photos better. I think the photo is probably pretty good but just too small to see.<br/>Again, please dont take this the wrong way, I am only trying to help.<br/> <br/>John<br/></td>', 'Now I''m not trying to be a jerk here, but go to Learn located in the blue bar on the top of the page and in the drop down window click on Tutorials. Almost all the way down that page under DPChallenge read the Using Photoshop to Prepare Photos for DPC Challenges. This will help you size your photos better. I think the photo is probably pretty good but just too small to see.Again, please dont take this the wrong way, I am only trying to help. John', '2005-04-14 11:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291447, 164010, 32695, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, its very sharp-which i like!  I also like the angle you took it from becasue it makes it different.  Nice shot</td>', 'This is a nice shot, its very sharp-which i like!  I also like the angle you took it from becasue it makes it different.  Nice shot', '2005-04-14 11:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291448, 163828, 35548, '<td valign="top">Boy there are some serious add on''s to that building.  I like this image very much. Partly because it ''s unusual nature... I also like your use of the sepia tone...although I do think it may be just as powerful if you went with the B&amp;W version as I think there would some nice whites and rich black to enjoy..8 lots of luck with this one.</td>', 'Boy there are some serious add on''s to that building.  I like this image very much. Partly because it ''s unusual nature... I also like your use of the sepia tone...although I do think it may be just as powerful if you went with the B&W version as I think there would some nice whites and rich black to enjoy..8 lots of luck with this one.', '2005-04-14 11:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291450, 165951, 14671, '<td valign="top">To much zoom.  From this far away the photo loses clarity.  I also find that there is to much landscape in the photo altho is does tell a tale of what the building is about.  I also like the composition of the photo and the way it draws my eye thru the photo ia the landscape.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'To much zoom.  From this far away the photo loses clarity.  I also find that there is to much landscape in the photo altho is does tell a tale of what the building is about.  I also like the composition of the photo and the way it draws my eye thru the photo ia the landscape.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-14 11:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291451, 165347, 32695, '<td valign="top">Wow this building was really forgotten..Nice image to capture.  I like how you can see the texture of the building, and also how you can see that it almost burnt down.  Nice shot</td>', 'Wow this building was really forgotten..Nice image to capture.  I like how you can see the texture of the building, and also how you can see that it almost burnt down.  Nice shot', '2005-04-14 11:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291452, 164970, 28750, '<td valign="top">There is somthing missing in this photo. Maybe some contrast. Ypu have there good framing and angile. I hope you will do well in ths challenge. 7</td>', 'There is somthing missing in this photo. Maybe some contrast. Ypu have there good framing and angile. I hope you will do well in ths challenge. 7', '2005-04-14 11:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291453, 165683, 20941, '<td valign="top">your title explains how you are meeting  this challenge more than the image itself. i like the shot more for its compositional and technical quality than how well it meets the challenge</td>', 'your title explains how you are meeting  this challenge more than the image itself. i like the shot more for its compositional and technical quality than how well it meets the challenge', '2005-04-14 11:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291454, 165053, 32695, '<td valign="top">This is a neat image...It makes you wonder about the big building behind the abandoned building.  And you wonder why they havent torn it down yet, nice shot.</td>', 'This is a neat image...It makes you wonder about the big building behind the abandoned building.  And you wonder why they havent torn it down yet, nice shot.', '2005-04-14 11:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291455, 165979, 35548, '<td valign="top">Nice image and a different approuch to the topic. I like the tradional photographic quality that this photo has. 7</td>', 'Nice image and a different approuch to the topic. I like the tradional photographic quality that this photo has. 7', '2005-04-14 11:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291459, 164397, 14671, '<td valign="top">The photo as it is ould suggest a ruin not an abandoned building.  I also find the angle of the shot to be off balanced which makes it hard to look at.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'The photo as it is ould suggest a ruin not an abandoned building.  I also find the angle of the shot to be off balanced which makes it hard to look at.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-14 11:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291460, 164876, 32695, '<td valign="top">This is a neat shot, i like the texture in the brick and the leaves.  I can also tell this was an old farm building and it is so neat to see old stuff like this.</td>', 'This is a neat shot, i like the texture in the brick and the leaves.  I can also tell this was an old farm building and it is so neat to see old stuff like this.', '2005-04-14 11:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291461, 165282, 29154, '<td valign="top">Nice combination ....  Even if it is totally dark, it''s obvious this building is abandoned and the color of the sky is beautiful. Good capture ! I give you 8 .</td>', 'Nice combination ....  Even if it is totally dark, it''s obvious this building is abandoned and the color of the sky is beautiful. Good capture ! I give you 8 .', '2005-04-14 11:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
