(1291674, 166137, 35827, '<td valign="top">i like the picture and colors of the photo except for the very first window because it''s just blank.  I assume that''s just a relection of the sun, but i don''t know.</td>', 'i like the picture and colors of the photo except for the very first window because it''s just blank.  I assume that''s just a relection of the sun, but i don''t know.', '2005-04-14 12:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
