(1291703, 165381, 4281, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get the title. Do you mean that it''s a nice house kit as in airplane model kit and such? <br/>Anyway, I like the green color on the ground and the building is somewhat interesting. The sky looks a bit strange and is a tad too blue, I think.<br/>I like the composition though I''d peronally probably have tried a shot with a longer lens and from a greater distance.</td>', 'I don''t really get the title. Do you mean that it''s a nice house kit as in airplane model kit and such? Anyway, I like the green color on the ground and the building is somewhat interesting. The sky looks a bit strange and is a tad too blue, I think.I like the composition though I''d peronally probably have tried a shot with a longer lens and from a greater distance.', '2005-04-14 12:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
