(1291782, 165503, 35645, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Good DOF. Beautiful colors and contrast. Nice textures in the clouds and in the foreground. I even like the seagulls. &gt;Later&lt; Reconsidered score - bumping to 9</td>', 'Nice composition. Good DOF. Beautiful colors and contrast. Nice textures in the clouds and in the foreground. I even like the seagulls. >Later< Reconsidered score - bumping to 9', '2005-04-14 13:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
