(1291833, 164214, 16636, '<td valign="top">Great image, hope it ribbons, nice touch with the daffs in the foreground, I''m really interested to find out where this is? - 10.</td>', 'Great image, hope it ribbons, nice touch with the daffs in the foreground, I''m really interested to find out where this is? - 10.', '2005-04-14 13:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291835, 166033, 33379, '<td valign="top">this isnt very clear as to what you want your focus point is</td>', 'this isnt very clear as to what you want your focus point is', '2005-04-14 13:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291836, 165803, 16636, '<td valign="top">interesting building,  shame that there is so many power line in the way.</td>', 'interesting building,  shame that there is so many power line in the way.', '2005-04-14 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291837, 165771, 35645, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice - I imagine the outside of the barn would not have been as compelling. Good DOF, great lighting. Wish the colors were a little more saturated.</td>', 'Interesting choice - I imagine the outside of the barn would not have been as compelling. Good DOF, great lighting. Wish the colors were a little more saturated.', '2005-04-14 13:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291839, 165988, 16636, '<td valign="top">Not that abandoned to me, I could definately live there!!</td>', 'Not that abandoned to me, I could definately live there!!', '2005-04-14 13:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291840, 164980, 4281, '<td valign="top">Now, here we have something different!<br/>Even though this photograph is far from being sharp and is in certain aspect a bit ''amateurish'' I really like it - it has a certain quality about it! The yellow toning is nice and I think you have made a correct decision in keeping it this soft. <br/>The only thing I don''t like so much is the roof which is too dark in my opinion. Perhaps a tiny amount of shadow/highlight might have helped here?</td>', 'Now, here we have something different!Even though this photograph is far from being sharp and is in certain aspect a bit ''amateurish'' I really like it - it has a certain quality about it! The yellow toning is nice and I think you have made a correct decision in keeping it this soft. The only thing I don''t like so much is the roof which is too dark in my opinion. Perhaps a tiny amount of shadow/highlight might have helped here?', '2005-04-14 13:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291841, 163950, 35645, '<td valign="top">Clean and elegant. Good play between shadows and light. Interesting angle. Good clarity - I like the textures and details. Bumping from 6 to 7.</td>', 'Clean and elegant. Good play between shadows and light. Interesting angle. Good clarity - I like the textures and details. Bumping from 6 to 7.', '2005-04-14 13:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291845, 165668, 4281, '<td valign="top">Well, at least we have a composition here - something sorely lacking in many of the shots in this challenge. The sky is nice as well.<br/>I don''t like how you block the top left part of the building with the foreground - it''s a bit distracting.<br/></td>', 'Well, at least we have a composition here - something sorely lacking in many of the shots in this challenge. The sky is nice as well.I don''t like how you block the top left part of the building with the foreground - it''s a bit distracting.', '2005-04-14 13:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
