(1291856, 165877, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwww. ..I totally love this one.   I like the colors, and it''s sharp enough.  And, finally, because any picture with animals in it reaches into my heart and presses my emotional voting button  :)    Good luck!</td>', 'Awwwww. ..I totally love this one.   I like the colors, and it''s sharp enough.  And, finally, because any picture with animals in it reaches into my heart and presses my emotional voting button  :)    Good luck!', '2005-04-14 13:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
