(1291887, 164530, 32754, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot..the two poles of the clothes line add a lot of interest as does the bird, the sea in background and the position of the isolated cabin..good tonal use, also.</td>', 'I like this a lot..the two poles of the clothes line add a lot of interest as does the bird, the sea in background and the position of the isolated cabin..good tonal use, also.', '2005-04-14 14:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
