(1292185, 164214, 34337, '<td valign="top">Beautiful angle and location.   I see the sky was overcast, but it could still be a touch brighter with levels.  But the dang shot is so good, its getting a good score from me.</td>', 'Beautiful angle and location.   I see the sky was overcast, but it could still be a touch brighter with levels.  But the dang shot is so good, its getting a good score from me.', '2005-04-14 16:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
