(1292204, 165968, 18738, '<td valign="top">On first and second glances that just looks like a wall. On third glance you see something else and then it''s gone again. I slightly different angle would have brought out the shape of the sstructure.</td>', 'On first and second glances that just looks like a wall. On third glance you see something else and then it''s gone again. I slightly different angle would have brought out the shape of the sstructure.', '2005-04-14 16:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
