(1292326, 165930, 16636, '<td valign="top">good compositona and nice simple image that fits the challenge well. Just a shame that its not in sharp focus and the light wasn''t very kind to you either.</td>', 'good compositona and nice simple image that fits the challenge well. Just a shame that its not in sharp focus and the light wasn''t very kind to you either.', '2005-04-14 17:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292330, 165029, 16636, '<td valign="top">I so wish that tree wasn''t there! You could at least have used a chain saw!!!!<br/>Good luck</td>', 'I so wish that tree wasn''t there! You could at least have used a chain saw!!!!Good luck', '2005-04-14 17:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292334, 164827, 30857, '<td valign="top">Love the effect of the light on the hat .... very artistic picture, a 10 in my book</td>', 'Love the effect of the light on the hat .... very artistic picture, a 10 in my book', '2005-04-14 17:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292335, 164851, 16636, '<td valign="top">great composition, would like to see a darker sky, use of a polariser or push the contrast a bit more in pp. - good image, good luck</td>', 'great composition, would like to see a darker sky, use of a polariser or push the contrast a bit more in pp. - good image, good luck', '2005-04-14 17:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292336, 165167, 16636, '<td valign="top">bit lost in the trees, but definately abandoned!</td>', 'bit lost in the trees, but definately abandoned!', '2005-04-14 17:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292337, 166103, 35548, '<td valign="top">Viewing your image the question comes to mind as to how much color saturation is wanted or desirable? I love the colors of the building but perhaps the are a bit over done.  I suggest that you would be the only one who truely knows the answer as you are the creator of this image..... The focus seems to be a bit extreme for my liking as well. I like the overall image because it has something to say to the viewer...or a million stories could be writen around this image.....</td>', 'Viewing your image the question comes to mind as to how much color saturation is wanted or desirable? I love the colors of the building but perhaps the are a bit over done.  I suggest that you would be the only one who truely knows the answer as you are the creator of this image..... The focus seems to be a bit extreme for my liking as well. I like the overall image because it has something to say to the viewer...or a million stories could be writen around this image.....', '2005-04-14 17:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292338, 165503, 30857, '<td valign="top">Maybe the sky doesn''t say much, the horizon is crooked, or the crop is too tight ... but the whole combination, and the colours of this picture makes me give it a 9. Good luck!!!</td>', 'Maybe the sky doesn''t say much, the horizon is crooked, or the crop is too tight ... but the whole combination, and the colours of this picture makes me give it a 9. Good luck!!!', '2005-04-14 17:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292340, 165282, 35377, '<td valign="top">Love the colors</td>', 'Love the colors', '2005-04-14 17:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292347, 165384, 35548, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for images that are taken to the lowest common denominator.  This one really excites me visually.  I like the monochromatic elements here and the tiny details within.   The little window may or my not work depending on what the viewer wants.....I would most likely spend more time at this wall to explore the other possiblities it has to offer. 6</td>', 'I am a sucker for images that are taken to the lowest common denominator.  This one really excites me visually.  I like the monochromatic elements here and the tiny details within.   The little window may or my not work depending on what the viewer wants.....I would most likely spend more time at this wall to explore the other possiblities it has to offer. 6', '2005-04-14 17:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292354, 165805, 35548, '<td valign="top">Not crazy about the addition of the head.....it seems to be placed in the image with out purpose.</td>', 'Not crazy about the addition of the head.....it seems to be placed in the image with out purpose.', '2005-04-14 17:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292356, 164990, 29334, '<td valign="top">Love the colors, a 10 all the way</td>', 'Love the colors, a 10 all the way', '2005-04-14 17:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292358, 164990, 35548, '<td valign="top">Sense of isolation is over whelming here.  Nice handling of all the elements, sky, ground and buildings to tell the story....6<br/> <br/></td>', 'Sense of isolation is over whelming here.  Nice handling of all the elements, sky, ground and buildings to tell the story....6 ', '2005-04-14 17:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292361, 165365, 29334, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot. I love the texture of the stone.</td>', 'Very interesting shot. I love the texture of the stone.', '2005-04-14 17:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292365, 165384, 29334, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors and the texture of the wall. Nice shot</td>', 'I really like the colors and the texture of the wall. Nice shot', '2005-04-14 17:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292366, 165721, 29334, '<td valign="top">Very powerful image</td>', 'Very powerful image', '2005-04-14 17:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292371, 166136, 35548, '<td valign="top">Ok,  I know this is a matter of oppinion.....I don''t like photos that use such frame demensions.....I thing the photographer helps him/her self by trying to produce images that resemble the same demensions that your camera and camera''s finder see''s,,,,framed images like this one always wanting to see more that is beyond the edges......That being said I will try to let my dislikes  go by the way side.  The envornment that surrounds these buildings are the most important element here, without the emtyness of its surrounding these building don''t speak to me because I believe my point of view is to far away for me to allow them to speak to me.<br/> <br/>I like that you present a B&amp;W image here, it simplifies things for me allowing me to get more involved. The simplicity of the image is its strengh........5</td>', 'Ok,  I know this is a matter of oppinion.....I don''t like photos that use such frame demensions.....I thing the photographer helps him/her self by trying to produce images that resemble the same demensions that your camera and camera''s finder see''s,,,,framed images like this one always wanting to see more that is beyond the edges......That being said I will try to let my dislikes  go by the way side.  The envornment that surrounds these buildings are the most important element here, without the emtyness of its surrounding these building don''t speak to me because I believe my point of view is to far away for me to allow them to speak to me. I like that you present a B&W image here, it simplifies things for me allowing me to get more involved. The simplicity of the image is its strengh........5', '2005-04-14 17:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292372, 165041, 29334, '<td valign="top">I would have used the mountain more in this shot, other then that I really like it.</td>', 'I would have used the mountain more in this shot, other then that I really like it.', '2005-04-14 17:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292375, 165684, 29334, '<td valign="top">Too dark for my taste</td>', 'Too dark for my taste', '2005-04-14 18:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
