(1292398, 165025, 17937, '<td valign="top">Its a nice angle but I think I would like it more if it was less cropped.</td>', 'Its a nice angle but I think I would like it more if it was less cropped.', '2005-04-14 18:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292405, 165741, 30896, '<td valign="top">&gt;Enter your comment here, and then cast <br/>&gt;youjavascript: do_vote(5) 5 r vote...<br/> <br/>umm, sorry, i did not notice until now... and as i feel i should leave a real comment then, here it is: what prevents the picture to become above average in my eyes is lack of contrast (texture) of the tree, oversubjected composition (path/tree/house) and cropping of the roof. This challenge - somewhat suprisingly - turned out to be too difficult for almost everyone.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-13 15:33:34.</i></td>', '>Enter your comment here, and then cast >youjavascript: do_vote(5) 5 r vote... umm, sorry, i did not notice until now... and as i feel i should leave a real comment then, here it is: what prevents the picture to become above average in my eyes is lack of contrast (texture) of the tree, oversubjected composition (path/tree/house) and cropping of the roof. This challenge - somewhat suprisingly - turned out to be too difficult for almost everyone.', '2005-04-14 18:18:58.000000', '2005-06-13 16:33:34.000000', 1),
(1292407, 164319, 36051, '<td valign="top">love the mix of light and shadows</td>', 'love the mix of light and shadows', '2005-04-14 18:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292408, 166098, 30896, '<td valign="top">not sure whether the thick frame helps</td>', 'not sure whether the thick frame helps', '2005-04-14 18:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292413, 165800, 21714, '<td valign="top">That''s one beautiful mess of a place. A great place for photography. I like how this draws the person into it and makes you want to walk up those stairs.</td>', 'That''s one beautiful mess of a place. A great place for photography. I like how this draws the person into it and makes you want to walk up those stairs.', '2005-04-14 18:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292416, 165639, 30896, '<td valign="top">i dont see no building, but the feeling is sort of abandoned... in a way. and overall it is very nice. i would prefer a lighter frame, though.</td>', 'i dont see no building, but the feeling is sort of abandoned... in a way. and overall it is very nice. i would prefer a lighter frame, though.', '2005-04-14 18:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292420, 165940, 9311, '<td valign="top">Hey Jason!<br/> <br/>I think I know this building  --  on the way to Ellensburgh or the  NY bridge from Vergennes or something?<br/> <br/>Really nice perspective and feel to this.  The blur effect is VERY subtle - I can see why you got focus comments.  Best of luck - there are a TON of entries here.  :)</td>', 'Hey Jason! I think I know this building  --  on the way to Ellensburgh or the  NY bridge from Vergennes or something? Really nice perspective and feel to this.  The blur effect is VERY subtle - I can see why you got focus comments.  Best of luck - there are a TON of entries here.  :)', '2005-04-14 18:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292426, 165679, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s a lovely photo and the title fits perfectly.  Thanks for giving me a really good chuckle.</td>', 'It''s a lovely photo and the title fits perfectly.  Thanks for giving me a really good chuckle.', '2005-04-14 18:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292427, 164990, 33560, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky.  Nice lighting &amp; color.  Great use of negative space.</td>', 'Beautiful sky.  Nice lighting & color.  Great use of negative space.', '2005-04-14 18:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292436, 166054, 20168, '<td valign="top">IMO Lacking in composition interest.  Subject fits challenge but lies flat. All the best</td>', 'IMO Lacking in composition interest.  Subject fits challenge but lies flat. All the best', '2005-04-14 18:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292439, 165011, 20168, '<td valign="top">Great landscape and lovely entry into this challenge.</td>', 'Great landscape and lovely entry into this challenge.', '2005-04-14 18:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292440, 164398, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s a well exposed and it certainly meets the challenge, but there''s nothing to grab onto.  It''s all texture and confusion.  I don''t know it there is some effect that might make the photo more interesting: oversharpen it so the texture is surrealisticallly sharp, or up the contrast  so it is likewise too punchy.  As it stands it strikes me as having nothing to grab my interest, and I am someone who oohs and aahhs over peeling paint.</td>', 'It''s a well exposed and it certainly meets the challenge, but there''s nothing to grab onto.  It''s all texture and confusion.  I don''t know it there is some effect that might make the photo more interesting: oversharpen it so the texture is surrealisticallly sharp, or up the contrast  so it is likewise too punchy.  As it stands it strikes me as having nothing to grab my interest, and I am someone who oohs and aahhs over peeling paint.', '2005-04-14 18:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292443, 165983, 20168, '<td valign="top">Lovely warm tones, but I''d like to see more of the golden light on this barn/silo.  Moving further around to the west of this location would get more coloration, bringing the shadows into the light.  All the best</td>', 'Lovely warm tones, but I''d like to see more of the golden light on this barn/silo.  Moving further around to the west of this location would get more coloration, bringing the shadows into the light.  All the best', '2005-04-14 18:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292444, 165222, 20168, '<td valign="top">Cool capture. fitting.</td>', 'Cool capture. fitting.', '2005-04-14 18:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292446, 165805, 20168, '<td valign="top">creepy and perfect lighting...all the best</td>', 'creepy and perfect lighting...all the best', '2005-04-14 18:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292448, 164530, 20168, '<td valign="top">focus is a bit off IMO but a powerful setting for this challenge</td>', 'focus is a bit off IMO but a powerful setting for this challenge', '2005-04-14 18:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292449, 166047, 20168, '<td valign="top">lovely colors and title</td>', 'lovely colors and title', '2005-04-14 18:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292450, 164995, 28299, '<td valign="top">unique!</td>', 'unique!', '2005-04-14 18:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292451, 165738, 20168, '<td valign="top">Excellent closeup for thic challenge.  You''ll notice that most of the photos are of whole buildings.  This shot stands out among the few that bring us closer to abandonment.</td>', 'Excellent closeup for thic challenge.  You''ll notice that most of the photos are of whole buildings.  This shot stands out among the few that bring us closer to abandonment.', '2005-04-14 18:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292453, 165086, 16406, '<td valign="top">the idea was good.. but too much samara for me ;)</td>', 'the idea was good.. but too much samara for me ;)', '2005-04-14 18:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292454, 166027, 28299, '<td valign="top">beautiful!  Decided to upgrade to 10.</td>', 'beautiful!  Decided to upgrade to 10.', '2005-04-14 18:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292456, 166102, 20168, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting through the openings</td>', 'Nice lighting through the openings', '2005-04-14 18:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292458, 165035, 34836, '<td valign="top">Good quality photo.  I''m not sure if you cropped this or not.  If you did, I would have maybe cropped a little less so that the building could be seen in it''s surrounding.  If you didn''t crop, I might have stepped back a little (or zoomed out).</td>', 'Good quality photo.  I''m not sure if you cropped this or not.  If you did, I would have maybe cropped a little less so that the building could be seen in it''s surrounding.  If you didn''t crop, I might have stepped back a little (or zoomed out).', '2005-04-14 18:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292459, 165313, 33560, '<td valign="top">Somehow the negative space in this photo doesn''t work for me.  I think part of it is that everything is a little bit too dark.  You might consider using curves or levels in Photoshop to make everything lighter: certainly the subject, probably the sky, possibly the grass.   I see the subject is placed neatly on the rule of thirds.  It''s a safe choice, but I tend to think that it''s a little small to fill that space.  I''d have been tempted to move it toward the corner by cropping off the tree on the right and an equal amount of grass - but I tend to crop more closely than the DPC group as a whole.<br/> <br/>I like the bare tree and its relation to the house, and I think if you''d have been able to get closer or to use a longer lens, a shot with just the house, the tree, and the grass would have been better.</td>', 'Somehow the negative space in this photo doesn''t work for me.  I think part of it is that everything is a little bit too dark.  You might consider using curves or levels in Photoshop to make everything lighter: certainly the subject, probably the sky, possibly the grass.   I see the subject is placed neatly on the rule of thirds.  It''s a safe choice, but I tend to think that it''s a little small to fill that space.  I''d have been tempted to move it toward the corner by cropping off the tree on the right and an equal amount of grass - but I tend to crop more closely than the DPC group as a whole. I like the bare tree and its relation to the house, and I think if you''d have been able to get closer or to use a longer lens, a shot with just the house, the tree, and the grass would have been better.', '2005-04-14 18:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292460, 164703, 28299, '<td valign="top">Great B/W shot. The softness adds to its appeal. 9</td>', 'Great B/W shot. The softness adds to its appeal. 9', '2005-04-14 18:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292461, 164963, 28299, '<td valign="top">One of the more unique abandoned building photos. 9</td>', 'One of the more unique abandoned building photos. 9', '2005-04-14 18:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292462, 165342, 20168, '<td valign="top">This place has a sense of story indeed.  Lovely entry</td>', 'This place has a sense of story indeed.  Lovely entry', '2005-04-14 18:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292464, 165991, 34836, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Good choice of going monochromatic.  Your contrast is very good as well.  Now a "wow" type picture, but I like this one.</td>', 'Very nice.  Good choice of going monochromatic.  Your contrast is very good as well.  Now a "wow" type picture, but I like this one.', '2005-04-14 18:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292465, 165011, 16406, '<td valign="top">one of my favorite on this contest ;) 8</td>', 'one of my favorite on this contest ;) 8', '2005-04-14 18:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292466, 165679, 28299, '<td valign="top">Great angle, great title (whether it''s really abandoned or not, well ...) giving a 9.</td>', 'Great angle, great title (whether it''s really abandoned or not, well ...) giving a 9.', '2005-04-14 18:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292467, 164876, 20168, '<td valign="top">Ahhh...a stand out for inviting us into the abandoned space, unlike most of the photos in this challenge which look objectively from the outside.  Great idea and execution.</td>', 'Ahhh...a stand out for inviting us into the abandoned space, unlike most of the photos in this challenge which look objectively from the outside.  Great idea and execution.', '2005-04-14 18:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292469, 165614, 28299, '<td valign="top">Like the composition and texture (and the kitty). 9</td>', 'Like the composition and texture (and the kitty). 9', '2005-04-14 18:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292473, 166135, 28299, '<td valign="top">Something so appealing about this photo. I want to see it for myself. 9</td>', 'Something so appealing about this photo. I want to see it for myself. 9', '2005-04-14 18:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292474, 165363, 34836, '<td valign="top">Was the sky really that flat?  I like the building.  One thing that caught my eye was the fact that the building points right at the bushes, which made me notice the halo around the bushes.  My attention keeps ending up there instead of on the building.</td>', 'Was the sky really that flat?  I like the building.  One thing that caught my eye was the fact that the building points right at the bushes, which made me notice the halo around the bushes.  My attention keeps ending up there instead of on the building.', '2005-04-14 18:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292475, 165877, 33560, '<td valign="top">Somehow, when you weren''t looking someone dropped a herd of cows into your photo of the castle ruin.  The same scoundrel appears to have blurred the castle, lightened it, reduced it to a turret and disguised it as a silo!  A crenellated silo with two windows, but a silo nonetheless.    Better luck next time.</td>', 'Somehow, when you weren''t looking someone dropped a herd of cows into your photo of the castle ruin.  The same scoundrel appears to have blurred the castle, lightened it, reduced it to a turret and disguised it as a silo!  A crenellated silo with two windows, but a silo nonetheless.    Better luck next time.', '2005-04-14 18:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292476, 164399, 28299, '<td valign="top">Great color, nice and gloomy sky. Texture - excellent. 9</td>', 'Great color, nice and gloomy sky. Texture - excellent. 9', '2005-04-14 18:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292477, 166013, 9083, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and good composition     8</td>', 'Nice colours and good composition     8', '2005-04-14 18:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292479, 165901, 28299, '<td valign="top">Like an oil painting, and sooo scenic. But is it really abandoned? 9</td>', 'Like an oil painting, and sooo scenic. But is it really abandoned? 9', '2005-04-14 18:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292480, 165894, 16406, '<td valign="top">one of my personal top3;)  8</td>', 'one of my personal top3;)  8', '2005-04-14 18:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292481, 166055, 34836, '<td valign="top">Good color and contrast.  It''s processed pretty good, but there just isn''t anything that grabs my attention.  My eyes just keep wandering, looking for something to focus on.</td>', 'Good color and contrast.  It''s processed pretty good, but there just isn''t anything that grabs my attention.  My eyes just keep wandering, looking for something to focus on.', '2005-04-14 18:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292482, 165733, 16406, '<td valign="top">an animal has never been a building... sorry</td>', 'an animal has never been a building... sorry', '2005-04-14 18:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292483, 163810, 28299, '<td valign="top">Not sure how it fits the theme.</td>', 'Not sure how it fits the theme.', '2005-04-14 18:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292485, 166036, 34836, '<td valign="top">Interesting the way the front is so white but the side looks so weathered.  You have a little washout in the peak.  Good point of view though.</td>', 'Interesting the way the front is so white but the side looks so weathered.  You have a little washout in the peak.  Good point of view though.', '2005-04-14 18:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292486, 165770, 33560, '<td valign="top">I like the textures and the repeating pattern of the doors.  When it comes to photos that live or die on the quality of their textures - as I believe this one does - I tend to like things a little over-sharpened.  It''s a matter of taste, but too often an interesting texture will look a little too blurry when presented on screen with the same amount of texture as the real life subject</td>', 'I like the textures and the repeating pattern of the doors.  When it comes to photos that live or die on the quality of their textures - as I believe this one does - I tend to like things a little over-sharpened.  It''s a matter of taste, but too often an interesting texture will look a little too blurry when presented on screen with the same amount of texture as the real life subject', '2005-04-14 18:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292489, 165281, 34836, '<td valign="top">Very dark.  The graffiti is cool, but the darkness around it is swallowing up the attention.</td>', 'Very dark.  The graffiti is cool, but the darkness around it is swallowing up the attention.', '2005-04-14 18:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292491, 165781, 28299, '<td valign="top">Nice background, cute little guy in clean stylish clothes, but doesn''t quite fit the theme (IMO). Maybe an old relic of a guy would have given it a little more oomph.</td>', 'Nice background, cute little guy in clean stylish clothes, but doesn''t quite fit the theme (IMO). Maybe an old relic of a guy would have given it a little more oomph.', '2005-04-14 19:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292492, 164984, 34836, '<td valign="top">Looks like it''s coming down if the wind blows too hard.  The building and tree fill the frame too much.  It feels like there should be more to see.</td>', 'Looks like it''s coming down if the wind blows too hard.  The building and tree fill the frame too much.  It feels like there should be more to see.', '2005-04-14 19:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292494, 164995, 34836, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  Colors are good.  Not a very powerful subject, but you did well with it.</td>', 'Good composition.  Colors are good.  Not a very powerful subject, but you did well with it.', '2005-04-14 19:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292497, 164804, 33560, '<td valign="top">The contrast of the photo is a little low - there appear to be no colors darker than about 8-12% of full value.  This could be fixed in about 3 seconds in Photoshop.  I''m afraid the four guys wearing hats do nothing for the photo.    We''re a little too far away from the subject to see anything interesting about it.  Even if the sky had been filled with a beautiful sunset, it would be hard to argue that the photo was about and abandoned building and the photo would not have worked well.</td>', 'The contrast of the photo is a little low - there appear to be no colors darker than about 8-12% of full value.  This could be fixed in about 3 seconds in Photoshop.  I''m afraid the four guys wearing hats do nothing for the photo.    We''re a little too far away from the subject to see anything interesting about it.  Even if the sky had been filled with a beautiful sunset, it would be hard to argue that the photo was about and abandoned building and the photo would not have worked well.', '2005-04-14 19:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292499, 165347, 34836, '<td valign="top">Just a little too bright.  I feel like I"m squinting when I look left.  I think if you would have darkened it some, the shadows would have made more of an interesting contrast.</td>', 'Just a little too bright.  I feel like I"m squinting when I look left.  I think if you would have darkened it some, the shadows would have made more of an interesting contrast.', '2005-04-14 19:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292500, 163745, 34836, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  The cloud formation plays perfect into the setting.  Good focus of attention and good point of view.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  The cloud formation plays perfect into the setting.  Good focus of attention and good point of view.', '2005-04-14 19:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292503, 165627, 34836, '<td valign="top">Too much tree to see through.  The building looks interesting but it''s just to hard to pick out.  I do like the color though.</td>', 'Too much tree to see through.  The building looks interesting but it''s just to hard to pick out.  I do like the color though.', '2005-04-14 19:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292515, 166080, 33560, '<td valign="top">Somehow the gap between what the title tells us and what the photo tells us frustrates.  Something about the stark vertical and horizontal lines makes parsing the photo difficult - there''s no natural movement from one place to the next.   Don''t know if there would have been a way to get away with that had some part of the photo really caught the eye, but it''s so subtle and understated that it''s really hard to get drawn in.  I wonder if it would have been better a little oversharpened or oversaturated.  Or whether the subtle textures would have been better expressed in B&amp;W.  Or whether the composition would be less static if the door were not centered in the photo.</td>', 'Somehow the gap between what the title tells us and what the photo tells us frustrates.  Something about the stark vertical and horizontal lines makes parsing the photo difficult - there''s no natural movement from one place to the next.   Don''t know if there would have been a way to get away with that had some part of the photo really caught the eye, but it''s so subtle and understated that it''s really hard to get drawn in.  I wonder if it would have been better a little oversharpened or oversaturated.  Or whether the subtle textures would have been better expressed in B&W.  Or whether the composition would be less static if the door were not centered in the photo.', '2005-04-14 19:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292517, 165933, 9576, '<td valign="top">the picture is good but the building is not might not be  Abandoned ?</td>', 'the picture is good but the building is not might not be  Abandoned ?', '2005-04-14 19:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292519, 165742, 9576, '<td valign="top">very good 8</td>', 'very good 8', '2005-04-14 19:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292522, 165423, 9576, '<td valign="top">good picture but the person in the photo does not give me the feeling that the building is  Abandoned ? 6</td>', 'good picture but the person in the photo does not give me the feeling that the building is  Abandoned ? 6', '2005-04-14 19:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292527, 165236, 33560, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  my vision seems to be failing. I see no brick and no tree.  I see som wooden structure and some stone structure.  There''s some blurry strands that, if you told me were roots, I''d believe you.  There are some subtle hints here that maybe something here was photographically interesting. Old things with texture stones with cracks and the patina of lichens, checked wood, galvanized metal with a good patina, even some stringy tree roots.  Unfortunately pretty much everything is out of focus.  And to the best of my ability to see, were it in focus the composition would be a little confusing, unfocussed and barely up to meeting the challenge.   <br/> <br/>For all the negative things that can be said about the photo, I believe that there is a great shot lurking in this collection of parts.   That''s the hardest part of being a good photographer, IMO - seeing great shots.   I hope you will try again.  And again until you find it.</td>', 'Hmm.  my vision seems to be failing. I see no brick and no tree.  I see som wooden structure and some stone structure.  There''s some blurry strands that, if you told me were roots, I''d believe you.  There are some subtle hints here that maybe something here was photographically interesting. Old things with texture stones with cracks and the patina of lichens, checked wood, galvanized metal with a good patina, even some stringy tree roots.  Unfortunately pretty much everything is out of focus.  And to the best of my ability to see, were it in focus the composition would be a little confusing, unfocussed and barely up to meeting the challenge.    For all the negative things that can be said about the photo, I believe that there is a great shot lurking in this collection of parts.   That''s the hardest part of being a good photographer, IMO - seeing great shots.   I hope you will try again.  And again until you find it.', '2005-04-14 19:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292529, 164990, 35827, '<td valign="top">beautiful.</td>', 'beautiful.', '2005-04-14 19:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292531, 164780, 35827, '<td valign="top">i don''t find the focal point that interesting. sorry =).</td>', 'i don''t find the focal point that interesting. sorry =).', '2005-04-14 19:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292534, 164887, 35827, '<td valign="top">i think i would have liked this photo more without the person in the tunnel.</td>', 'i think i would have liked this photo more without the person in the tunnel.', '2005-04-14 19:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292539, 165534, 33560, '<td valign="top">A stone house with crenellations! Cool.  I like the subject.  I like the curved path leading to the door.  and the diagonal line of the roof through the photo.  I''m afraid what I am having a great difficulty with is the exporure and the final effect. The ''mostly desaturated and with no value greater than mid gray'' look just looks too oppressive.  I think the strong shadows in the doors are dark enough to give a dark look to the photo even if the sky were virtually white and there were no shadows elsewhere.    I also thing this treatment doesn''t let us see the texture in the stonework or the brush.</td>', 'A stone house with crenellations! Cool.  I like the subject.  I like the curved path leading to the door.  and the diagonal line of the roof through the photo.  I''m afraid what I am having a great difficulty with is the exporure and the final effect. The ''mostly desaturated and with no value greater than mid gray'' look just looks too oppressive.  I think the strong shadows in the doors are dark enough to give a dark look to the photo even if the sky were virtually white and there were no shadows elsewhere.    I also thing this treatment doesn''t let us see the texture in the stonework or the brush.', '2005-04-14 19:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292546, 165362, 35827, '<td valign="top">too dark</td>', 'too dark', '2005-04-14 19:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292548, 163821, 33560, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, jewel-like, inspiring.  <br/> <br/>Perhaps I am overimressed with genius in simplicity, but be that as it may, I love this photo for its simplicity.  I like the textures of the wall, the grass, the wildflower, and the musty stuff growing on the wall.  But what drew me to the photo was the sunlit patch of wildflowers framed by the dark wooden window.   <br/> <br/>This is the slightest quibble, but I would have cropped out the sky.  In fact, I think the photo looks fine with only the merest hint of roof.  <br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Beautiful, jewel-like, inspiring.   Perhaps I am overimressed with genius in simplicity, but be that as it may, I love this photo for its simplicity.  I like the textures of the wall, the grass, the wildflower, and the musty stuff growing on the wall.  But what drew me to the photo was the sunlit patch of wildflowers framed by the dark wooden window.    This is the slightest quibble, but I would have cropped out the sky.  In fact, I think the photo looks fine with only the merest hint of roof.    ', '2005-04-14 19:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292552, 165210, 33560, '<td valign="top">Nicely observed.  I love the texture &amp; color.  Nice choice in getting close  &amp; low and looking up - it exaggerates the vertical distance.</td>', 'Nicely observed.  I love the texture & color.  Nice choice in getting close  & low and looking up - it exaggerates the vertical distance.', '2005-04-14 19:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292566, 166091, 35382, '<td valign="top">would be better without the car in the picture</td>', 'would be better without the car in the picture', '2005-04-14 19:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292567, 165480, 35382, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting</td>', 'I really like the lighting', '2005-04-14 19:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292571, 165805, 35382, '<td valign="top">This is kind of scarry, but i like it.  Would like to know how you did it</td>', 'This is kind of scarry, but i like it.  Would like to know how you did it', '2005-04-14 19:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292572, 165877, 35382, '<td valign="top">Looks like the focus is more on the cows, than you building in back</td>', 'Looks like the focus is more on the cows, than you building in back', '2005-04-14 19:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292573, 166085, 35382, '<td valign="top">nice angle, sky gives it a good contrast</td>', 'nice angle, sky gives it a good contrast', '2005-04-14 19:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292574, 165755, 34192, '<td valign="top">great house!  Can''t believe the red paint still shines through.  The image seems a little oversharpened but other than that, pretty good!</td>', 'great house!  Can''t believe the red paint still shines through.  The image seems a little oversharpened but other than that, pretty good!', '2005-04-14 19:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292575, 164804, 35382, '<td valign="top">can''t see the building to well</td>', 'can''t see the building to well', '2005-04-14 19:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292576, 164887, 34836, '<td valign="top">Good contrast among the colors.  I would have left out the person in the background though.</td>', 'Good contrast among the colors.  I would have left out the person in the background though.', '2005-04-14 19:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292577, 166075, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful old building, nice composition, love your choice of B&amp;W</td>', 'Beautiful old building, nice composition, love your choice of B&W', '2005-04-14 19:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292579, 166136, 34836, '<td valign="top">Pretty good contrast.  The buildings are just starting to blend in with the background though.  It would have been nice to see a good solid roof line.</td>', 'Pretty good contrast.  The buildings are just starting to blend in with the background though.  It would have been nice to see a good solid roof line.', '2005-04-14 20:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292580, 164942, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like this image and I don''t like this image.  I think it is okay as shot a 6.  But, if you had changed the perspective just a little bit, maybe gotten lower to the ground so the roof of the  building ''soared'' over the mountain in the back, I probably would have given it an 8 or better.  I tried tilting my monitor for that effect but it didn''t work. ;)  Maybe outside of challenge you can clone out the white thing.  That would make this image pop even more.  As it is, good work.<br/>______________________________________<br/>Me again!  I have finished scoring all the entries and have adjusted my scores.  Now I''m adjusting your in spite of the fact that you didn''t like my opinion.  Ha!  But thanks for calling me young.  :) Your image is better than the ones I''ve rated a 7.  I am bumping you up to an 8.  I would still give you 2 more points for a lower point of view!</td>', 'I like this image and I don''t like this image.  I think it is okay as shot a 6.  But, if you had changed the perspective just a little bit, maybe gotten lower to the ground so the roof of the  building ''soared'' over the mountain in the back, I probably would have given it an 8 or better.  I tried tilting my monitor for that effect but it didn''t work. ;)  Maybe outside of challenge you can clone out the white thing.  That would make this image pop even more.  As it is, good work.______________________________________Me again!  I have finished scoring all the entries and have adjusted my scores.  Now I''m adjusting your in spite of the fact that you didn''t like my opinion.  Ha!  But thanks for calling me young.  :) Your image is better than the ones I''ve rated a 7.  I am bumping you up to an 8.  I would still give you 2 more points for a lower point of view!', '2005-04-14 20:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292581, 165957, 34836, '<td valign="top">Interesting focal setting, but there isn''t much to look at in the picture.</td>', 'Interesting focal setting, but there isn''t much to look at in the picture.', '2005-04-14 20:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292582, 164311, 34192, '<td valign="top">looks familiar!  Beautiful scenic.</td>', 'looks familiar!  Beautiful scenic.', '2005-04-14 20:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292585, 164863, 34192, '<td valign="top">not sure why this had to be validated.  Really like the starkness of the image.  Think it fits well with the subject.</td>', 'not sure why this had to be validated.  Really like the starkness of the image.  Think it fits well with the subject.', '2005-04-14 20:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292586, 165685, 34836, '<td valign="top">Not really a building, but it is definately abandoned.  The twigs in front make it really hard to focus on the subject.</td>', 'Not really a building, but it is definately abandoned.  The twigs in front make it really hard to focus on the subject.', '2005-04-14 20:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292588, 166027, 34192, '<td valign="top">Drama!  Pretty cool.  Like the red amid all the gray.</td>', 'Drama!  Pretty cool.  Like the red amid all the gray.', '2005-04-14 20:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292589, 166013, 34192, '<td valign="top">Beautiful building.  Think the contrast agains the sky is great!7</td>', 'Beautiful building.  Think the contrast agains the sky is great!7', '2005-04-14 20:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292590, 164820, 34836, '<td valign="top">Classic shot of a doorway that you did pretty good with.  Instead of such a low key composition, I might  have lightened it just a touch.  I think it would have brought out a little more detail in that very interesting door.</td>', 'Classic shot of a doorway that you did pretty good with.  Instead of such a low key composition, I might  have lightened it just a touch.  I think it would have brought out a little more detail in that very interesting door.', '2005-04-14 20:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292591, 165660, 34134, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been much better without the errant colors on the face of the building. Looks nice and sharp with good exposure.</td>', 'I think this would have been much better without the errant colors on the face of the building. Looks nice and sharp with good exposure.', '2005-04-14 20:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292592, 165519, 34836, '<td valign="top">Not bad for a B &amp; W.  You have good contrast with just a little bit of burnout.  The tubes on the left are a little distracting.  On a personal note, I think this would have been interesting in a different tone (maybe a sepia or something with a hint of brown).  All in all, a nice job though.</td>', 'Not bad for a B & W.  You have good contrast with just a little bit of burnout.  The tubes on the left are a little distracting.  On a personal note, I think this would have been interesting in a different tone (maybe a sepia or something with a hint of brown).  All in all, a nice job though.', '2005-04-14 20:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292593, 166017, 34134, '<td valign="top">Interesting try with selective colors, but I don''t think it does this photo justice. It would also have been helpful to tilt the picture so that the edge of the building was parallel to the edge of the print. Exposure looks a bit soft -- probably from resizing. Might want to experiment with the USM.</td>', 'Interesting try with selective colors, but I don''t think it does this photo justice. It would also have been helpful to tilt the picture so that the edge of the building was parallel to the edge of the print. Exposure looks a bit soft -- probably from resizing. Might want to experiment with the USM.', '2005-04-14 20:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292595, 165894, 34836, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture.  The building sort of gets lost in the beauty of the mountains. They kind of blend in a little with the mountain side.  I think a closer view of the building might have worked a little better.</td>', 'Very nice picture.  The building sort of gets lost in the beauty of the mountains. They kind of blend in a little with the mountain side.  I think a closer view of the building might have worked a little better.', '2005-04-14 20:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292597, 164472, 34134, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure. But this looks more like an abandoned cat box rather than a structure. Sorry, doesn''t do it for me.</td>', 'Nice exposure. But this looks more like an abandoned cat box rather than a structure. Sorry, doesn''t do it for me.', '2005-04-14 20:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292598, 165344, 34836, '<td valign="top">A well composed photo.  I would have liked to see more of the building instead of the machinery.  Good detail though it what you''ve taken a picture of.</td>', 'A well composed photo.  I would have liked to see more of the building instead of the machinery.  Good detail though it what you''ve taken a picture of.', '2005-04-14 20:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292600, 164382, 34134, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this is an abandoned structure.  That aside, appears a bit overexposed and suffering from low DOF.</td>', 'Not sure how this is an abandoned structure.  That aside, appears a bit overexposed and suffering from low DOF.', '2005-04-14 20:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292602, 164325, 34836, '<td valign="top">Very interesting structure.  I would have lowered the building in the frame a touch.  The roof line is getting lost with the edge of the photo making the viewer want to look over the top.</td>', 'Very interesting structure.  I would have lowered the building in the frame a touch.  The roof line is getting lost with the edge of the photo making the viewer want to look over the top.', '2005-04-14 20:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292603, 164988, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice composition</td>', 'Nice composition', '2005-04-14 20:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292605, 164540, 34134, '<td valign="top">First off, it''s really helpful if the picture is BIG. Too difficult to make out much detail. Also, there is a significant lack of focus. The white edge on the left side needs to be cropped out. To the PLUS side: The contrast is good and the exposure looks right on.<br/></td>', 'First off, it''s really helpful if the picture is BIG. Too difficult to make out much detail. Also, there is a significant lack of focus. The white edge on the left side needs to be cropped out. To the PLUS side: The contrast is good and the exposure looks right on.', '2005-04-14 20:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292607, 164985, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and composition</td>', 'Beautiful colors and composition', '2005-04-14 20:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292608, 166104, 34836, '<td valign="top">Nice color.  Composition is okay.  I''m not sure what to focus on though.  I keep staring at the doorway even though it feels like I should be looking at something else.</td>', 'Nice color.  Composition is okay.  I''m not sure what to focus on though.  I keep staring at the doorway even though it feels like I should be looking at something else.', '2005-04-14 20:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292609, 163918, 34134, '<td valign="top">Without the title I''d have no idea of what I''m looking at. Appears to have needed a tripod for a very low shutter speed. Very hard to view due to the lack of focus.</td>', 'Without the title I''d have no idea of what I''m looking at. Appears to have needed a tripod for a very low shutter speed. Very hard to view due to the lack of focus.', '2005-04-14 20:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292611, 166082, 34836, '<td valign="top">Nice ocean view, but not much in the way of an interesting building.  There isn''t much to look at but the water.</td>', 'Nice ocean view, but not much in the way of an interesting building.  There isn''t much to look at but the water.', '2005-04-14 20:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292613, 165480, 34134, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel the purple colors do justice to this otherwise very interesting picture. I like the sun on the back wall. The exposure and sharpness look pretty good. I''d liked to have seen just a straight shot.  Good POV.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I don''t feel the purple colors do justice to this otherwise very interesting picture. I like the sun on the back wall. The exposure and sharpness look pretty good. I''d liked to have seen just a straight shot.  Good POV. ', '2005-04-14 20:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292614, 165918, 34836, '<td valign="top">There''s something about this photo that makes me feel like I"m looking at a model.  I do like it though.  Very interesting structures.</td>', 'There''s something about this photo that makes me feel like I"m looking at a model.  I do like it though.  Very interesting structures.', '2005-04-14 20:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292615, 164963, 9083, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast, very striking</td>', 'Nice contrast, very striking', '2005-04-14 20:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292617, 165753, 9083, '<td valign="top">Nice composition 8</td>', 'Nice composition 8', '2005-04-14 20:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292619, 164123, 9083, '<td valign="top">Nice framed shot, good textures 8</td>', 'Nice framed shot, good textures 8', '2005-04-14 20:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292621, 164854, 34836, '<td valign="top">Just a little burnout in the sky and a slight flare on the front tree.  Very nice color and the landscape leads the viewer up to the building though.  I like the composition.</td>', 'Just a little burnout in the sky and a slight flare on the front tree.  Very nice color and the landscape leads the viewer up to the building though.  I like the composition.', '2005-04-14 20:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292625, 164725, 9083, '<td valign="top">Crisp focus and delightful colours 9</td>', 'Crisp focus and delightful colours 9', '2005-04-14 20:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292626, 164657, 9083, '<td valign="top">Amazing background!  Good composition 9</td>', 'Amazing background!  Good composition 9', '2005-04-14 20:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292627, 165943, 34836, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how to comment this one.  Very interesting angle of view and I think the monotone works pretty good for it.  I might have added just a little more sky instead of filling the frame.  The eyes want to leave right off the top when they get there.</td>', 'I''m not sure how to comment this one.  Very interesting angle of view and I think the monotone works pretty good for it.  I might have added just a little more sky instead of filling the frame.  The eyes want to leave right off the top when they get there.', '2005-04-14 20:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292629, 165721, 9083, '<td valign="top">Good colours and nice composition 8</td>', 'Good colours and nice composition 8', '2005-04-14 20:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292630, 166054, 34836, '<td valign="top">Not too bad.  The contrast is a little flat making it hard to distinguish much detail.</td>', 'Not too bad.  The contrast is a little flat making it hard to distinguish much detail.', '2005-04-14 20:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292631, 165352, 24270, '<td valign="top">Love this picture, nice effects.</td>', 'Love this picture, nice effects.', '2005-04-14 20:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292632, 165313, 9083, '<td valign="top">Maybe the main focus of this shot is too distant?</td>', 'Maybe the main focus of this shot is too distant?', '2005-04-14 20:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292635, 165929, 9083, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and composition</td>', 'Nice colours and composition', '2005-04-14 20:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292636, 165176, 34836, '<td valign="top">Good vantage point.  Nothings too dark or too light.  I also like the way the building trails off to the right just like the tracks do.</td>', 'Good vantage point.  Nothings too dark or too light.  I also like the way the building trails off to the right just like the tracks do.', '2005-04-14 20:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292637, 166083, 24270, '<td valign="top">This is sad from an animal loving point of view but very good artistically.</td>', 'This is sad from an animal loving point of view but very good artistically.', '2005-04-14 20:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292640, 164710, 34836, '<td valign="top">Nice title.  The focus seems a little soft.  I think a little bit more contrast would have been better.</td>', 'Nice title.  The focus seems a little soft.  I think a little bit more contrast would have been better.', '2005-04-14 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292641, 166106, 9083, '<td valign="top">Good use of B&amp;W, conveys a strong feeling of desolation and abandonment 9</td>', 'Good use of B&W, conveys a strong feeling of desolation and abandonment 9', '2005-04-14 20:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292642, 163828, 25095, '<td valign="top">color is a little much but I like where your going with this  Great idea.  good luck</td>', 'color is a little much but I like where your going with this  Great idea.  good luck', '2005-04-14 20:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292643, 165667, 9083, '<td valign="top">Very striking..........8</td>', 'Very striking..........8', '2005-04-14 20:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292644, 165640, 34836, '<td valign="top">Not really my idea of a building composition.  I think you focused too much on the window frame.  I do like the detail in the chipped paint.  For what you have, you balanced the light and dark pretty good.</td>', 'Not really my idea of a building composition.  I think you focused too much on the window frame.  I do like the detail in the chipped paint.  For what you have, you balanced the light and dark pretty good.', '2005-04-14 20:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292645, 165709, 25095, '<td valign="top">very interesting. I love how the tree in the winow reflects.  Great image.</td>', 'very interesting. I love how the tree in the winow reflects.  Great image.', '2005-04-14 20:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292646, 165233, 9083, '<td valign="top">Wow never seen anything like that before....</td>', 'Wow never seen anything like that before....', '2005-04-14 20:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292647, 165693, 9083, '<td valign="top">Good crisp focus and lovely colours 9</td>', 'Good crisp focus and lovely colours 9', '2005-04-14 20:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292648, 164739, 25095, '<td valign="top">would have preferred this without a person in it but I love the building</td>', 'would have preferred this without a person in it but I love the building', '2005-04-14 20:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292652, 165973, 34836, '<td valign="top">Good contrast.  Is that a lens flare in the upper left?  Whatever it is, it sticks out.  I can''t help feeling like I need to lean to the left to enjoy this one.</td>', 'Good contrast.  Is that a lens flare in the upper left?  Whatever it is, it sticks out.  I can''t help feeling like I need to lean to the left to enjoy this one.', '2005-04-14 20:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292653, 165384, 9083, '<td valign="top">Great shot, love it</td>', 'Great shot, love it', '2005-04-14 20:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292654, 164236, 9083, '<td valign="top">What an ugly buiding, but a great capture ........9</td>', 'What an ugly buiding, but a great capture ........9', '2005-04-14 20:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292655, 166116, 25095, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors...good luck</td>', 'beautiful colors...good luck', '2005-04-14 20:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292657, 164160, 34836, '<td valign="top">This has the feeling of a model.  But I like it.  The roof is just a little bright to fit in with the rest of the composition.</td>', 'This has the feeling of a model.  But I like it.  The roof is just a little bright to fit in with the rest of the composition.', '2005-04-14 20:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292660, 165736, 19035, '<td valign="top">wonderful capture - i love it.  9.</td>', 'wonderful capture - i love it.  9.', '2005-04-14 20:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292662, 165782, 24270, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture.</td>', 'Excellent picture.', '2005-04-14 20:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292663, 166135, 34836, '<td valign="top">Good color, nice tones.  Composition is a little too centered for my liking and the trees take a little away from the building.  But I like this one.</td>', 'Good color, nice tones.  Composition is a little too centered for my liking and the trees take a little away from the building.  But I like this one.', '2005-04-14 20:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292666, 164345, 34836, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and wonderful tones.  The image seems a little flat (feels like it lacks 3d).  But this is a good picture.</td>', 'Very nice composition and wonderful tones.  The image seems a little flat (feels like it lacks 3d).  But this is a good picture.', '2005-04-14 20:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292669, 166102, 34836, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  One of the better ones I''ve seen from this vantage point.  Good detail in the stone and good contrast among the colors.</td>', 'Very nice.  One of the better ones I''ve seen from this vantage point.  Good detail in the stone and good contrast among the colors.', '2005-04-14 20:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292670, 164766, 33736, '<td valign="top">Cropping away 1/3 of the left side tree and eliminating the Lamppost completely might have made the tilt of this image less noticeable.</td>', 'Cropping away 1/3 of the left side tree and eliminating the Lamppost completely might have made the tilt of this image less noticeable.', '2005-04-14 20:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292672, 165373, 34836, '<td valign="top">This one is good.  This is my idea of an abandoned barn photo.  Great composition and color.  I''m glad you didn''t change it to a B&amp;W.  This is a winner in my book.</td>', 'This one is good.  This is my idea of an abandoned barn photo.  Great composition and color.  I''m glad you didn''t change it to a B&W.  This is a winner in my book.', '2005-04-14 20:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292674, 163821, 33736, '<td valign="top">just a small crop - barely inside the rooftop.</td>', 'just a small crop - barely inside the rooftop.', '2005-04-14 20:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292676, 165988, 34836, '<td valign="top">Not too bad.  I would have moved the building off center though.  Also, I would go back out at different times in the day and try this one again.  I think you could have had better lighting.</td>', 'Not too bad.  I would have moved the building off center though.  Also, I would go back out at different times in the day and try this one again.  I think you could have had better lighting.', '2005-04-14 20:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292677, 164455, 34836, '<td valign="top">Pretty good.  It''s a little flat though from this vantage point.  It looks like a wall just standing in the snow.  I like how you composed the photo though.</td>', 'Pretty good.  It''s a little flat though from this vantage point.  It looks like a wall just standing in the snow.  I like how you composed the photo though.', '2005-04-14 20:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292678, 165313, 34836, '<td valign="top">I think this is an interesting building.  I wish you would have moved in on it.  This turned out to be more of a landscape picture instead of a building picture.  Nicely done though</td>', 'I think this is an interesting building.  I wish you would have moved in on it.  This turned out to be more of a landscape picture instead of a building picture.  Nicely done though', '2005-04-14 20:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292679, 164970, 33736, '<td valign="top">The "lean" of the building earns this a 9 from me (can''t tell if it''s true or thru the tilt of your camera.)  Otherwise, the shadowy outline of the building''s edge played against the stormy clouds (spectacular, btw) would have earned it a 10.</td>', 'The "lean" of the building earns this a 9 from me (can''t tell if it''s true or thru the tilt of your camera.)  Otherwise, the shadowy outline of the building''s edge played against the stormy clouds (spectacular, btw) would have earned it a 10.', '2005-04-14 20:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292680, 165754, 24065, '<td valign="top">The building is lovely, but the harsh shadow is very distracting.  I think if taken at a different time of day it may have helped.  Hope this feedback is helpful :)</td>', 'The building is lovely, but the harsh shadow is very distracting.  I think if taken at a different time of day it may have helped.  Hope this feedback is helpful :)', '2005-04-14 20:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292681, 164220, 34836, '<td valign="top">This is pretty good.  Nice representation of what the building looks like in person.  It doesn''t knock my socks off, but it is a good photo.</td>', 'This is pretty good.  Nice representation of what the building looks like in person.  It doesn''t knock my socks off, but it is a good photo.', '2005-04-14 20:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292683, 165467, 34836, '<td valign="top">If you were going to focus in on the window, I might have moved in even closer.  All the windows in the background are starting to take on a characteristic of their own.  I would have liked to see more than just the window.</td>', 'If you were going to focus in on the window, I might have moved in even closer.  All the windows in the background are starting to take on a characteristic of their own.  I would have liked to see more than just the window.', '2005-04-14 20:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292684, 165773, 33736, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this one a little more with more grass and from down lower.  Were you lying belly down already, though.  I rolled this down to where the top showed just above the pole''s top to get the "feel"  - you made a terrific decision not to crop away from the left.</td>', 'I think I would have liked this one a little more with more grass and from down lower.  Were you lying belly down already, though.  I rolled this down to where the top showed just above the pole''s top to get the "feel"  - you made a terrific decision not to crop away from the left.', '2005-04-14 20:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292685, 164236, 24065, '<td valign="top">The building has a lot of character, and I like the colors and textures.  I would have rated it even higher if it had been level.  It could have had a strong composition with the door and the six windows.  Hope this feedback proves to be helpful :)</td>', 'The building has a lot of character, and I like the colors and textures.  I would have rated it even higher if it had been level.  It could have had a strong composition with the door and the six windows.  Hope this feedback proves to be helpful :)', '2005-04-14 20:55:57.000000', NULL, 1);
