(1292857, 166041, 34836, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  You look like you did some dodging on the edges, but I''ll let someone else be the judge of that.  This is a really good picture.  It''s well composed and well balanced colorwise.  This could be a winner.</td>', 'Nicely done.  You look like you did some dodging on the edges, but I''ll let someone else be the judge of that.  This is a really good picture.  It''s well composed and well balanced colorwise.  This could be a winner.', '2005-04-14 22:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292861, 164319, 34836, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really grab my attention but it is a nice composition.  It has a nice flare to it.</td>', 'Doesn''t really grab my attention but it is a nice composition.  It has a nice flare to it.', '2005-04-14 22:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292865, 165036, 34836, '<td valign="top">The snow is almost too white.  It really grabs my attention away from the building.  Pretty good composition although the peak right in the center is too . . . well . . .  right in the center.</td>', 'The snow is almost too white.  It really grabs my attention away from the building.  Pretty good composition although the peak right in the center is too . . . well . . .  right in the center.', '2005-04-14 22:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
