(1292871, 165282, 34836, '<td valign="top">If this was a landscape challange I''d rank you right up there at the top.  I do like this one.  You''ve got wonderful color in this and the silhouette is great.</td>', 'If this was a landscape challange I''d rank you right up there at the top.  I do like this one.  You''ve got wonderful color in this and the silhouette is great.', '2005-04-14 22:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
