(1292876, 164494, 34836, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Soft yet detailed.  I think the sun detracts a little bit from the overall quality.  But this is still good.</td>', 'Nice photo.  Soft yet detailed.  I think the sun detracts a little bit from the overall quality.  But this is still good.', '2005-04-14 22:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
