(1292885, 166038, 34836, '<td valign="top">It''s a little to straight-on of a shot.  I think you lose some character at this view point.  Good subject though.</td>', 'It''s a little to straight-on of a shot.  I think you lose some character at this view point.  Good subject though.', '2005-04-14 22:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
