(1293185, 165365, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition, I would love to see where that road leads .... nice shot.</td>', 'Beautiful composition, I would love to see where that road leads .... nice shot.', '2005-04-15 00:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293186, 165738, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great composition and depiction of urban decay in the neighborhood. Your choice for making it a B&amp;W was a wise one.<br/>Well Done!</td>', 'Great composition and depiction of urban decay in the neighborhood. Your choice for making it a B&W was a wise one.Well Done!', '2005-04-15 00:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293188, 165642, 34041, '<td valign="top">the focus spot seems to be the bendle of vines in the very front of the image. I think it would have improved the image to either focus on the windows, or increase the Dof. I also find the thngs on the ground (not sure what they are) distract the eye away from the windows.</td>', 'the focus spot seems to be the bendle of vines in the very front of the image. I think it would have improved the image to either focus on the windows, or increase the Dof. I also find the thngs on the ground (not sure what they are) distract the eye away from the windows.', '2005-04-15 00:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293190, 165940, 34041, '<td valign="top">The focus is a bit too soft for my taste.</td>', 'The focus is a bit too soft for my taste.', '2005-04-15 00:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293192, 164990, 34255, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the fact that you took this photo from a distance.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the fact that you took this photo from a distance.', '2005-04-15 00:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293193, 164633, 4793, '<td valign="top">Interesting colorful shot, I think the fellow has been abandoned also..</td>', 'Interesting colorful shot, I think the fellow has been abandoned also..', '2005-04-15 00:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293194, 164755, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great composition and depiction of urban decay in the neighborhood. Your choice for making it a B&amp;W was a wise one, and the rotation in this shot, though bugged me a bit at first, but the more I studied it, the more i liked it.<br/>Well Done!</td>', 'Great composition and depiction of urban decay in the neighborhood. Your choice for making it a B&W was a wise one, and the rotation in this shot, though bugged me a bit at first, but the more I studied it, the more i liked it.Well Done!', '2005-04-15 00:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293196, 166089, 34255, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.</td>', 'Interesting image.', '2005-04-15 00:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293198, 165659, 34255, '<td valign="top">I like the vibrant colors</td>', 'I like the vibrant colors', '2005-04-15 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293199, 165878, 33672, '<td valign="top">It seems a bit over sharpened and over saturated. Nice comp.</td>', 'It seems a bit over sharpened and over saturated. Nice comp.', '2005-04-15 00:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293200, 165614, 34255, '<td valign="top">The cat really makes this picture....just brings it to life.</td>', 'The cat really makes this picture....just brings it to life.', '2005-04-15 00:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293201, 165802, 33672, '<td valign="top">Very nice. one of my favorite B&amp;Ws. Nice comp and use of negative space and perspective.</td>', 'Very nice. one of my favorite B&Ws. Nice comp and use of negative space and perspective.', '2005-04-15 00:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293202, 165086, 32608, '<td valign="top">original theme.  well done 8</td>', 'original theme.  well done 8', '2005-04-15 00:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293203, 164833, 34255, '<td valign="top">Good choice of what to focus on. More interesting than say, an outside view of a crumbling shed.</td>', 'Good choice of what to focus on. More interesting than say, an outside view of a crumbling shed.', '2005-04-15 00:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293205, 164214, 34255, '<td valign="top">nice angle</td>', 'nice angle', '2005-04-15 00:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293206, 164540, 33672, '<td valign="top">looks interesting.. by now you''ve probably read all the "too small and cropping error" comments.  Nice angle and comp. I''ve yet to see a small photo do well.</td>', 'looks interesting.. by now you''ve probably read all the "too small and cropping error" comments.  Nice angle and comp. I''ve yet to see a small photo do well.', '2005-04-15 00:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293208, 166098, 33672, '<td valign="top">very, very crisp.</td>', 'very, very crisp.', '2005-04-15 01:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293216, 164686, 32608, '<td valign="top">nice..........i gave a little "aawww" when I noticed her. good saturation, not over done.,  9</td>', 'nice..........i gave a little "aawww" when I noticed her. good saturation, not over done.,  9', '2005-04-15 01:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293223, 165679, 32608, '<td valign="top">something different!!!  and well done. 8</td>', 'something different!!!  and well done. 8', '2005-04-15 01:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293227, 165675, 24363, '<td valign="top">Bigger is Better!!!</td>', 'Bigger is Better!!!', '2005-04-15 01:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293229, 165708, 11278, '<td valign="top">but if there''s no one there to have the memories, do they even exist?  oh man, now im getting existential.  i think i need to go to bed.</td>', 'but if there''s no one there to have the memories, do they even exist?  oh man, now im getting existential.  i think i need to go to bed.', '2005-04-15 01:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293233, 164703, 11278, '<td valign="top">oh i like this view, from the inside out. and great light and shadows.  very nice.</td>', 'oh i like this view, from the inside out. and great light and shadows.  very nice.', '2005-04-15 01:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293241, 166083, 11278, '<td valign="top">it may seem trite, but this makes me sad.  well done, though.  good use of the light.</td>', 'it may seem trite, but this makes me sad.  well done, though.  good use of the light.', '2005-04-15 01:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293243, 164383, 11278, '<td valign="top">with the bright sky and sun, this is one of the few images ive seen in this challenge that i would call optimistic.  a different take on the subject, i think.  good job, i like it.</td>', 'with the bright sky and sun, this is one of the few images ive seen in this challenge that i would call optimistic.  a different take on the subject, i think.  good job, i like it.', '2005-04-15 01:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293255, 165423, 11278, '<td valign="top">oooh, very moody.  is this a model you placed there or someone who you just happened upon ?<br/> <br/>great dramatic lighting.</td>', 'oooh, very moody.  is this a model you placed there or someone who you just happened upon ? great dramatic lighting.', '2005-04-15 01:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293258, 165478, 33899, '<td valign="top">the high contrast really adds impact to this shot, nice work</td>', 'the high contrast really adds impact to this shot, nice work', '2005-04-15 01:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293265, 164438, 33899, '<td valign="top">how''d you creat that blur effect? slow sync?</td>', 'how''d you creat that blur effect? slow sync?', '2005-04-15 01:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293282, 165946, 33899, '<td valign="top">very creative idea, i like it :)  it''s refreshing to go against the tide of generic submissions</td>', 'very creative idea, i like it :)  it''s refreshing to go against the tide of generic submissions', '2005-04-15 01:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293295, 166118, 19831, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good subject that has some potential. There definitely is some color and texture going on. Lighting/exposure is pretty good. Focus seems like it could be sharper. The composition feels very static and lacking to me though. Perhaps a more stimulating angle or perspective would make a greater impact.</td>', 'I think this is a good subject that has some potential. There definitely is some color and texture going on. Lighting/exposure is pretty good. Focus seems like it could be sharper. The composition feels very static and lacking to me though. Perhaps a more stimulating angle or perspective would make a greater impact.', '2005-04-15 01:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293299, 165480, 19831, '<td valign="top">Good photo. It has nice lines. The barrel adds a lot IMO, ads a nice secondary subject and helps to draw the eye into the structure. Great colors, processing or did it really look like that? either way, pretty cool. The gold and purple really work together well for me. Looks like lighting wise, you chose a really good time of day. Great job.</td>', 'Good photo. It has nice lines. The barrel adds a lot IMO, ads a nice secondary subject and helps to draw the eye into the structure. Great colors, processing or did it really look like that? either way, pretty cool. The gold and purple really work together well for me. Looks like lighting wise, you chose a really good time of day. Great job.', '2005-04-15 02:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293315, 165614, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the composition, works well for me. Nice conversion to b/w IMO. The photo has good tone and a definite "mood". The shadows coming in from the top right really help to make the shot. I hope the mass of voters don''t slam ya for it, but I think the cat ads a lot to the shot. Gives it like some context or a connection, and something to wonder about. Very nice job, I like it.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the composition, works well for me. Nice conversion to b/w IMO. The photo has good tone and a definite "mood". The shadows coming in from the top right really help to make the shot. I hope the mass of voters don''t slam ya for it, but I think the cat ads a lot to the shot. Gives it like some context or a connection, and something to wonder about. Very nice job, I like it.', '2005-04-15 02:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293321, 165637, 19831, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. The overall composition works well for me. Their is an "ominous" mood set with the sign and the darkness. I''m left wondering what might be down that black pathway, especially curious about the light deep within. Nice job.</td>', 'Interesting shot. The overall composition works well for me. Their is an "ominous" mood set with the sign and the darkness. I''m left wondering what might be down that black pathway, especially curious about the light deep within. Nice job.', '2005-04-15 02:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293326, 164988, 35169, '<td valign="top">a VERY traditional looking shot, could be an old photo in an old magazine.  Take out about half of the sky and it becomes stronger focus on the buildings and they seem a little less silowetted.  Nice</td>', 'a VERY traditional looking shot, could be an old photo in an old magazine.  Take out about half of the sky and it becomes stronger focus on the buildings and they seem a little less silowetted.  Nice', '2005-04-15 02:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293330, 164273, 35530, '<td valign="top">An awesome seascape rather than an abandoned building IMHO. Beautiful none the less.</td>', 'An awesome seascape rather than an abandoned building IMHO. Beautiful none the less.', '2005-04-15 02:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293331, 166017, 35530, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. How did you manage this under the basic editing rules?</td>', 'Interesting shot. How did you manage this under the basic editing rules?', '2005-04-15 02:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293333, 164943, 35169, '<td valign="top">Thank you for not sharpening the P Waddies or staurating the Cr... out of this very nicely done image.  How refreshing</td>', 'Thank you for not sharpening the P Waddies or staurating the Cr... out of this very nicely done image.  How refreshing', '2005-04-15 02:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293334, 164455, 35530, '<td valign="top">I like how you utilized the trees in this shot.</td>', 'I like how you utilized the trees in this shot.', '2005-04-15 02:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293336, 166116, 35530, '<td valign="top">The wood tone came out great.</td>', 'The wood tone came out great.', '2005-04-15 02:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
