(1293495, 164530, 26526, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph. I think I would have liked it better if it done in color, showing more detail of the building. It is a little too dark as is. Like the flying bird in the sky.</td>', 'Nice photograph. I think I would have liked it better if it done in color, showing more detail of the building. It is a little too dark as is. Like the flying bird in the sky.', '2005-04-15 05:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293498, 165676, 26526, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph with a fitting title. The color appears a little off to me. Too bright. I find all that foliage around the collapsed building quite distracting. I missed seeing the building at first through glance. Perhaps try a tighter crop. I like this shot.</td>', 'Nice photograph with a fitting title. The color appears a little off to me. Too bright. I find all that foliage around the collapsed building quite distracting. I missed seeing the building at first through glance. Perhaps try a tighter crop. I like this shot.', '2005-04-15 05:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293500, 164820, 26526, '<td valign="top">Great composition. I find the colors a little flat. Curtains in the doorway window make me wonder if the building abandoned. Will assume it is. Just a little sharper focus perhaps. Nice photograph in general.</td>', 'Great composition. I find the colors a little flat. Curtains in the doorway window make me wonder if the building abandoned. Will assume it is. Just a little sharper focus perhaps. Nice photograph in general.', '2005-04-15 05:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
