(1293504, 165742, 26526, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Just a tad too dark and soft focus to see much detail, espcially in the foreground leaves. Curtains in the window makes me questain if this building abandoned. No other features to show me this. Perhaps if done in color more detail would show up. I like the photo.</td>', 'Nice composition. Just a tad too dark and soft focus to see much detail, espcially in the foreground leaves. Curtains in the window makes me questain if this building abandoned. No other features to show me this. Perhaps if done in color more detail would show up. I like the photo.', '2005-04-15 06:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293506, 163995, 26526, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this photograph. It is just too dark in the foreground for me see much detail in the bunker (?). Really like the sky color!</td>', 'I like the composition of this photograph. It is just too dark in the foreground for me see much detail in the bunker (?). Really like the sky color!', '2005-04-15 06:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293507, 163854, 28750, '<td valign="top">sorry but i donot like this filter that you are using. And your sky is burnd out. I think it would be much better if you would have it in b&amp;w.</td>', 'sorry but i donot like this filter that you are using. And your sky is burnd out. I think it would be much better if you would have it in b&w.', '2005-04-15 06:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
