(1293514, 166017, 26526, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph. I just find the purple cast a little off as to what I would expect to see in a natural setting for an abandoned building. The perspective also makes it appear to me that the building is tilting backward. Then again, that is what abandoned building can do.</td>', 'Nice photograph. I just find the purple cast a little off as to what I would expect to see in a natural setting for an abandoned building. The perspective also makes it appear to me that the building is tilting backward. Then again, that is what abandoned building can do.', '2005-04-15 06:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293516, 165957, 26526, '<td valign="top">Like the light pattern of the window on the floor. I don''t care for the rounded fish-eye look of the walls. Just my opinion. Like the tone you used for this photograph. Looks, empty, I don''t know about abandoned. Will give you the benefit of doubt.</td>', 'Like the light pattern of the window on the floor. I don''t care for the rounded fish-eye look of the walls. Just my opinion. Like the tone you used for this photograph. Looks, empty, I don''t know about abandoned. Will give you the benefit of doubt.', '2005-04-15 06:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293517, 166033, 26526, '<td valign="top">I just don''t see an abandoned building in this shot. I see a statue. Too dark for me to make out what it is. Loss of detail. Sorry. Creative approach ''though.</td>', 'I just don''t see an abandoned building in this shot. I see a statue. Too dark for me to make out what it is. Loss of detail. Sorry. Creative approach ''though.', '2005-04-15 06:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
