(1293823, 164062, 25095, '<td valign="top">little too tight on your crop and seems really dark.  I''m assuming the camera metered the light off the building and blew out the sky. Try metering the sky and the building seperate then manually set your exposure somewhere in between.  A polarizer filter may have helped the sky also.  Good luck.</td>', 'little too tight on your crop and seems really dark.  I''m assuming the camera metered the light off the building and blew out the sky. Try metering the sky and the building seperate then manually set your exposure somewhere in between.  A polarizer filter may have helped the sky also.  Good luck.', '2005-04-15 12:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
