(1293921, 165345, 34836, '<td valign="top">The angle of view doesn''t say much.  The emphasis seems to be on the three posts (which by way of the roof line, are leading the view off the photo).</td>', 'The angle of view doesn''t say much.  The emphasis seems to be on the three posts (which by way of the roof line, are leading the view off the photo).', '2005-04-15 13:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1293925, 165695, 35377, '<td valign="top">The white stuff at the top right either needs to be in the picture more or not at all, it detracts from the interesting texture. Croping closer to the bug, if that is a bug, would help a lot.</td>', 'The white stuff at the top right either needs to be in the picture more or not at all, it detracts from the interesting texture. Croping closer to the bug, if that is a bug, would help a lot.', '2005-04-15 13:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
