(1294013, 165681, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Your choice for making it a B&amp;W was a wise one in my opinion. I was going to comment about the arch being too centered, but the windows in the background shift things in a pleasant way.<br/>Well Done!</td>', 'Great composition. Your choice for making it a B&W was a wise one in my opinion. I was going to comment about the arch being too centered, but the windows in the background shift things in a pleasant way.Well Done!', '2005-04-15 14:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
