(1294022, 165575, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Your choice for making it a B&amp;W was a wise one in my opinion. Contrast is a bit too low &amp; little to no true black in it. Try this: Bring the brightness down a little, and the contrast up a little and see what happens.<br/>Well Done!</td>', 'Great composition. Your choice for making it a B&W was a wise one in my opinion. Contrast is a bit too low & little to no true black in it. Try this: Bring the brightness down a little, and the contrast up a little and see what happens.Well Done!', '2005-04-15 14:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1294028, 165675, 13879, '<td valign="top">real shame it isnt bigger!</td>', 'real shame it isnt bigger!', '2005-04-15 14:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1294033, 164633, 36102, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this more if the person matched the concept better.  This person looks well kept and appears to have nice shoes and a new jacket on.  The whole concept of abandoned would be stronger if the person looked "abandoned" as well.</td>', 'I would have liked this more if the person matched the concept better.  This person looks well kept and appears to have nice shoes and a new jacket on.  The whole concept of abandoned would be stronger if the person looked "abandoned" as well.', '2005-04-15 14:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
