(1294036, 164311, 36102, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo.  It''s hard to tell if the windmill is neglected or not though.</td>', 'beautiful photo.  It''s hard to tell if the windmill is neglected or not though.', '2005-04-15 14:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
