(1294162, 164281, 34396, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF.  I like the photo, but the edges of the clothespins look too sharp.  They look like they have been cut and pasted in.  I don''t know if it is due to using unsharp mask, but it just doesn''t look quite right.</td>', 'Nice use of DOF.  I like the photo, but the edges of the clothespins look too sharp.  They look like they have been cut and pasted in.  I don''t know if it is due to using unsharp mask, but it just doesn''t look quite right.', '2005-04-15 15:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1294168, 165940, 34396, '<td valign="top">I like the building.  It looks like a very interesting subject.  The focus seems quite soft, I also think there is not enough contrast.  Might have looked better in color.</td>', 'I like the building.  It looks like a very interesting subject.  The focus seems quite soft, I also think there is not enough contrast.  Might have looked better in color.', '2005-04-15 15:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1294184, 165051, 34396, '<td valign="top">I like the building!  Couldn''t you have sawn down that light pole before you took the shot? LOL ;-)  The slogan is Great.  Good job.</td>', 'I like the building!  Couldn''t you have sawn down that light pole before you took the shot? LOL ;-)  The slogan is Great.  Good job.', '2005-04-15 15:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1294189, 164123, 34396, '<td valign="top">Nice framing.  An interesting shot.  I wish the view through the doorway was a little clearer.  I wonder if it might have looked better if you were able to get some blue sky into the shot with a lower angle?</td>', 'Nice framing.  An interesting shot.  I wish the view through the doorway was a little clearer.  I wonder if it might have looked better if you were able to get some blue sky into the shot with a lower angle?', '2005-04-15 15:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1294197, 166052, 34396, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see a bit better composition, rather than smack in the middle of the picture.  I like the use of color.  6</td>', 'Would have liked to see a bit better composition, rather than smack in the middle of the picture.  I like the use of color.  6', '2005-04-15 15:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1294202, 166084, 34396, '<td valign="top">Focus seems a bit off and colors washed out.  Nice subject, would have done well with better lighting.</td>', 'Focus seems a bit off and colors washed out.  Nice subject, would have done well with better lighting.', '2005-04-15 15:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1294210, 164739, 30222, '<td valign="top">thats a mysterious title and i have no clue yet what it means<br/>the image looks a bit washed out on my laptop but i really like it for the strong wind and the perspective gives it a mysterious mood too</td>', 'thats a mysterious title and i have no clue yet what it meansthe image looks a bit washed out on my laptop but i really like it for the strong wind and the perspective gives it a mysterious mood too', '2005-04-15 15:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1294211, 166086, 34396, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I like that you left the tree in the right hand side of the shot.  The photo really benefits from the greenery.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I like that you left the tree in the right hand side of the shot.  The photo really benefits from the greenery.', '2005-04-15 15:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1294214, 164942, 29154, '<td valign="top">Very abandoned ..... Great capture !  Ohhh ! I just noticed the screen is still there ! Very good !</td>', 'Very abandoned ..... Great capture !  Ohhh ! I just noticed the screen is still there ! Very good !', '2005-04-15 15:46:44.000000', NULL, 1);
