(1294231, 165687, 34396, '<td valign="top">I don''t think Sepia works very well here.  Abandoned Building is almost completely obscurred by trees.  Too much negative space, not enough subject.</td>', 'I don''t think Sepia works very well here.  Abandoned Building is almost completely obscurred by trees.  Too much negative space, not enough subject.', '2005-04-15 15:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
