(1294758, 164686, 3032, '<td valign="top">The distortion seems to add some speed, or some flow to the photo. Interesting effect.<br/>The photo, like the title says, breathes ''abandoned''. The dark holes of the windows, the closed entries at ground level, ther empty tarmac, the empty sky (no clouds), trees without leafes.... The girl''s only companion seems to be her shadow. 8</td>', 'The distortion seems to add some speed, or some flow to the photo. Interesting effect.The photo, like the title says, breathes ''abandoned''. The dark holes of the windows, the closed entries at ground level, ther empty tarmac, the empty sky (no clouds), trees without leafes.... The girl''s only companion seems to be her shadow. 8', '2005-04-15 20:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1294761, 165742, 3032, '<td valign="top">The dots on the curtain cause me to feel that there is still some live left, yet all the other signs say no. I like the effect of the dark foliage vs the dotted curtain. Nice and uncomplicated composition. 8</td>', 'The dots on the curtain cause me to feel that there is still some live left, yet all the other signs say no. I like the effect of the dark foliage vs the dotted curtain. Nice and uncomplicated composition. 8', '2005-04-15 20:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
