(1294998, 164658, 34836, '<td valign="top">The white spots caught my attention first.  They are just a touch too bright.  I like the composition though.  I like the viewing angle that you chose.  The tree on the left keeps the viewer from running off the photo.</td>', 'The white spots caught my attention first.  They are just a touch too bright.  I like the composition though.  I like the viewing angle that you chose.  The tree on the left keeps the viewer from running off the photo.', '2005-04-15 23:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
