(1295546, 164472, 34041, '<td valign="top">I don''t get this.  Is it a pet''s house that you are showing here?</td>', 'I don''t get this.  Is it a pet''s house that you are showing here?', '2005-04-16 03:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295547, 164540, 34041, '<td valign="top">too bad it''s so small. It looks like it could have been a very good image with more size and bit more focus.</td>', 'too bad it''s so small. It looks like it could have been a very good image with more size and bit more focus.', '2005-04-16 03:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295555, 164054, 34041, '<td valign="top">focus is too soft for my taste. I like the color tones, though.</td>', 'focus is too soft for my taste. I like the color tones, though.', '2005-04-16 04:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295557, 166041, 34041, '<td valign="top">I think the fading boarder distracts - perhaps it is just is too tight a crop.</td>', 'I think the fading boarder distracts - perhaps it is just is too tight a crop.', '2005-04-16 04:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295558, 164198, 31637, '<td valign="top">great shot !!! 10...hope you score high</td>', 'great shot !!! 10...hope you score high', '2005-04-16 04:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295560, 166090, 34041, '<td valign="top">great composition.</td>', 'great composition.', '2005-04-16 04:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295564, 165772, 34041, '<td valign="top">I think the choice of crop is wrong here - I would have gone either much looser or much tighter.  the partial fence on the left and the white building on the rigth really distract the eye. Of course, I wasn''t here, but I think I would have chosen a more front on view of the dorr and windows and second floor balcony, or else backed away and put the old building into a larger context</td>', 'I think the choice of crop is wrong here - I would have gone either much looser or much tighter.  the partial fence on the left and the white building on the rigth really distract the eye. Of course, I wasn''t here, but I think I would have chosen a more front on view of the dorr and windows and second floor balcony, or else backed away and put the old building into a larger context', '2005-04-16 04:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295568, 165345, 34041, '<td valign="top">The lamp pole in the background distracts the eye. I''d have tried tomove a few inches left and hidden it behind the wooden column</td>', 'The lamp pole in the background distracts the eye. I''d have tried tomove a few inches left and hidden it behind the wooden column', '2005-04-16 04:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295571, 163829, 34041, '<td valign="top">great title choice - turns a negative into the point of the image. nice.</td>', 'great title choice - turns a negative into the point of the image. nice.', '2005-04-16 04:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295575, 165362, 34041, '<td valign="top">I think I would have cropped out the pole on the left. Also, the bike in the foreground is just a bit too dark</td>', 'I think I would have cropped out the pole on the left. Also, the bike in the foreground is just a bit too dark', '2005-04-16 04:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295577, 164214, 34041, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the border adds to this, especially with such a tight crop.</td>', 'I don''t think the border adds to this, especially with such a tight crop.', '2005-04-16 04:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295582, 164062, 34041, '<td valign="top">just a bit too dark. the detail of the vines are lost</td>', 'just a bit too dark. the detail of the vines are lost', '2005-04-16 04:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295583, 164861, 34041, '<td valign="top">nice framing. gives the whole image more context.</td>', 'nice framing. gives the whole image more context.', '2005-04-16 04:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295585, 165803, 34041, '<td valign="top">lhose wires are really ugly...</td>', 'lhose wires are really ugly...', '2005-04-16 04:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295591, 164887, 30457, '<td valign="top">Slight color adjustments in a software program or a slight adjustment on your exposure values would have improved this photo. Very interesting building regardless.</td>', 'Slight color adjustments in a software program or a slight adjustment on your exposure values would have improved this photo. Very interesting building regardless.', '2005-04-16 04:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295592, 164382, 30457, '<td valign="top">It''s slightly out of focus and I ..............  I just don''t get how this has anything to do with abandonded building''s.</td>', 'It''s slightly out of focus and I ..............  I just don''t get how this has anything to do with abandonded building''s.', '2005-04-16 04:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295594, 165778, 30457, '<td valign="top">Very original concept.</td>', 'Very original concept.', '2005-04-16 04:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295606, 165667, 14671, '<td valign="top">In my opinion there is to much sky in this photo and not enough building.  Perhaps a closer shot would have made for a better shot.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'In my opinion there is to much sky in this photo and not enough building.  Perhaps a closer shot would have made for a better shot.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-16 04:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295614, 165262, 14671, '<td valign="top">The image size make this photo very hard to look at because it has been compressed so much it looks fuzzy/blurry.  I also find  the shot was taken from to far of distance and the landscape in front was really needed.  With so much distance its really hard to tell what kind of building I''m looking at or what the photo is supposed to be about.  Also the level of your camera is slightly off and the photo could have used approx 1 degree ccw rotation.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'The image size make this photo very hard to look at because it has been compressed so much it looks fuzzy/blurry.  I also find  the shot was taken from to far of distance and the landscape in front was really needed.  With so much distance its really hard to tell what kind of building I''m looking at or what the photo is supposed to be about.  Also the level of your camera is slightly off and the photo could have used approx 1 degree ccw rotation.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-16 04:47:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1295620, 165776, 14671, '<td valign="top">There is quite a few hotspots in the center of the frame that I find to be very distracting.  I assume its where the roof is off near the top center of the photo is the worst one of all.  I also find that the photo could have been rotated about 1 or 2 degrees ccw to level out the photo properly.  I think the image has some good color but lacks clarity due to image resizing.  A different crop of this photo ould have made a greater impact on this photo.  Good luck with this challenge.</td>', 'There is quite a few hotspots in the center of the frame that I find to be very distracting.  I assume its where the roof is off near the top center of the photo is the worst one of all.  I also find that the photo could have been rotated about 1 or 2 degrees ccw to level out the photo properly.  I think the image has some good color but lacks clarity due to image resizing.  A different crop of this photo ould have made a greater impact on this photo.  Good luck with this challenge.', '2005-04-16 04:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295622, 164796, 28742, '<td valign="top">Where would the clowns hang out then?</td>', 'Where would the clowns hang out then?', '2005-04-16 04:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295630, 165668, 14671, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like this photo.  I find it to be to distracting/busy with the metal gate obstructing the view of the building.  The metal also appears to be a little OoF (could be to resizing issues at 640).  I also find there is more sky then building and I feel that the building should be the main subject of the shot.  Without the metal fence there I think the shot was composed alright but could have done with a lower angle.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m not sure I like this photo.  I find it to be to distracting/busy with the metal gate obstructing the view of the building.  The metal also appears to be a little OoF (could be to resizing issues at 640).  I also find there is more sky then building and I feel that the building should be the main subject of the shot.  Without the metal fence there I think the shot was composed alright but could have done with a lower angle.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-16 05:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295631, 166014, 14671, '<td valign="top">I find the focus to be a little off in this photo.  I also not sure if I like the yellowish hue that covers this photo altho it has made me look at the picture for a litle longer.  The photo is level and is well composed.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'I find the focus to be a little off in this photo.  I also not sure if I like the yellowish hue that covers this photo altho it has made me look at the picture for a litle longer.  The photo is level and is well composed.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-16 05:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295632, 166137, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice cropping job.  Perhaps my only suggestion would be to add a border around the image.  The image I find lacks interest but has excellent vibrant colors and good clarity for what it is.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice cropping job.  Perhaps my only suggestion would be to add a border around the image.  The image I find lacks interest but has excellent vibrant colors and good clarity for what it is.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-16 05:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295635, 164593, 14671, '<td valign="top">The contrast of the sky and off the roof is very distracting.  I find it to be a little on the bright side.  I also find that the shot is a little OoF and I''m not sure what prompted you to shoot this particular building from this angle.  I do however like the B&amp;W conversion and find they all stand out a little more in this challenge.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'The contrast of the sky and off the roof is very distracting.  I find it to be a little on the bright side.  I also find that the shot is a little OoF and I''m not sure what prompted you to shoot this particular building from this angle.  I do however like the B&W conversion and find they all stand out a little more in this challenge.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-16 05:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295637, 165937, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a shot that isn''t just a tight crop of a building.</td>', 'Nice to see a shot that isn''t just a tight crop of a building.', '2005-04-16 05:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295638, 166047, 14671, '<td valign="top">a well composed shot and one of the beter I have looked at with a scenic view.  The photo looks a little OoF but I bet thats due to the resize for this challenge.  Altho I am not fond of the shot I find it fits the chalenge well, its pleasing to the eye, has color (which is rare for this challenge),  and is wel composed.  Well done and cgood luck with this challenge. &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'a well composed shot and one of the beter I have looked at with a scenic view.  The photo looks a little OoF but I bet thats due to the resize for this challenge.  Altho I am not fond of the shot I find it fits the chalenge well, its pleasing to the eye, has color (which is rare for this challenge),  and is wel composed.  Well done and cgood luck with this challenge. <8>', '2005-04-16 05:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295641, 165858, 14671, '<td valign="top">Really neat looking sky but the fence and sky appear to me to be more in focus then the building.  I like the border but think you could have gotten away with a little more cropping of the sky to put more emphasis on the building.  It is a well composed shot and good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'Really neat looking sky but the fence and sky appear to me to be more in focus then the building.  I like the border but think you could have gotten away with a little more cropping of the sky to put more emphasis on the building.  It is a well composed shot and good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-16 05:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295661, 165271, 36060, '<td valign="top">I really do like this photo, it is very simple but very effective.</td>', 'I really do like this photo, it is very simple but very effective.', '2005-04-16 06:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295669, 166103, 36060, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, colours and the atmosphere in this photo.....10</td>', 'I like the composition, colours and the atmosphere in this photo.....10', '2005-04-16 06:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295677, 165946, 36060, '<td valign="top">Very original idea.</td>', 'Very original idea.', '2005-04-16 06:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295683, 165943, 36060, '<td valign="top">Very good shot, but it would improve if you crop just slightly from the top.</td>', 'Very good shot, but it would improve if you crop just slightly from the top.', '2005-04-16 06:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295730, 164717, 34836, '<td valign="top">Great color.  Good composition.  It doesn''t scream "I''m the winner" but it is a great photo.</td>', 'Great color.  Good composition.  It doesn''t scream "I''m the winner" but it is a great photo.', '2005-04-16 07:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295731, 164938, 34836, '<td valign="top">A doorway through a doorway . . .hmmm.  Good color and shape, but I"m struggling with the view.  The picture makes me feel like a child on my toes trying to see through the window.  It feels like I''m missing something.</td>', 'A doorway through a doorway . . .hmmm.  Good color and shape, but I"m struggling with the view.  The picture makes me feel like a child on my toes trying to see through the window.  It feels like I''m missing something.', '2005-04-16 07:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295733, 164437, 34836, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen the "hole in the window" work before, but I think this falls a little short.  There are too many broken panes.  The more that are broke, the more they detract from each other.  I do like the color on some of the panes though.  It matches the piping on the right.</td>', 'I''ve seen the "hole in the window" work before, but I think this falls a little short.  There are too many broken panes.  The more that are broke, the more they detract from each other.  I do like the color on some of the panes though.  It matches the piping on the right.', '2005-04-16 07:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295735, 164600, 34836, '<td valign="top">Good contrast, but in the end, it''s just a door (sorry).  There isn''t anything appealing about this particular door.</td>', 'Good contrast, but in the end, it''s just a door (sorry).  There isn''t anything appealing about this particular door.', '2005-04-16 07:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295736, 166003, 34836, '<td valign="top">Nice barn photo.  It''s a little too centered though.  You should try to find a viewpoint that leads the viewer''s eye to the barn.</td>', 'Nice barn photo.  It''s a little too centered though.  You should try to find a viewpoint that leads the viewer''s eye to the barn.', '2005-04-16 07:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295737, 166014, 34836, '<td valign="top">Very nice monochromatic photo.  I''m glad you didn''t use B&amp;W.  Technically good, compositionally good as well.  You should so well with this one.</td>', 'Very nice monochromatic photo.  I''m glad you didn''t use B&W.  Technically good, compositionally good as well.  You should so well with this one.', '2005-04-16 07:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295739, 164350, 34836, '<td valign="top">Nice cobwebs (not much of a building though).  A little burned out at the window level.</td>', 'Nice cobwebs (not much of a building though).  A little burned out at the window level.', '2005-04-16 07:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295741, 164723, 32602, '<td valign="top">This place looks spooky to me. I''d like to know more about it. <br/>I like the red roof against the blue sky, some might say it is too red, but it lifts it out of the ordinary.</td>', 'This place looks spooky to me. I''d like to know more about it. I like the red roof against the blue sky, some might say it is too red, but it lifts it out of the ordinary.', '2005-04-16 07:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295742, 165896, 34836, '<td valign="top">Very unique viewpoint.  There''s something about this that I like (I''m just not sure what it is).  I think it might be the way the splash of orange sets off the dull color of the buildings and gate.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Very unique viewpoint.  There''s something about this that I like (I''m just not sure what it is).  I think it might be the way the splash of orange sets off the dull color of the buildings and gate.  Nicely done.', '2005-04-16 07:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295743, 164730, 32602, '<td valign="top">Yes, it is a beautiful view. The foreground shadows a bit dark perhaps, but good use of the building to frame and create interest.</td>', 'Yes, it is a beautiful view. The foreground shadows a bit dark perhaps, but good use of the building to frame and create interest.', '2005-04-16 07:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295745, 165667, 34836, '<td valign="top">The building looks small even though I''m sure it is a large structure.  It appears to blend into the background, especially on the left side.  All in all though, not too bad a photo.</td>', 'The building looks small even though I''m sure it is a large structure.  It appears to blend into the background, especially on the left side.  All in all though, not too bad a photo.', '2005-04-16 07:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295747, 165889, 34836, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The sun on the grass makes the picture very colorful but stills allows the shadows to swallow up the structure.</td>', 'Very nice.  The sun on the grass makes the picture very colorful but stills allows the shadows to swallow up the structure.', '2005-04-16 07:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295751, 165674, 34836, '<td valign="top">Darn, that thing looks like it''s coming down any second now.  Good contrast and color.  I think the composition could have bee just a little better.</td>', 'Darn, that thing looks like it''s coming down any second now.  Good contrast and color.  I think the composition could have bee just a little better.', '2005-04-16 07:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295752, 165886, 32602, '<td valign="top">I really like the view through the window to the other side of the street. The colour is just right for me. A lot of interesting things to look at, the closed book, the big book or papers lying open, the bridge in the background and the street sign etc.<br/>Very nice.</td>', 'I really like the view through the window to the other side of the street. The colour is just right for me. A lot of interesting things to look at, the closed book, the big book or papers lying open, the bridge in the background and the street sign etc.Very nice.', '2005-04-16 07:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295753, 165902, 34836, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Just the right amount of prcessing to bring out the multitude of colors.  I''m not sure it''s a first place photo, but it should do very well.</td>', 'Very well done.  Just the right amount of prcessing to bring out the multitude of colors.  I''m not sure it''s a first place photo, but it should do very well.', '2005-04-16 07:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295754, 165233, 32602, '<td valign="top">This is like something from a fairy-tale. Quite a lovely image.</td>', 'This is like something from a fairy-tale. Quite a lovely image.', '2005-04-16 07:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295758, 164796, 34836, '<td valign="top">I''m struggling to identify with this one.  I keep trying to figure out what the structure is.  It''s a little flat.  A 3/4 view might have been better to show some depth.</td>', 'I''m struggling to identify with this one.  I keep trying to figure out what the structure is.  It''s a little flat.  A 3/4 view might have been better to show some depth.', '2005-04-16 07:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295761, 165166, 32602, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is a dreamlike image. It brings to mind the house in the Wizard of Oz, I  expect a tornado to be just out of the frame, the point of view is effective in creating that feel.</td>', 'Oh, this is a dreamlike image. It brings to mind the house in the Wizard of Oz, I  expect a tornado to be just out of the frame, the point of view is effective in creating that feel.', '2005-04-16 07:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295762, 165679, 34836, '<td valign="top">A shame to let a house that big become abandoned.  The detail is good in the stairs.  The sun on the left is distracting.  It kind of breaks up the theme of the steps.</td>', 'A shame to let a house that big become abandoned.  The detail is good in the stairs.  The sun on the left is distracting.  It kind of breaks up the theme of the steps.', '2005-04-16 07:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295764, 164948, 34836, '<td valign="top">Unique coloring.  Interesting the way you got the sky to take on the same color as the building.  I would have tried to take out a little of the lean though.</td>', 'Unique coloring.  Interesting the way you got the sky to take on the same color as the building.  I would have tried to take out a little of the lean though.', '2005-04-16 07:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295767, 164703, 34836, '<td valign="top">A little too much processing on this.  You tried to hard to bring out the detail.  The scetion below the middle window is muddy from the process.</td>', 'A little too much processing on this.  You tried to hard to bring out the detail.  The scetion below the middle window is muddy from the process.', '2005-04-16 07:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295770, 166018, 34836, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Good composition.  The fence detracts from the abandoness because it looks too new.</td>', 'Nice colors.  Good composition.  The fence detracts from the abandoness because it looks too new.', '2005-04-16 07:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295774, 165886, 34836, '<td valign="top">One of the better window shots that I''ve seen so far.  You did a good job of showing the insides of the building through the window.  The detail is great and so is the contrast.</td>', 'One of the better window shots that I''ve seen so far.  You did a good job of showing the insides of the building through the window.  The detail is great and so is the contrast.', '2005-04-16 07:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295778, 165991, 31230, '<td valign="top">The tone really makes this shot along with the dark sky</td>', 'The tone really makes this shot along with the dark sky', '2005-04-16 07:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295779, 164311, 31230, '<td valign="top">Love it</td>', 'Love it', '2005-04-16 07:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295780, 164626, 34836, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  Good color as well.  The crop could be a little better.  The peak of the right arch is right at the top of the photo.  It makes it look like the border is being held up by the arch.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  Good color as well.  The crop could be a little better.  The peak of the right arch is right at the top of the photo.  It makes it look like the border is being held up by the arch.', '2005-04-16 08:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295788, 165858, 31230, '<td valign="top">Nice sky</td>', 'Nice sky', '2005-04-16 08:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295799, 165414, 34836, '<td valign="top">This is pretty good.  It took a little while to notice that you shot this thru a window.  I might have stepped back just a touch to emphasize the broken glass as a frame.  Compositionally, this is good.</td>', 'This is pretty good.  It took a little while to notice that you shot this thru a window.  I might have stepped back just a touch to emphasize the broken glass as a frame.  Compositionally, this is good.', '2005-04-16 08:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295805, 165993, 34836, '<td valign="top">The B&amp;W hurt this one.  It''s way too dark.  Next time, if you want to go monochromatic, you don''t have to use B&amp;W.  I think a different hue would have allowed you to bring out more detail.</td>', 'The B&W hurt this one.  It''s way too dark.  Next time, if you want to go monochromatic, you don''t have to use B&W.  I think a different hue would have allowed you to bring out more detail.', '2005-04-16 08:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295806, 165934, 34836, '<td valign="top">Very flat image.  There is no depth.  It looks like everything is glued to the wall.</td>', 'Very flat image.  There is no depth.  It looks like everything is glued to the wall.', '2005-04-16 08:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295807, 165466, 34836, '<td valign="top">Technically sound, but lacks in composition and interest.  There isn''t anything for the viewer to focus their attention on.</td>', 'Technically sound, but lacks in composition and interest.  There isn''t anything for the viewer to focus their attention on.', '2005-04-16 08:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295808, 165073, 34836, '<td valign="top">Nice halo affect, but I think it''s just a touch too bright right in the top center.  You''re getting a little washout right at the top of the building.</td>', 'Nice halo affect, but I think it''s just a touch too bright right in the top center.  You''re getting a little washout right at the top of the building.', '2005-04-16 08:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295810, 165930, 34836, '<td valign="top">Personally, I think it''s a boring buliding . . . but you did a great job with it.  I''ve always believed a good photographer (which leaves me out of the picture) can make any subject look good.  I think you may have some of the talent.</td>', 'Personally, I think it''s a boring buliding . . . but you did a great job with it.  I''ve always believed a good photographer (which leaves me out of the picture) can make any subject look good.  I think you may have some of the talent.', '2005-04-16 08:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295813, 165769, 34836, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  This is one photo where the people look okay as part of the picture.  You have good color saturation as well.  One thing I don''t like is your choice of cropping.  Just because you can go 640 x 640, doesn''t mean you have to.  I would have made this a vertical crop; leaving out the window on the right.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  This is one photo where the people look okay as part of the picture.  You have good color saturation as well.  One thing I don''t like is your choice of cropping.  Just because you can go 640 x 640, doesn''t mean you have to.  I would have made this a vertical crop; leaving out the window on the right.', '2005-04-16 08:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295814, 165534, 34836, '<td valign="top">It''s a little dark.  More contrast would have made this much more interesting.  I would have also sharpened the focus on the building wall.</td>', 'It''s a little dark.  More contrast would have made this much more interesting.  I would have also sharpened the focus on the building wall.', '2005-04-16 08:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295816, 166076, 34836, '<td valign="top">Nice color saturation and pretty good composition.  I don''t like the way the structure on the left has been cut in half.  I would try this agian but either add more of the left structure, or leave it off.</td>', 'Nice color saturation and pretty good composition.  I don''t like the way the structure on the left has been cut in half.  I would try this agian but either add more of the left structure, or leave it off.', '2005-04-16 08:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
