(1296503, 164370, 36538, '<td valign="top">Great shot  ... soo simple but perfect</td>', 'Great shot  ... soo simple but perfect', '2005-04-16 15:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296514, 164963, 34134, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Focus is a little soft, but doesn''t really detract. Good use of selective color.</td>', 'Nice composition. Focus is a little soft, but doesn''t really detract. Good use of selective color.', '2005-04-16 15:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296521, 165687, 35169, '<td valign="top">The deep sepia tones obsure the detail and detract from the overall image.  That''s just my opinion and here is the only place it counts.  It makes me work to determine the subject and feel of the image and that gives a veiwer an inclination to make a snap judgement and go onto the next image without rating it on its other merits, which I have resisted.  It is a beautiful sky, but too much of it.  By cropping down to just above the house, so the image is then verticle, the veiwer is then drawn into the subject and it becomes the focus of attention. Tthen_even the deep sepia is not such a deterence.</td>', 'The deep sepia tones obsure the detail and detract from the overall image.  That''s just my opinion and here is the only place it counts.  It makes me work to determine the subject and feel of the image and that gives a veiwer an inclination to make a snap judgement and go onto the next image without rating it on its other merits, which I have resisted.  It is a beautiful sky, but too much of it.  By cropping down to just above the house, so the image is then verticle, the veiwer is then drawn into the subject and it becomes the focus of attention. Tthen_even the deep sepia is not such a deterence.', '2005-04-16 15:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296522, 165938, 29474, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but the flowers are the focus and not the buildings.</td>', 'Nice picture, but the flowers are the focus and not the buildings.', '2005-04-16 15:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296527, 165148, 28742, '<td valign="top">Hope I''m wrong, but looks like you photoshopped much of the graffiti in. Didn''t do much for the shot anyway. Overall, it''s just relatively uninteresting to me.</td>', 'Hope I''m wrong, but looks like you photoshopped much of the graffiti in. Didn''t do much for the shot anyway. Overall, it''s just relatively uninteresting to me.', '2005-04-16 15:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296528, 166116, 29474, '<td valign="top">The picture has nice textures and colour, but needs a bit more of the over-growth to give the feeling of being abandoned.</td>', 'The picture has nice textures and colour, but needs a bit more of the over-growth to give the feeling of being abandoned.', '2005-04-16 15:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296530, 165946, 28742, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - good lighting, could be sharper, but not bad. Too bad it doesn''t meet the challenge topic (Abandoned BUILDINGS).</td>', 'Nice shot - good lighting, could be sharper, but not bad. Too bad it doesn''t meet the challenge topic (Abandoned BUILDINGS).', '2005-04-16 15:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296531, 164949, 35169, '<td valign="top">By cropping the top of this image off and making it a square presentation the subject matter becomes more revelant.  The branches with the white flowers dominate the scene and add confusion.  Wth a hint of them, the viewer sees the contrast of rot and decay amongst early spring foliage</td>', 'By cropping the top of this image off and making it a square presentation the subject matter becomes more revelant.  The branches with the white flowers dominate the scene and add confusion.  Wth a hint of them, the viewer sees the contrast of rot and decay amongst early spring foliage', '2005-04-16 15:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296533, 165769, 29474, '<td valign="top">Best picture by far. Although the people make it more ''rundown'' than abandoned.</td>', 'Best picture by far. Although the people make it more ''rundown'' than abandoned.', '2005-04-16 15:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296534, 165927, 28742, '<td valign="top">I will not be the first to say you should have either turned off the timestamp feature or cropped it out. Other than that, it''s a little dark, but still interesting.</td>', 'I will not be the first to say you should have either turned off the timestamp feature or cropped it out. Other than that, it''s a little dark, but still interesting.', '2005-04-16 15:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
