(1296866, 165733, 34659, '<td valign="top">I get the dead animal''s "body thing as a vessel", but have a difficult time correlating it to an "abandoned building".  Sorry.</td>', 'I get the dead animal''s "body thing as a vessel", but have a difficult time correlating it to an "abandoned building".  Sorry.', '2005-04-16 20:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
