(1296896, 165721, 34659, '<td valign="top">This almost looks painted or surreal - beautiful colors, sky, &amp; content...  I''m sure that your other work contains these eye-catching elements.  I scored you an 8, but some of the detraction was how "perfect" it was - it''s almost unnatural in apperance - also it looks a little skewed to the left (at the top).  It is a VERY beautiful shot - well done &amp; congrats.  There just seems to be "something" - and I''m still not sure what it is - that keeps me from rating it higher.  (Obviously, still well above average in a category with over 400 shots to rate (and I''m pretty conservative!), so please don''t take my comments the wrong way).</td>', 'This almost looks painted or surreal - beautiful colors, sky, & content...  I''m sure that your other work contains these eye-catching elements.  I scored you an 8, but some of the detraction was how "perfect" it was - it''s almost unnatural in apperance - also it looks a little skewed to the left (at the top).  It is a VERY beautiful shot - well done & congrats.  There just seems to be "something" - and I''m still not sure what it is - that keeps me from rating it higher.  (Obviously, still well above average in a category with over 400 shots to rate (and I''m pretty conservative!), so please don''t take my comments the wrong way).', '2005-04-16 20:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296897, 166043, 35530, '<td valign="top">The background is great. Building seems a bit fuzzy.</td>', 'The background is great. Building seems a bit fuzzy.', '2005-04-16 20:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
