(1298275, 164633, 33736, '<td valign="top">Immediate reaction was emotional.  Then I looked at the wardrobe.  All of a sudden, the young man didn''t appear too abandoned.  And with him using it, the building isn''t completely abandoned either.  In this case, for me, you almost did too good a job!</td>', 'Immediate reaction was emotional.  Then I looked at the wardrobe.  All of a sudden, the young man didn''t appear too abandoned.  And with him using it, the building isn''t completely abandoned either.  In this case, for me, you almost did too good a job!', '2005-04-17 18:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
