(1298309, 164661, 20315, '<td valign="top">I see there is some sun light at the top of the frame. It would be cool to see this same scene either a little later or earlier in the day with a beam of light across the boarded up windows or sign. I also think it would have made the image ''pop'' more, giving it more contrast. Just an idea.</td>', 'I see there is some sun light at the top of the frame. It would be cool to see this same scene either a little later or earlier in the day with a beam of light across the boarded up windows or sign. I also think it would have made the image ''pop'' more, giving it more contrast. Just an idea.', '2005-04-17 18:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
