(1298431, 165630, 33736, '<td valign="top">Too centered?  and a bit too flat. Otherwise, it''s a terrific bldg and set of trees.</td>', 'Too centered?  and a bit too flat. Otherwise, it''s a terrific bldg and set of trees.', '2005-04-17 20:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1298433, 165462, 34134, '<td valign="top">Slightly overexposed and a bit too contrasty for my eyes. Interesting subject. I think I might have cropped the left side a bit more to eliminate whatever that other structure is. Overall I like it.</td>', 'Slightly overexposed and a bit too contrasty for my eyes. Interesting subject. I think I might have cropped the left side a bit more to eliminate whatever that other structure is. Overall I like it.', '2005-04-17 20:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1298436, 165498, 33736, '<td valign="top">The blue of the sky and the lean of the bldg both feel a bit off.</td>', 'The blue of the sky and the lean of the bldg both feel a bit off.', '2005-04-17 20:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1298438, 165792, 34134, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture, but it reads a bit overprocessed for my eyes. The sharpness needs improvement. You might want to try the USM before saving for the web. The garbage containers in the foreground are very distracting.</td>', 'Interesting picture, but it reads a bit overprocessed for my eyes. The sharpness needs improvement. You might want to try the USM before saving for the web. The garbage containers in the foreground are very distracting.', '2005-04-17 20:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1298440, 165684, 34134, '<td valign="top">Nice sky, but the main subject is too dark to make out any detail.</td>', 'Nice sky, but the main subject is too dark to make out any detail.', '2005-04-17 20:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1298441, 165358, 32602, '<td valign="top">The image is clear and strong. I like the lines on the corrugated iron and the rust.<br/>I don''t think the black borders top and bottom are necessary.</td>', 'The image is clear and strong. I like the lines on the corrugated iron and the rust.I don''t think the black borders top and bottom are necessary.', '2005-04-17 20:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1298442, 164236, 34134, '<td valign="top">The crooked horizon is distracting, as is the overall yellow tint. The focus is a bit soft. You might want to use the USM before saving for the web. A bit contrasty--hard on the eyes to look at for too long. <br/> <br/>It was a good choice of subject, though.</td>', 'The crooked horizon is distracting, as is the overall yellow tint. The focus is a bit soft. You might want to use the USM before saving for the web. A bit contrasty--hard on the eyes to look at for too long.  It was a good choice of subject, though.', '2005-04-17 20:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
