(1299475, 164034, 36604, '<td valign="top">Pretty, and the flare works for you, rather than against you.  Your highlight/contrast adjustment has left a slight visible halo around the top of the birdhouse, though, something that always bugs me when it happens to me.  I hope another commenter has an idea about how to keep that from happening.</td>', 'Pretty, and the flare works for you, rather than against you.  Your highlight/contrast adjustment has left a slight visible halo around the top of the birdhouse, though, something that always bugs me when it happens to me.  I hope another commenter has an idea about how to keep that from happening.', '2005-04-18 04:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299477, 165931, 36604, '<td valign="top">Wow.  The water looks almost solid, and the overall picture has a wonderful blend of beauty and desolation.</td>', 'Wow.  The water looks almost solid, and the overall picture has a wonderful blend of beauty and desolation.', '2005-04-18 04:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
