(1299546, 164780, 36604, '<td valign="top">Glare from the windows is distracting, and makes the eye want to focus there (where it is blurry).  This is compounded by the fact that I have no idea what that red thing is in the dirt.<br/> <br/>The light and color on the dirt as it transitions into shadow is nice, though.</td>', 'Glare from the windows is distracting, and makes the eye want to focus there (where it is blurry).  This is compounded by the fact that I have no idea what that red thing is in the dirt. The light and color on the dirt as it transitions into shadow is nice, though.', '2005-04-18 05:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
