(1299630, 165482, 26679, '<td valign="top">Age old is an interesting perception, in my home coultry this would have to be atleast 1000 years old to qualify for that statement.<br/>I like the  way you have composed this image, I do feel however that the shuttering is just a little too bright for the general tone of the rest of the building.<br/>I would have played a little with outo contrast and autolevels to try and reduce the glare..<br/></td>', 'Age old is an interesting perception, in my home coultry this would have to be atleast 1000 years old to qualify for that statement.I like the  way you have composed this image, I do feel however that the shuttering is just a little too bright for the general tone of the rest of the building.I would have played a little with outo contrast and autolevels to try and reduce the glare..', '2005-04-18 07:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
