(1299659, 166027, 36060, '<td valign="top">Very good shot indeed.</td>', 'Very good shot indeed.', '2005-04-18 07:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299713, 165037, 14671, '<td valign="top">A very nice shot but the contrast of the sky is to bright.  It washes some of the detail out of the photo(building.  It is nicely framed and one of the more beautiful photos I have seen with a landscape view but it really doesn''t look abandoned.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'A very nice shot but the contrast of the sky is to bright.  It washes some of the detail out of the photo(building.  It is nicely framed and one of the more beautiful photos I have seen with a landscape view but it really doesn''t look abandoned.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-18 08:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299715, 164368, 14671, '<td valign="top">I find the building to be a little on the dark side while the sky is way to washed out/over contrasted.  The bright spot on the left side is a tad distracting as well.  It is a great barn shot tho nd good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'I find the building to be a little on the dark side while the sky is way to washed out/over contrasted.  The bright spot on the left side is a tad distracting as well.  It is a great barn shot tho nd good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-18 08:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299719, 165640, 14671, '<td valign="top">The contrast in the picture is a little bright and makes the picture looked a bit washed.  I also think your shot should have included more of the building instead of just a window. I do however like the paint peeling off the buildings exterior and think it adds to the picture.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'The contrast in the picture is a little bright and makes the picture looked a bit washed.  I also think your shot should have included more of the building instead of just a window. I do however like the paint peeling off the buildings exterior and think it adds to the picture.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-18 08:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299722, 166094, 14671, '<td valign="top">Personally I would have gotten a little closer and tried to show more house with better detail on the roof.  In this shot I find its the stuff growing on the roof that makes this photo interesting.  I''m also not fond of the grey border on this photo and think it would have looked better black.  Good luck in this chalenge.</td>', 'Personally I would have gotten a little closer and tried to show more house with better detail on the roof.  In this shot I find its the stuff growing on the roof that makes this photo interesting.  I''m also not fond of the grey border on this photo and think it would have looked better black.  Good luck in this chalenge.', '2005-04-18 08:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299726, 165345, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nothing in this photo would suggest to me that the building is abandoned.  It does look old and historic but not abandoned. The picture is fairly crisp and the dimensions you have chosen for the photo fit it well.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'Nothing in this photo would suggest to me that the building is abandoned.  It does look old and historic but not abandoned. The picture is fairly crisp and the dimensions you have chosen for the photo fit it well.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-04-18 08:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
