(1300483, 165684, 36604, '<td valign="top">The sky is very impressive, but the building is too dark in comparison.  It''s just bright enough not to be a silhouette, but dark enough to be uncomfortable to look at.</td>', 'The sky is very impressive, but the building is too dark in comparison.  It''s just bright enough not to be a silhouette, but dark enough to be uncomfortable to look at.', '2005-04-18 13:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300485, 165415, 29148, '<td valign="top">While an interesting texture study, I don''t get a sense of abandonment.</td>', 'While an interesting texture study, I don''t get a sense of abandonment.', '2005-04-18 13:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300486, 164851, 36006, '<td valign="top">nice lines. whites need work. nice comp. nice texture. a bit soft, not bad.</td>', 'nice lines. whites need work. nice comp. nice texture. a bit soft, not bad.', '2005-04-18 13:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300488, 165024, 36006, '<td valign="top">whites need work. nice framing with branchs. a bit soft, not bad.</td>', 'whites need work. nice framing with branchs. a bit soft, not bad.', '2005-04-18 13:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300492, 165771, 36006, '<td valign="top">nice dapples of light. blacks and whites good. color ok. nice lines.</td>', 'nice dapples of light. blacks and whites good. color ok. nice lines.', '2005-04-18 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300494, 165086, 36604, '<td valign="top">She looks like she has one foot in the air; I''m amazed you got her to stand like that for long enough to leave such a strong image without any trace of her exit.</td>', 'She looks like she has one foot in the air; I''m amazed you got her to stand like that for long enough to leave such a strong image without any trace of her exit.', '2005-04-18 13:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300495, 165993, 29148, '<td valign="top">While certainly appearing abandoned, I don''t find anything appealing about the building. It could have been a little brighter too, especially in the bottom of the building.</td>', 'While certainly appearing abandoned, I don''t find anything appealing about the building. It could have been a little brighter too, especially in the bottom of the building.', '2005-04-18 13:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300497, 164975, 36006, '<td valign="top">whites need work. nice dof. nie use of window for a frame. good texture. a bit dim, not bad.</td>', 'whites need work. nice dof. nie use of window for a frame. good texture. a bit dim, not bad.', '2005-04-18 13:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300498, 166089, 28801, '<td valign="top">This is a unique shot, very creative. I love the light</td>', 'This is a unique shot, very creative. I love the light', '2005-04-18 13:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300503, 165676, 29148, '<td valign="top">I''m not an expert but your green grass looks artificial, too bright. Not a bad shot, might have been improved with a non-centered compositions if possible.</td>', 'I''m not an expert but your green grass looks artificial, too bright. Not a bad shot, might have been improved with a non-centered compositions if possible.', '2005-04-18 13:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300508, 165803, 29148, '<td valign="top">Good subject, but I find the power lines very distracting. Better to find a different subject than one with serious flaws.</td>', 'Good subject, but I find the power lines very distracting. Better to find a different subject than one with serious flaws.', '2005-04-18 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300517, 165988, 29148, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this is abandoned or not, but I did not rate you down for that. Your composition could be improved by shifting the cabin to the left or right, or try to get the horizon from dead center. The shadows help the detail, perhaps they could have been a little longer, i.e. later in the day.</td>', 'I don''t know if this is abandoned or not, but I did not rate you down for that. Your composition could be improved by shifting the cabin to the left or right, or try to get the horizon from dead center. The shadows help the detail, perhaps they could have been a little longer, i.e. later in the day.', '2005-04-18 13:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300521, 164472, 29148, '<td valign="top">Not very interesting, where is the abandoned building aspect to your photo?</td>', 'Not very interesting, where is the abandoned building aspect to your photo?', '2005-04-18 13:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300527, 165946, 29148, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, but I don''t consider that a building. Keep thinking outside the box, you''ll find something that will really score.</td>', 'Interesting photo, but I don''t consider that a building. Keep thinking outside the box, you''ll find something that will really score.', '2005-04-18 13:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300532, 166079, 29148, '<td valign="top">Where is the abandoned building? Is that a strip mall, or motel? I don''t think the fence helped convey an abandoned look.</td>', 'Where is the abandoned building? Is that a strip mall, or motel? I don''t think the fence helped convey an abandoned look.', '2005-04-18 13:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300533, 163854, 13648, '<td valign="top">Nice subject but over exposed</td>', 'Nice subject but over exposed', '2005-04-18 13:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300539, 164990, 29148, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, glad the sky cooperated for you. High rating.</td>', 'Excellent composition, glad the sky cooperated for you. High rating.', '2005-04-18 13:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300546, 166104, 29148, '<td valign="top">A nice simple, but effective, composition of those numerous derelict farm building.s</td>', 'A nice simple, but effective, composition of those numerous derelict farm building.s', '2005-04-18 13:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300554, 164887, 29148, '<td valign="top">Good eye for the texture, good composition.</td>', 'Good eye for the texture, good composition.', '2005-04-18 13:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
