(1300580, 164160, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, especially with the old truck in there.<br/>A little tilted (level the roof lines) and perhaps a slightly smaller (and black) border would look a little better in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice composition, especially with the old truck in there.A little tilted (level the roof lines) and perhaps a slightly smaller (and black) border would look a little better in my opinion.', '2005-04-18 13:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300584, 165997, 19708, '<td valign="top">Decent composition. At 366x298 pixels, this image is a bit on the small size and suspect it will suffer in a challenge.</td>', 'Decent composition. At 366x298 pixels, this image is a bit on the small size and suspect it will suffer in a challenge.', '2005-04-18 13:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300590, 166083, 19708, '<td valign="top">Pretty unusual shot in this challenge.<br/>Great title for the shot.</td>', 'Pretty unusual shot in this challenge.Great title for the shot.', '2005-04-18 13:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300592, 165684, 28801, '<td valign="top">The clouds have it.  This is excellent!</td>', 'The clouds have it.  This is excellent!', '2005-04-18 13:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300595, 166010, 19708, '<td valign="top">Well seen.<br/>Shame about the power lines, but such is real life. Slant on the fence line is a bit odd to the eye though. A slightly different perspective would help this in my opinion.</td>', 'Well seen.Shame about the power lines, but such is real life. Slant on the fence line is a bit odd to the eye though. A slightly different perspective would help this in my opinion.', '2005-04-18 13:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300597, 166103, 6804, '<td valign="top">This capture is loaded with unusual colors that really stand out in this challenge.   I love the sliver of light showing through the back wall and the diagonal lines from the door hanging on one hinge is just perfect.  Great detail in the wood and the gritty feel of this is just right without going too far.    This is one of my eleven 10''s in this challenge.  Great work!</td>', 'This capture is loaded with unusual colors that really stand out in this challenge.   I love the sliver of light showing through the back wall and the diagonal lines from the door hanging on one hinge is just perfect.  Great detail in the wood and the gritty feel of this is just right without going too far.    This is one of my eleven 10''s in this challenge.  Great work!', '2005-04-18 13:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300599, 165478, 19708, '<td valign="top">Good composition, though the tilt on the left building is a bit distracting, having the telephone pole straight. Perhaps a little higher point of view may have helped, along with a little less on the wide angle setting. Your choice for making it a B&amp;W was a wise one.<br/></td>', 'Good composition, though the tilt on the left building is a bit distracting, having the telephone pole straight. Perhaps a little higher point of view may have helped, along with a little less on the wide angle setting. Your choice for making it a B&W was a wise one.', '2005-04-18 13:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300605, 165919, 19708, '<td valign="top">Good composition.<br/>My first thought was to have waited until the boat wake went away, then caught the title - it''s frozen. (or is it?)</td>', 'Good composition.My first thought was to have waited until the boat wake went away, then caught the title - it''s frozen. (or is it?)', '2005-04-18 13:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300609, 166135, 19708, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a building I saw many years ago in Jamaica.<br/>Well seen.</td>', 'Reminds me of a building I saw many years ago in Jamaica.Well seen.', '2005-04-18 13:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300610, 166095, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice artistic interpretation on this challenge.<br/>There is beauty in what society calls an eyesore.<br/>Well Done!</td>', 'Nice artistic interpretation on this challenge.There is beauty in what society calls an eyesore.Well Done!', '2005-04-18 13:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300616, 165639, 19708, '<td valign="top">Not really sure this says abandoned to me.<br/>Nice artistic interpretation on this challenge though.<br/>Border is a bit too large for a challenge in my opinion, but great for a shot of this type.</td>', 'Not really sure this says abandoned to me.Nice artistic interpretation on this challenge though.Border is a bit too large for a challenge in my opinion, but great for a shot of this type.', '2005-04-18 13:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300618, 165674, 19708, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge.<br/>Perhaps shooting at a different time of the day would have helped with the sky not being blown out, but hey, sometimes we have time constraints in our lives huh?<br/>Well seen.</td>', 'Good take on the challenge.Perhaps shooting at a different time of the day would have helped with the sky not being blown out, but hey, sometimes we have time constraints in our lives huh?Well seen.', '2005-04-18 13:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300622, 164953, 19708, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge.<br/>Nice point of view on this shot. Even snagged a bird in there too.<br/>Well seen.</td>', 'Good take on the challenge.Nice point of view on this shot. Even snagged a bird in there too.Well seen.', '2005-04-18 13:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
