(1300651, 166018, 19708, '<td valign="top">At 500x375 pixels, it''s a bit small for a challenge (too much detail loss)<br/>Sky is a little blown out too. Shooting at a different time of the day may have helped too (early or late in the day when the sun &amp; UV levels aren''t so harsh).</td>', 'At 500x375 pixels, it''s a bit small for a challenge (too much detail loss)Sky is a little blown out too. Shooting at a different time of the day may have helped too (early or late in the day when the sun & UV levels aren''t so harsh).', '2005-04-18 14:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300652, 165237, 28801, '<td valign="top">A beautiful setting with nice, warm lighting but it make me think more of abandoned seats than abandoned buildings.</td>', 'A beautiful setting with nice, warm lighting but it make me think more of abandoned seats than abandoned buildings.', '2005-04-18 14:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300656, 165029, 19708, '<td valign="top">Well seen.<br/>Composition, color &amp; detail are good. Probably didn''t need the border in there, but if you like it, then that''s all that matters. (took nothing away because of it either)</td>', 'Well seen.Composition, color & detail are good. Probably didn''t need the border in there, but if you like it, then that''s all that matters. (took nothing away because of it either)', '2005-04-18 14:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
