(1300690, 164975, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great choice for conversion to B&amp;W.<br/>Well seen and composed.</td>', 'Great choice for conversion to B&W.Well seen and composed.', '2005-04-18 14:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300699, 165333, 19708, '<td valign="top">Natural framing with the trees is a bit distractig in my opinion.<br/>As a suggestion, try taking the image into Photoshop (assuming you have it), and in the Hue/Saturation adjustments, take the yellow channel hue and saturation to the right a little (may 10 pts) and bright the lightness down a bit (10-20 pts) to give the yellows more of a darker, richer green look, and bring the red saturation up just a little.</td>', 'Natural framing with the trees is a bit distractig in my opinion.As a suggestion, try taking the image into Photoshop (assuming you have it), and in the Hue/Saturation adjustments, take the yellow channel hue and saturation to the right a little (may 10 pts) and bright the lightness down a bit (10-20 pts) to give the yellows more of a darker, richer green look, and bring the red saturation up just a little.', '2005-04-18 14:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300701, 164968, 19708, '<td valign="top">Well seen.<br/>I like the Ivy growth and the missing plaster/stucco.</td>', 'Well seen.I like the Ivy growth and the missing plaster/stucco.', '2005-04-18 14:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
