(1303353, 166092, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the over all tonality of this picture.  The only thing I may have tried differently was to show the entire window in a vertical presentation.</td>', 'I like the over all tonality of this picture.  The only thing I may have tried differently was to show the entire window in a vertical presentation.', '2005-04-19 09:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303354, 164626, 35548, '<td valign="top">This in my opinion is one of those images that the photographer goes crazy trying to take.....The head talk goes like this....need to get the base of the  arch in the photo....need to get the arch in the photo, need to get the background building in the photo so that it plays a major rule to the image...I see the struggle....Nice processing and I put you on the plus side for the work you did. 6</td>', 'This in my opinion is one of those images that the photographer goes crazy trying to take.....The head talk goes like this....need to get the base of the  arch in the photo....need to get the arch in the photo, need to get the background building in the photo so that it plays a major rule to the image...I see the struggle....Nice processing and I put you on the plus side for the work you did. 6', '2005-04-19 09:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303355, 166004, 15711, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this.  The contrast of the shadow and light, colors and textures is outstanding.  Worthy of a blue ribbon in my opinion.  Excellent!</td>', 'Absolutely love this.  The contrast of the shadow and light, colors and textures is outstanding.  Worthy of a blue ribbon in my opinion.  Excellent!', '2005-04-19 09:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
