(1303425, 164679, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like this old building.  Besides the electric line running through the picture I think you could have cropped it a little tighter on the left to give more impact to the house.</td>', 'I like this old building.  Besides the electric line running through the picture I think you could have cropped it a little tighter on the left to give more impact to the house.', '2005-04-19 09:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
