(1304359, 165379, 36616, '<td valign="top">crisp</td>', 'crisp', '2005-04-19 14:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304362, 166051, 19708, '<td valign="top">I''m finding myself leaning en petit peu just looking at it.<br/>:)<br/>Very unusual building you captured here and can''t help but to wonder if it really appears that crooked. Shame it''s an open challenge and you couldn''t clone out/burn the lights on the building to the left.</td>', 'I''m finding myself leaning en petit peu just looking at it.:)Very unusual building you captured here and can''t help but to wonder if it really appears that crooked. Shame it''s an open challenge and you couldn''t clone out/burn the lights on the building to the left.', '2005-04-19 14:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304378, 163918, 19708, '<td valign="top">Well seen capturing the shadows and intersecting lines.<br/>Can''t say this stands out as abandoned, but give all the benefit of the doubt in this challenge and assume it so.<br/>Was the blur intentional?<br/></td>', 'Well seen capturing the shadows and intersecting lines.Can''t say this stands out as abandoned, but give all the benefit of the doubt in this challenge and assume it so.Was the blur intentional?', '2005-04-19 14:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304379, 164311, 36616, '<td valign="top">classic shot</td>', 'classic shot', '2005-04-19 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304391, 164615, 19708, '<td valign="top">I''m sure the area was bleak and lacking much in the way of life, but maybe a hue shift on the yellow channel with a slight increase in sauration and a drop in brightness would give this a richer, deeper feel to it.</td>', 'I''m sure the area was bleak and lacking much in the way of life, but maybe a hue shift on the yellow channel with a slight increase in sauration and a drop in brightness would give this a richer, deeper feel to it.', '2005-04-19 14:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304404, 165934, 19708, '<td valign="top">Not sure I get the title to picture correlation here. I see what looks to be a mess in an abandoned building/stairwell though. A little down on the brightness would richen this shot,</td>', 'Not sure I get the title to picture correlation here. I see what looks to be a mess in an abandoned building/stairwell though. A little down on the brightness would richen this shot,', '2005-04-19 14:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304409, 164625, 36616, '<td valign="top">nice composition</td>', 'nice composition', '2005-04-19 14:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304419, 166043, 19708, '<td valign="top">Mixed feelings on this one.<br/>The building is horizontal, yet the crop is vertical. Kinda'' throws things off in my opinion.<br/>Well seen though and good use of the horizonatls breaking up the shot.</td>', 'Mixed feelings on this one.The building is horizontal, yet the crop is vertical. Kinda'' throws things off in my opinion.Well seen though and good use of the horizonatls breaking up the shot.', '2005-04-19 14:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304424, 164963, 36616, '<td valign="top">nice contrast</td>', 'nice contrast', '2005-04-19 14:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304435, 164779, 19708, '<td valign="top">I passed by this on the first go-around, voting only, as needed to come back to it.<br/>That being done, the post-processing used here makes this look like a 40-50 yer photograph. Well seen !</td>', 'I passed by this on the first go-around, voting only, as needed to come back to it.That being done, the post-processing used here makes this look like a 40-50 yer photograph. Well seen !', '2005-04-19 14:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304447, 164755, 6668, '<td valign="top">I really like the angle of this shot.</td>', 'I really like the angle of this shot.', '2005-04-19 14:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304449, 165679, 36616, '<td valign="top">my favourite artist</td>', 'my favourite artist', '2005-04-19 14:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304468, 165742, 6668, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2005-04-19 14:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304532, 164990, 19708, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and boy oh boy what that sky does for it!<br/>Reds a bit too saturated, but took nothing away because of it.<br/>After looking back on this, I feel the reds are right on for the shot and kicking it up to a 10 now. One of my favorites, and into my favorites!</td>', 'Wonderful composition and boy oh boy what that sky does for it!Reds a bit too saturated, but took nothing away because of it.After looking back on this, I feel the reds are right on for the shot and kicking it up to a 10 now. One of my favorites, and into my favorites!', '2005-04-19 15:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304608, 166093, 19708, '<td valign="top">Well seen and composed.<br/>Shame we don''t have all the time in the world to wait until the weather/sky conditions are right. A dark, moody sky would have really helped.<br/>If you have Photoshop, one way to darken the sky a bit would be to go into the selective colors, drop-down to the white and move the black slider over and watch what happens. All legal as it is doing to all the white in the image.</td>', 'Well seen and composed.Shame we don''t have all the time in the world to wait until the weather/sky conditions are right. A dark, moody sky would have really helped.If you have Photoshop, one way to darken the sky a bit would be to go into the selective colors, drop-down to the white and move the black slider over and watch what happens. All legal as it is doing to all the white in the image.', '2005-04-19 15:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304614, 164060, 19708, '<td valign="top">Unique composition with the two levels of bricks in this shot. Detail level is good.<br/>Shame we don''t have all the time in the world to wait until the weather/sky conditions are right. A darker sky would have helped.<br/>If you have Photoshop, one way to darken the sky a bit would be to go into the selective colors, drop-down to the white and move the black slider over and watch what happens. All legal as it is doing to all the white in the image.</td>', 'Unique composition with the two levels of bricks in this shot. Detail level is good.Shame we don''t have all the time in the world to wait until the weather/sky conditions are right. A darker sky would have helped.If you have Photoshop, one way to darken the sky a bit would be to go into the selective colors, drop-down to the white and move the black slider over and watch what happens. All legal as it is doing to all the white in the image.', '2005-04-19 15:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304629, 164703, 19708, '<td valign="top">Let''s see how I can say this.<br/>I''m not sure the post-processing was done like this on purpose, but the image is far too bright/contrasty in my opinion. The highlights are blown-out (unrecoverable white with no detail in it). Image is a bit tilted to the left also, making it a bit awkward to look at properly.<br/>Shame this was an open challenge as some burning &amp; dodging could bring this one out a lot better.</td>', 'Let''s see how I can say this.I''m not sure the post-processing was done like this on purpose, but the image is far too bright/contrasty in my opinion. The highlights are blown-out (unrecoverable white with no detail in it). Image is a bit tilted to the left also, making it a bit awkward to look at properly.Shame this was an open challenge as some burning & dodging could bring this one out a lot better.', '2005-04-19 15:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304643, 165129, 19708, '<td valign="top">Funny how something could stare one right in the face and not see it.<br/>I looked for a connection to the title and didn''t see it at first, trying to pay more attention to the building than anything else.<br/>The crop is a little off with the top of the roof missing. maybe a tighter crop or a wider angle would have helped this out a bit.<br/>Interesting tone, perhaps a bit too yellow, but still effective.</td>', 'Funny how something could stare one right in the face and not see it.I looked for a connection to the title and didn''t see it at first, trying to pay more attention to the building than anything else.The crop is a little off with the top of the roof missing. maybe a tighter crop or a wider angle would have helped this out a bit.Interesting tone, perhaps a bit too yellow, but still effective.', '2005-04-19 15:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304653, 166087, 19708, '<td valign="top">Sure appears to meet the challenge to me.<br/>I know it was kind of tough getting that much bright and that much dark in a happy middle. Shame it was an open challenge, as a bit of burning/dodging would have been a big help.<br/>Keep Out huh? Anyone you know?<br/>:)</td>', 'Sure appears to meet the challenge to me.I know it was kind of tough getting that much bright and that much dark in a happy middle. Shame it was an open challenge, as a bit of burning/dodging would have been a big help.Keep Out huh? Anyone you know?:)', '2005-04-19 15:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304667, 165651, 19708, '<td valign="top">This shot is screaming for a member challenge in order to burn / dodge it. Well seen!<br/>The shadow on the house adds quite a different feel to it. Perhaps just a little darker would balance out the overall exposure levels.</td>', 'This shot is screaming for a member challenge in order to burn / dodge it. Well seen!The shadow on the house adds quite a different feel to it. Perhaps just a little darker would balance out the overall exposure levels.', '2005-04-19 15:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304674, 165957, 19708, '<td valign="top">Sure it''s abadoned? Almost looks like a ghost-like figure on the wall, under the window.<br/>Unique point of view, almost like looking through a peep hole.</td>', 'Sure it''s abadoned? Almost looks like a ghost-like figure on the wall, under the window.Unique point of view, almost like looking through a peep hole.', '2005-04-19 15:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304681, 165968, 19708, '<td valign="top">Focal point on this is the horse, being the darker, more prominent object.<br/>Tree/branches ar adding a bit of distraction (in a way, in a way not) in it''s current exposure levels. This shot could be so much better if it had been a member challenge and you had the opportunity to burn in some of the wall for instance.</td>', 'Focal point on this is the horse, being the darker, more prominent object.Tree/branches ar adding a bit of distraction (in a way, in a way not) in it''s current exposure levels. This shot could be so much better if it had been a member challenge and you had the opportunity to burn in some of the wall for instance.', '2005-04-19 15:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304691, 164739, 19708, '<td valign="top">Mixed feelings here on this shot.<br/>Angle seems a bit extreme for the point of view, yet adds something in it''s own way.<br/>Not sure she was really needed in the shot to give perspective, as she seems to become a major focal point in the shot.<br/>Bringing the brightness down a bit and the contrst up may help as the saturation levels seem a bit faded.<br/>Then again, maybe I have no idea what I am talking about - just my opinion.<br/>What''s important to you really is the bottom line.<br/>Title means? (I''m old - LOL)</td>', 'Mixed feelings here on this shot.Angle seems a bit extreme for the point of view, yet adds something in it''s own way.Not sure she was really needed in the shot to give perspective, as she seems to become a major focal point in the shot.Bringing the brightness down a bit and the contrst up may help as the saturation levels seem a bit faded.Then again, maybe I have no idea what I am talking about - just my opinion.What''s important to you really is the bottom line.Title means? (I''m old - LOL)', '2005-04-19 16:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304695, 166132, 19708, '<td valign="top">I see where you were going with this shot and was well seen.<br/>Sharpness/detail is hurting this mage in my opinion, as the right foreground straw is predominant in this picture and it''s focus is off/too soft in my opinion.</td>', 'I see where you were going with this shot and was well seen.Sharpness/detail is hurting this mage in my opinion, as the right foreground straw is predominant in this picture and it''s focus is off/too soft in my opinion.', '2005-04-19 16:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304704, 164313, 19708, '<td valign="top">Urban decay in it''s finest artistic form.<br/>Point of view is good here, with the diagnonals and perspective leading my eyes right to the main focal point. Sky looks like it took a hit from maybe neat image?<br/>Well seen!</td>', 'Urban decay in it''s finest artistic form.Point of view is good here, with the diagnonals and perspective leading my eyes right to the main focal point. Sky looks like it took a hit from maybe neat image?Well seen!', '2005-04-19 16:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304710, 165467, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice moody composition - well done. Would be curious to see this in a B&amp;W/Duotone.<br/>Good eye!<br/>Came back to bump this one up a couple notches. The more I look at it, the more I like it.</td>', 'Nice moody composition - well done. Would be curious to see this in a B&W/Duotone.Good eye!Came back to bump this one up a couple notches. The more I look at it, the more I like it.', '2005-04-19 16:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304714, 165895, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice artistic interpretation on this challenge.<br/>Detail in the plaster/stucco textures and in the broken brickwork add a lot to this shot.<br/>Good eye!</td>', 'Nice artistic interpretation on this challenge.Detail in the plaster/stucco textures and in the broken brickwork add a lot to this shot.Good eye!', '2005-04-19 16:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304720, 164626, 19708, '<td valign="top">Good exposure control and level of detail.<br/>I also like the framing of the distant tower between the uprights.</td>', 'Good exposure control and level of detail.I also like the framing of the distant tower between the uprights.', '2005-04-19 16:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304725, 165271, 19708, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this, the more I like it.<br/>You have a good eye for a composition / crop and like all the intersecting textures.<br/>Good choice for B&amp;W too. Had to bump it up a notch.</td>', 'The more I look at this, the more I like it.You have a good eye for a composition / crop and like all the intersecting textures.Good choice for B&W too. Had to bump it up a notch.', '2005-04-19 16:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304729, 165943, 19708, '<td valign="top">Well seen and cropped.<br/>The toning in your post-processing this shot adds a lot to the mood.Is that a person on the upper left balcony?</td>', 'Well seen and cropped.The toning in your post-processing this shot adds a lot to the mood.Is that a person on the upper left balcony?', '2005-04-19 16:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304737, 164970, 19708, '<td valign="top">Well seen and composed.<br/>In my opinion, the shot coud use some white in it, but then again can''t dodge in an open challenge.</td>', 'Well seen and composed.In my opinion, the shot coud use some white in it, but then again can''t dodge in an open challenge.', '2005-04-19 16:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304743, 165519, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very harsh lighting.  Ya might wanna try again later in the evening or early in the morning...<br/>TC</td>', 'Very harsh lighting.  Ya might wanna try again later in the evening or early in the morning...TC', '2005-04-19 16:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304748, 165481, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a very beautiful shot.  The barn is red too.  Are you in Michigan or the midwest?  Not so many red ones if you get outside this area...  My only real complaint is that it doesn''t look all that abandoned...<br/>TC</td>', 'This is a very beautiful shot.  The barn is red too.  Are you in Michigan or the midwest?  Not so many red ones if you get outside this area...  My only real complaint is that it doesn''t look all that abandoned...TC', '2005-04-19 16:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304755, 165931, 9906, '<td valign="top">The scene here is awesome!  Too bad the time of day wasn''t the best for this shot.  Can you reshoot?  If so, post it so we can see!<br/>TC</td>', 'The scene here is awesome!  Too bad the time of day wasn''t the best for this shot.  Can you reshoot?  If so, post it so we can see!TC', '2005-04-19 16:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304756, 165454, 9906, '<td valign="top">Evil radish cans!  :-P<br/>TC</td>', 'Evil radish cans!  :-PTC', '2005-04-19 16:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304757, 165530, 36686, '<td valign="top">I think it is a very good photo. You should take it again, but under very bad weather conditions (rainy, black sky, thunder and lightning). In all of those combinations of bad weather don''t forget not to hide under the big tree. :-)</td>', 'I think it is a very good photo. You should take it again, but under very bad weather conditions (rainy, black sky, thunder and lightning). In all of those combinations of bad weather don''t forget not to hide under the big tree. :-)', '2005-04-19 16:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304761, 166075, 9906, '<td valign="top">This building holds incredible character!  Your sky unfortunately detracts from the image.  Would love to see this reshot during a different time of day or with dramatic (spelled cloudy) skies.  Hope this is a place you can revisit easily cause I would love to see more of it...<br/>TC</td>', 'This building holds incredible character!  Your sky unfortunately detracts from the image.  Would love to see this reshot during a different time of day or with dramatic (spelled cloudy) skies.  Hope this is a place you can revisit easily cause I would love to see more of it...TC', '2005-04-19 16:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304766, 165386, 9906, '<td valign="top">Clone that damn sign out and lighten your shadows a smidge and this shot would be incredible!<br/>TC</td>', 'Clone that damn sign out and lighten your shadows a smidge and this shot would be incredible!TC', '2005-04-19 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304769, 165129, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great exposure and beautiful toning, but your crop makes me wanna see more.  Pull back a tad and this would be awesome!<br/>TC</td>', 'Great exposure and beautiful toning, but your crop makes me wanna see more.  Pull back a tad and this would be awesome!TC', '2005-04-19 16:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304772, 165352, 9906, '<td valign="top">Too overprocessed for my taste...<br/>TC</td>', 'Too overprocessed for my taste...TC', '2005-04-19 16:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304780, 165086, 8066, '<td valign="top">WOW 10</td>', 'WOW 10', '2005-04-19 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304790, 165076, 33126, '<td valign="top">Nicely centered</td>', 'Nicely centered', '2005-04-19 16:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304796, 164703, 33126, '<td valign="top">The kind of picture I would like to take.</td>', 'The kind of picture I would like to take.', '2005-04-19 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304804, 165946, 33126, '<td valign="top">Good idea</td>', 'Good idea', '2005-04-19 16:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304806, 165660, 23053, '<td valign="top">This just looks a bit over-exposed or over-saturated, one.  Granted, that does add to the unsettling nature of the shot, so maybe it''s not a bad thing.</td>', 'This just looks a bit over-exposed or over-saturated, one.  Granted, that does add to the unsettling nature of the shot, so maybe it''s not a bad thing.', '2005-04-19 16:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304809, 166056, 23053, '<td valign="top">I like the background as it almost looks painted.  I think this is an interesting subject, but maybe too close of a shot.  The way the sides are cut off feels funny to me.</td>', 'I like the background as it almost looks painted.  I think this is an interesting subject, but maybe too close of a shot.  The way the sides are cut off feels funny to me.', '2005-04-19 16:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304811, 165897, 23053, '<td valign="top">It may have been your intention to photograph this in such a way that the subject blending in with the background, but for me it makes it hard to see certain aspects of the shot.  I would have preferred a greater dissociation of the two elements.</td>', 'It may have been your intention to photograph this in such a way that the subject blending in with the background, but for me it makes it hard to see certain aspects of the shot.  I would have preferred a greater dissociation of the two elements.', '2005-04-19 16:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304818, 164615, 36689, '<td valign="top">Pretty Impressive Idea</td>', 'Pretty Impressive Idea', '2005-04-19 16:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304820, 165630, 23053, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see the top of the tree in this shot...the way it is cut off doesn''t seem to fit in my opinion.</td>', 'I wish I could see the top of the tree in this shot...the way it is cut off doesn''t seem to fit in my opinion.', '2005-04-19 16:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304824, 165933, 23053, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see shots of this exact subject at different times of day to see how the shadow changes.  The shadow in this shot is distracting to me, notably the one from above in the top left corner.</td>', 'I''d like to see shots of this exact subject at different times of day to see how the shadow changes.  The shadow in this shot is distracting to me, notably the one from above in the top left corner.', '2005-04-19 16:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304828, 165858, 23053, '<td valign="top">Beautiful B&amp;W...the contrast of light to dark is very nice.  This looks like a high-placing shot, so we''ll see how it turns out.</td>', 'Beautiful B&W...the contrast of light to dark is very nice.  This looks like a high-placing shot, so we''ll see how it turns out.', '2005-04-19 16:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304829, 165776, 23053, '<td valign="top">Great find...</td>', 'Great find...', '2005-04-19 16:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304856, 165733, 11897, '<td valign="top">I don''t particularly care for pictures of dead animals but I have not scored this low for that reason. There is no building, as such it doesn''t meet the challenge at all.</td>', 'I don''t particularly care for pictures of dead animals but I have not scored this low for that reason. There is no building, as such it doesn''t meet the challenge at all.', '2005-04-19 17:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304863, 164051, 11897, '<td valign="top">A little out of focus, maybe a different angle could have helped the composition on this.</td>', 'A little out of focus, maybe a different angle could have helped the composition on this.', '2005-04-19 17:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304864, 165794, 23053, '<td valign="top">This looks like a bomb went off...that or demolition.  Kinda cool.</td>', 'This looks like a bomb went off...that or demolition.  Kinda cool.', '2005-04-19 17:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304886, 164103, 23053, '<td valign="top">I wish the subject weren''t cut off on the left, other than that, it''s a good shot.</td>', 'I wish the subject weren''t cut off on the left, other than that, it''s a good shot.', '2005-04-19 17:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304889, 164398, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice artistic interpretation on this challenge.<br/></td>', 'Nice artistic interpretation on this challenge.', '2005-04-19 17:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304894, 164034, 23053, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame about the lens flare, but I like the rest.</td>', 'It''s a shame about the lens flare, but I like the rest.', '2005-04-19 17:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304901, 165896, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice job!</td>', 'Nice job!', '2005-04-19 17:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304922, 165894, 20168, '<td valign="top">Great landscape entry for this challenge.  Photo seems small in comparison to the allowed 640 limits, but could just be my monitor.  Excellent photo</td>', 'Great landscape entry for this challenge.  Photo seems small in comparison to the allowed 640 limits, but could just be my monitor.  Excellent photo', '2005-04-19 17:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304926, 165519, 20168, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and title.  BW was a good choice.  Best of luck</td>', 'Great lighting and title.  BW was a good choice.  Best of luck', '2005-04-19 17:34:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1304934, 165778, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great detail and exposure control.<br/>Depth of field was just right for this shot, as was the "fuzz" left behind.</td>', 'Great detail and exposure control.Depth of field was just right for this shot, as was the "fuzz" left behind.', '2005-04-19 17:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304939, 165707, 20168, '<td valign="top">Excellent title moving this photo into another realm, that of faith and hope beyond the grave.  I like the glow around the open door.  Thanks for this excellent entry.</td>', 'Excellent title moving this photo into another realm, that of faith and hope beyond the grave.  I like the glow around the open door.  Thanks for this excellent entry.', '2005-04-19 17:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304969, 165373, 23053, '<td valign="top">Great green and nice, sharp detail.</td>', 'Great green and nice, sharp detail.', '2005-04-19 17:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304974, 166109, 23053, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective...the sky almost looks fake, especially at the tree.</td>', 'Interesting perspective...the sky almost looks fake, especially at the tree.', '2005-04-19 17:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304982, 165770, 23053, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF...good, warm colors, too.</td>', 'Nice DOF...good, warm colors, too.', '2005-04-19 17:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304986, 165481, 23053, '<td valign="top">Very balanced and serene.  Nice find.</td>', 'Very balanced and serene.  Nice find.', '2005-04-19 17:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304989, 165971, 23053, '<td valign="top">That is a cooooool door...if it''s abandoned, you should get that iron (hinge?) off and use it at your house.</td>', 'That is a cooooool door...if it''s abandoned, you should get that iron (hinge?) off and use it at your house.', '2005-04-19 17:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304993, 165271, 23053, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorits for the challenge.  Great, great, great shot.  Off to find my thesaurus.</td>', 'This is one of my favorits for the challenge.  Great, great, great shot.  Off to find my thesaurus.', '2005-04-19 17:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1305002, 165721, 23053, '<td valign="top">This shot has wonderful depth, color, contrast, and detail.  Also, I like the composition quite a bit, aside from the fact that the cloud is cut off.</td>', 'This shot has wonderful depth, color, contrast, and detail.  Also, I like the composition quite a bit, aside from the fact that the cloud is cut off.', '2005-04-19 17:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1305011, 165684, 23053, '<td valign="top">The sky is amazing, but the subject is too dark and I think some of the detail is lost.  All in all, a strong photograph, none the less.</td>', 'The sky is amazing, but the subject is too dark and I think some of the detail is lost.  All in all, a strong photograph, none the less.', '2005-04-19 18:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
