(1305027, 164341, 23053, '<td valign="top">Very bold composition with the centered doorway.  I like all of the lines in this photo and the way the round tires help break that up.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very bold composition with the centered doorway.  I like all of the lines in this photo and the way the round tires help break that up.  Good luck.', '2005-04-19 18:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
