(1305091, 165795, 23053, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of Romania where old, beautifully detailed houses like this were abandoned most everywhere you looked.  The apartment building in the background only reinforces my memory.<br/> <br/>As far as a photograph goes, I like the duotone feel to this - like pure black and white with no grey.  Good job.</td>', 'This reminds me of Romania where old, beautifully detailed houses like this were abandoned most everywhere you looked.  The apartment building in the background only reinforces my memory. As far as a photograph goes, I like the duotone feel to this - like pure black and white with no grey.  Good job.', '2005-04-19 18:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1305096, 165687, 23053, '<td valign="top">I like the graininess of your shot - it adds to the feel.  Also, the way the sky reflects the overgrown grass is amazing.  This is a wonderful shot.</td>', 'I like the graininess of your shot - it adds to the feel.  Also, the way the sky reflects the overgrown grass is amazing.  This is a wonderful shot.', '2005-04-19 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
