(1306262, 165233, 19708, '<td valign="top">Tough angle to shoot from, being that low.<br/>Perhaps the time of day was wrong or something, as I am having a hard time trying to figure out if that is a tree or cloth or ? on the corner and looks to be between the shed &amp; main building. The foliage is almost the main focal point in this shot and I bet this could be composed a little better from a different point of view. (4)<br/></td>', 'Tough angle to shoot from, being that low.Perhaps the time of day was wrong or something, as I am having a hard time trying to figure out if that is a tree or cloth or ? on the corner and looks to be between the shed & main building. The foliage is almost the main focal point in this shot and I bet this could be composed a little better from a different point of view. (4)', '2005-04-19 23:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306267, 165053, 31831, '<td valign="top">Like the perspective. Great angle, colors, etc. 8</td>', 'Like the perspective. Great angle, colors, etc. 8', '2005-04-19 23:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
