(1306391, 165899, 33947, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection in the water. It makes the picture. Wish it was a little sharper, though.</td>', 'I like the reflection in the water. It makes the picture. Wish it was a little sharper, though.', '2005-04-19 23:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306399, 165037, 9906, '<td valign="top">So far this is best of show for this viewer in spite of the obnoxiously distracting white border.  You managed to take what appears to be a blown out sky and use it to actually set a mood to this shot.  It looks like you used a fish eye lens, but I''m not sure if it truly was or if it''s a trick of the eye and the framing of the tree...  Unfortunately I can''t give you my highest score because of the frame.  I find it very distracting and pulls my eye away from the image itself.  Oh did I mention the awesome tonality?<br/>Kudos<br/>TC</td>', 'So far this is best of show for this viewer in spite of the obnoxiously distracting white border.  You managed to take what appears to be a blown out sky and use it to actually set a mood to this shot.  It looks like you used a fish eye lens, but I''m not sure if it truly was or if it''s a trick of the eye and the framing of the tree...  Unfortunately I can''t give you my highest score because of the frame.  I find it very distracting and pulls my eye away from the image itself.  Oh did I mention the awesome tonality?KudosTC', '2005-04-19 23:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306413, 164828, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nicely captured!  Great vibrant colors in an otherwise black and white challenge.  Where is this building and what was it''s purpose?  It looks like a lighthouse, but I don''t think that''s what it is nor a silo...<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nicely captured!  Great vibrant colors in an otherwise black and white challenge.  Where is this building and what was it''s purpose?  It looks like a lighthouse, but I don''t think that''s what it is nor a silo...TC', '2005-04-19 23:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306420, 165684, 9906, '<td valign="top">Needs to have the subject lightened up just a tad but otherwise nicely done!<br/>TC</td>', 'Needs to have the subject lightened up just a tad but otherwise nicely done!TC', '2005-04-19 23:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306421, 164370, 23680, '<td valign="top">I like the centered composition, just wish your tones were a little deeper. ; Nice inclusion of the structure on the left, whatever it is</td>', 'I like the centered composition, just wish your tones were a little deeper. ; Nice inclusion of the structure on the left, whatever it is', '2005-04-19 23:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306423, 164869, 23680, '<td valign="top">I don''t get a real sense of abandoned here, but nice shot, good colors and composition.</td>', 'I don''t get a real sense of abandoned here, but nice shot, good colors and composition.', '2005-04-19 23:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306426, 163745, 9906, '<td valign="top">This would have been an awesome shot if you used a polarizing filter to make the sky really dramatic!  Your subject is a touch dark though as it is presented here...<br/>TC</td>', 'This would have been an awesome shot if you used a polarizing filter to make the sky really dramatic!  Your subject is a touch dark though as it is presented here...TC', '2005-04-19 23:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306427, 165623, 4281, '<td valign="top">What is wrong with this picture? Here is an incomplete list:<br/>a) The horizon is not level. You should have either fixed this in editing or be more careful at shooting time.<br/>b) The picture is too soft. Either the focus is incorrect or you are using too slow shutter speed. A tripod would''ve helped here. Slight unsharp mask would be nice too (100 in amount, 0.3-0.4 in radius and 0 in threshod would probably help here).<br/>c) The framing is not good enough. What is particularly irritating is that you''ve failed to include the leftmost part of the building. You might also have either tried to include more the surroundings or perhaps focused strictly on the door and the staircase - that might have been better.<br/>d) The photo is much too grey. Try instead to take photographs when it''s not as cloudy as is the case here and take them early in the morning when the sun is low on the sky.</td>', 'What is wrong with this picture? Here is an incomplete list:a) The horizon is not level. You should have either fixed this in editing or be more careful at shooting time.b) The picture is too soft. Either the focus is incorrect or you are using too slow shutter speed. A tripod would''ve helped here. Slight unsharp mask would be nice too (100 in amount, 0.3-0.4 in radius and 0 in threshod would probably help here).c) The framing is not good enough. What is particularly irritating is that you''ve failed to include the leftmost part of the building. You might also have either tried to include more the surroundings or perhaps focused strictly on the door and the staircase - that might have been better.d) The photo is much too grey. Try instead to take photographs when it''s not as cloudy as is the case here and take them early in the morning when the sun is low on the sky.', '2005-04-19 23:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306430, 165971, 23680, '<td valign="top">This building looks like it has some interesting details, like the ironwork on the door and the stone.  I''d like to have seen maybe some of that be the focus of your picture, I think it would have made it more interesting.</td>', 'This building looks like it has some interesting details, like the ironwork on the door and the stone.  I''d like to have seen maybe some of that be the focus of your picture, I think it would have made it more interesting.', '2005-04-19 23:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306432, 165736, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  Got any more shots of this environment?<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nicely done!  Got any more shots of this environment?TC', '2005-04-19 23:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306433, 165998, 23680, '<td valign="top">Hey, I like your title :))))  Great find</td>', 'Hey, I like your title :))))  Great find', '2005-04-19 23:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306434, 165929, 24528, '<td valign="top">More trees then building</td>', 'More trees then building', '2005-04-19 23:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306439, 164172, 9906, '<td valign="top">Awesome looking stairs and scene.  Too bad the time of day had such harsh lighting and shadows...  Can you go back and reshoot at a different time of day preferably early morning or late evening whichever is better for the direction the stairs face?  If you could, I would like to see a reshoot here!<br/>TC</td>', 'Awesome looking stairs and scene.  Too bad the time of day had such harsh lighting and shadows...  Can you go back and reshoot at a different time of day preferably early morning or late evening whichever is better for the direction the stairs face?  If you could, I would like to see a reshoot here!TC', '2005-04-19 23:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306448, 164820, 23680, '<td valign="top">This building has a lot of character, but I don''t like how you cut this in half with the two different textures.  The wood looks like the more interesting of the two, so I would maybe have tried to emphasize that more by moving over and showing more of the wood side of the house.  Hope that makes sense, it''s late and I''m crosse eyed from voting :)</td>', 'This building has a lot of character, but I don''t like how you cut this in half with the two different textures.  The wood looks like the more interesting of the two, so I would maybe have tried to emphasize that more by moving over and showing more of the wood side of the house.  Hope that makes sense, it''s late and I''m crosse eyed from voting :)', '2005-04-20 00:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306449, 166132, 9906, '<td valign="top">Incredible amount of detail for such a dark scene.  Nicely focused.  I know I sometime have issues with low light focusing.  You did good here.  The only thing is, there doesn''t seem to be a subject per se.  No where for your eye to rest.  You have leading lines and depth into the scene, but no resolution at the end of your eyes journey so to speak...<br/>TC<br/>Just before hitting your score, I noticed a what looks like an off centered face within the framelike object...  Kinda creapy.  You get one bonus point!  ;-)</td>', 'Incredible amount of detail for such a dark scene.  Nicely focused.  I know I sometime have issues with low light focusing.  You did good here.  The only thing is, there doesn''t seem to be a subject per se.  No where for your eye to rest.  You have leading lines and depth into the scene, but no resolution at the end of your eyes journey so to speak...TCJust before hitting your score, I noticed a what looks like an off centered face within the framelike object...  Kinda creapy.  You get one bonus point!  ;-)', '2005-04-20 00:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306450, 165415, 23680, '<td valign="top">Not very interesting, sorry.</td>', 'Not very interesting, sorry.', '2005-04-20 00:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306452, 165709, 31541, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and colors.  Good composition!</td>', 'Nice detail and colors.  Good composition!', '2005-04-20 00:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306454, 166093, 23680, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites - I really like the colors in this.  Almost black and white but not quite, great job - 10</td>', 'One of my favorites - I really like the colors in this.  Almost black and white but not quite, great job - 10', '2005-04-20 00:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306456, 164833, 23680, '<td valign="top">great job - great find.  could be just a tad sharper, but still a 9 from me :)</td>', 'great job - great find.  could be just a tad sharper, but still a 9 from me :)', '2005-04-20 00:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306468, 165364, 4281, '<td valign="top">Nice. what I would have loved to see here would have been a shot from further away where the whole tree would have been included. I''d also be curious to see a version where you would stand either a bit more to the left and would have shot the front face of the house straight on more to the right and shot the side straight on.</td>', 'Nice. what I would have loved to see here would have been a shot from further away where the whole tree would have been included. I''d also be curious to see a version where you would stand either a bit more to the left and would have shot the front face of the house straight on more to the right and shot the side straight on.', '2005-04-20 00:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306472, 164220, 23680, '<td valign="top">I like this, did you add grain?  If you did, good choice 10</td>', 'I like this, did you add grain?  If you did, good choice 10', '2005-04-20 00:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
