(1306588, 165024, 27847, '<td valign="top">Love the composition on this photo, if it wasn''t for those two branches touching the barn... you would have gotten it perfectly. Great Work.</td>', 'Love the composition on this photo, if it wasn''t for those two branches touching the barn... you would have gotten it perfectly. Great Work.', '2005-04-20 00:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306596, 165894, 27847, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking photograph and will probably score well do to how gorgeous this photo really is. I will point out though that the focus is on the abandoned buildings and I expect the photo to lead me to the main subject which in this case it does not. My view goes directly to the mountain range, just my observation but great capture.</td>', 'Breathtaking photograph and will probably score well do to how gorgeous this photo really is. I will point out though that the focus is on the abandoned buildings and I expect the photo to lead me to the main subject which in this case it does not. My view goes directly to the mountain range, just my observation but great capture.', '2005-04-20 00:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1306608, 165575, 27847, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and photo really exemplifies abandonment, however I find the over all photo a little blinding/over exposed to the point of it being distractive. Still, nice composition overall.</td>', 'Nice perspective and photo really exemplifies abandonment, however I find the over all photo a little blinding/over exposed to the point of it being distractive. Still, nice composition overall.', '2005-04-20 00:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
