(1306637, 164984, 27847, '<td valign="top">Nice work and it really shows abandonment... Things I would have changed personally about this photo is the angle (Location of the tree) it''s very distracting and takes away from the actual interest point, the barn. Also, it seems a little over exposed on the left side of the barn. But overall nicely done.</td>', 'Nice work and it really shows abandonment... Things I would have changed personally about this photo is the angle (Location of the tree) it''s very distracting and takes away from the actual interest point, the barn. Also, it seems a little over exposed on the left side of the barn. But overall nicely done.', '2005-04-20 00:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
