(1306902, 164794, 16230, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by NovaTiger:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by micknewton:</b></div><hr/><i> Very nice! Zoomdak perhaps? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Wow!  And haystack rock wasn''t even in the picture!  Excellent guess!</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Actually it was an easy guess. The ferns, the trees, the shingles on the building all say "Oregon" to anyone that has lived here for any length of time. In fact, the only thing missing from this image is rain. Where''s the rain Thomas? :)<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by NovaTiger: Originally posted by micknewton: Very nice! Zoomdak perhaps?   Wow!  And haystack rock wasn''t even in the picture!  Excellent guess! Actually it was an easy guess. The ferns, the trees, the shingles on the building all say "Oregon" to anyone that has lived here for any length of time. In fact, the only thing missing from this image is rain. Where''s the rain Thomas? :)', '2005-04-20 02:17:28.000000', NULL, 0),
