(1307163, 164494, 20608, '<td valign="top">to answer a few questions this house definately WAS abandoned dissused and in fact had no roof the kitchen/bathroom section as seen in this pic were still intact and allthough it had "nice windows" it was totally rotten inside and i wouldnt want those windows anywhere near my house.</td>', 'to answer a few questions this house definately WAS abandoned dissused and in fact had no roof the kitchen/bathroom section as seen in this pic were still intact and allthough it had "nice windows" it was totally rotten inside and i wouldnt want those windows anywhere near my house.', '2005-04-20 04:44:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1307167, 164577, 36177, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments and votes!<br/> <br/>Edit: this building is a huge building...<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-20 10:48:51.</i></td>', 'Thank you all for your comments and votes! Edit: this building is a huge building...', '2005-04-20 04:48:21.000000', '2005-04-20 11:48:51.000000', 0),
(1307179, 165949, 11897, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments guys, at the end of the day the voters decide how well a picture does in a challenge.<br/>This place is an old nightclub, abandoned for years and home to lots of cats.I took many pics but this one stood out as the one I liked the most.<br/>Dissappointing result but I like it.<br/>Thanks again, <br/>Paul.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments guys, at the end of the day the voters decide how well a picture does in a challenge.This place is an old nightclub, abandoned for years and home to lots of cats.I took many pics but this one stood out as the one I liked the most.Dissappointing result but I like it.Thanks again, Paul.', '2005-04-20 05:06:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1307201, 165684, 35720, '<td valign="top">Thanks a lot for your comments. Most of you say this image is too dark and that is probably right, but it is different from one monitor to another. In my monitor it is not too dark in my opinion but I have seen it in other monitors which it looks much too dark. So if you try to adjust the brightness of your monitors you will maybe se this image in a new light. Thanks, your comments were most helpful.</td>', 'Thanks a lot for your comments. Most of you say this image is too dark and that is probably right, but it is different from one monitor to another. In my monitor it is not too dark in my opinion but I have seen it in other monitors which it looks much too dark. So if you try to adjust the brightness of your monitors you will maybe se this image in a new light. Thanks, your comments were most helpful.', '2005-04-20 05:36:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1307207, 164214, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great viewpoint and sensitive processing Ed.</td>', 'Great viewpoint and sensitive processing Ed.', '2005-04-20 05:55:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1307211, 164657, 27901, '<td valign="top">Great work Andri and congratulations one more ribbon to Iceland;-)</td>', 'Great work Andri and congratulations one more ribbon to Iceland;-)', '2005-04-20 06:11:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1307221, 165896, 35044, '<td valign="top">Many thanks to those who voted and especially to those who commented. The "huge bird or rocket on the distant roof" is Sir Norman Foster''s Swiss Re Tower, or the "Gherkin", as it is affectionately known!</td>', 'Many thanks to those who voted and especially to those who commented. The "huge bird or rocket on the distant roof" is Sir Norman Foster''s Swiss Re Tower, or the "Gherkin", as it is affectionately known!', '2005-04-20 06:22:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(1307225, 163940, 34685, '<td valign="top">Thanks every body for the valuable feed back and comments. I had thought of making the foregound completely black. But I am not really good at it and could not get a nice look in photoshop. So I did away with it. The building stands in the middle of Besant nagar beach in Chennai, India. Not sure what it was used for previously. I was hoping to get a bright sunrise that day , but it was a cloudy morning and it started raining few minutes after I took this shot.</td>', 'Thanks every body for the valuable feed back and comments. I had thought of making the foregound completely black. But I am not really good at it and could not get a nice look in photoshop. So I did away with it. The building stands in the middle of Besant nagar beach in Chennai, India. Not sure what it was used for previously. I was hoping to get a bright sunrise that day , but it was a cloudy morning and it started raining few minutes after I took this shot.', '2005-04-20 06:30:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1307233, 166017, 12750, '<td valign="top">I figured a black &amp; white picture of this scene or even color would reveal a very average and somewhat dull shot, lower 5''s at best.  So I decided to whack it up a bit and spark some emotion, good or bad.  I seemed to have accomplished that result with this submission. =)<br/> <br/>Thx for the comments!</td>', 'I figured a black & white picture of this scene or even color would reveal a very average and somewhat dull shot, lower 5''s at best.  So I decided to whack it up a bit and spark some emotion, good or bad.  I seemed to have accomplished that result with this submission. =) Thx for the comments!', '2005-04-20 06:40:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1307234, 164657, 10390, '<td valign="top">Til hamingju með fyrsta borðann! Góð mynd!</td>', 'Til hamingju með fyrsta borðann! Góð mynd!', '2005-04-20 06:42:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1307255, 165467, 32602, '<td valign="top">What Brad said, this should have been way up there!</td>', 'What Brad said, this should have been way up there!', '2005-04-20 06:58:47.000000', NULL, 0),
