(1307302, 165661, 32754, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorite shots..lovely contrasts and composition...I thought it would be top 20..congratulations, anyway! I don''t see any reddish bands on my monitor..if they are there, it''s subtle.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-20 06:48:54.</i></td>', 'This was one of my favorite shots..lovely contrasts and composition...I thought it would be top 20..congratulations, anyway! I don''t see any reddish bands on my monitor..if they are there, it''s subtle.', '2005-04-20 07:47:07.000000', '2005-04-20 07:48:54.000000', 0),
(1307323, 165466, 1570, '<td valign="top">thanks a lot for all your comments, contradictory as they might be! srbrubaker, you rock!</td>', 'thanks a lot for all your comments, contradictory as they might be! srbrubaker, you rock!', '2005-04-20 08:01:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1307328, 165897, 32848, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments, especially the ones regarding the building blending in with the background.  I''ve certainly taken that on board now!  Light on the day was not good and with basic editing....<br/> <br/>This was my first entry into a challenge and although not high scoring, I found it quite exciting watching the scores and comments come in and I even got a few eights, which is encouraging.  I''ve now joined and become a full member and look forward to more challenges.<br/> <br/>Mex<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments, especially the ones regarding the building blending in with the background.  I''ve certainly taken that on board now!  Light on the day was not good and with basic editing.... This was my first entry into a challenge and although not high scoring, I found it quite exciting watching the scores and comments come in and I even got a few eights, which is encouraging.  I''ve now joined and become a full member and look forward to more challenges. Mex ', '2005-04-20 08:06:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1307329, 164313, 10390, '<td valign="top">80% árangur er nú ekki svo slæmt, myndin kemur vel út, spurning með himininn, sker sig dálítið út einhvern veginn... KUTGW</td>', '80% árangur er nú ekki svo slæmt, myndin kemur vel út, spurning með himininn, sker sig dálítið út einhvern veginn... KUTGW', '2005-04-20 08:07:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1307330, 165901, 33560, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! It may be your first blue, but if your long string of strong images provides a clue, I''ll bet it''s not your last.</td>', 'Congratulations! It may be your first blue, but if your long string of strong images provides a clue, I''ll bet it''s not your last.', '2005-04-20 08:09:24.000000', NULL, 0),
