(1307350, 165679, 2741, '<td valign="top">Congrats on 5th. I gave this a 7. I thought this would be top 3. You were so close.</td>', 'Congrats on 5th. I gave this a 7. I thought this would be top 3. You were so close.', '2005-04-20 08:21:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1307353, 163901, 14671, '<td valign="top">A very well composed shot with excelent clarity.  I like the tone of the sky and think it adds to the photo by giving it a creepy or errie feeling.  I like the dark spots in it as well such as the door and find it leaves more to the imagination.  I do find the brush to be a little distracting but aside from doing some landscaping before you took the photo there is nothing you could do about it.  Perhaps it would have done better in B&amp;W? altho I really think color was the way to go.  I do think that a lot of people underrated your photo and I believe that is due to so many entries.  Hope this helps  bit and good luck in the future challenges.</td>', 'A very well composed shot with excelent clarity.  I like the tone of the sky and think it adds to the photo by giving it a creepy or errie feeling.  I like the dark spots in it as well such as the door and find it leaves more to the imagination.  I do find the brush to be a little distracting but aside from doing some landscaping before you took the photo there is nothing you could do about it.  Perhaps it would have done better in B&W? altho I really think color was the way to go.  I do think that a lot of people underrated your photo and I believe that is due to so many entries.  Hope this helps  bit and good luck in the future challenges.', '2005-04-20 08:22:27.000000', NULL, 0),
