(1307406, 165901, 24454, '<td valign="top">I just knew this one was a ribbon winner,the minute I saw it.   What an accomplishment to win blue out of so many great entries.   Congratulations!!!<br/> <br/>SandyP</td>', 'I just knew this one was a ribbon winner,the minute I saw it.   What an accomplishment to win blue out of so many great entries.   Congratulations!!! SandyP', '2005-04-20 08:45:46.000000', NULL, 0),
