(1307411, 163854, 34192, '<td valign="top">I really thought this should have rated higher in spite of the lightness.  If you ever rework the image, I would love to see the results.  This is one of the better composed images in the challenge.</td>', 'I really thought this should have rated higher in spite of the lightness.  If you ever rework the image, I would love to see the results.  This is one of the better composed images in the challenge.', '2005-04-20 08:48:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1307413, 164657, 24454, '<td valign="top">CONGRATULATIONS!!   Iceland certainly lends itself to ribbon photography doesn''t it!!!  This is just beautiful!!!    How nice to win your first ribbon with this!!!<br/> <br/>SandyP</td>', 'CONGRATULATIONS!!   Iceland certainly lends itself to ribbon photography doesn''t it!!!  This is just beautiful!!!    How nice to win your first ribbon with this!!! SandyP', '2005-04-20 08:49:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1307418, 164311, 16636, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everybody that left comments and voted. I didn''t honestly think this would end with such a high score (picked up by most that it really didn''t emphasise ''abandoned'').<br/> <br/>It was a fantastic evening when I shot, the freak passing clouds dumped a load of snow on me whilst sitting in a wind swept field. It had been a lovely day to this point, I went up there with little more than a t-shirt, then this cold front swept in!<br/> <br/>Some other shots I managed to gat that evening....<br/> <br/><a href="//nordic1966.100webcustomers.com/Windmills/pages/gt_haz_Windmill_2_jpg.htm" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//nordic1966.100webcustomers.com/Windmills/thumbnails/gt_milton_2.jpg'', strrpos(''//nordic1966.100webcustomers.com/Windmills/thumbnails/gt_milton_2.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//nordic1966.100webcustomers.com/Windmills/thumbnails/gt_milton_2.jpg"/></a> <a href="//nordic1966.100webcustomers.com/Windmills/pages/gt_haz_Windmill_3_jpg.htm" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//nordic1966.100webcustomers.com/Windmills/thumbnails/gt_milton_3.jpg'', strrpos(''//nordic1966.100webcustomers.com/Windmills/thumbnails/gt_milton_3.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//nordic1966.100webcustomers.com/Windmills/thumbnails/gt_milton_3.jpg"/></a><a href="//nordic1966.100webcustomers.com/Windmills/pages/gt_haz_Windmill_4_jpg.htm" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//nordic1966.100webcustomers.com/Windmills/thumbnails/gt_milton_4.jpg'', strrpos(''//nordic1966.100webcustomers.com/Windmills/thumbnails/gt_milton_4.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//nordic1966.100webcustomers.com/Windmills/thumbnails/gt_milton_4.jpg"/></a><a href="//nordic1966.100webcustomers.com/Windmills/pages/gt_haz_Windmill_5_jpg.htm" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//nordic1966.100webcustomers.com/Windmills/thumbnails/gt_milton_5.jpg'', strrpos(''//nordic1966.100webcustomers.com/Windmills/thumbnails/gt_milton_5.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//nordic1966.100webcustomers.com/Windmills/thumbnails/gt_milton_5.jpg"/></a><a href="//nordic1966.100webcustomers.com/Windmills/pages/gt_haz_Windmill_6_jpg.htm" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//nordic1966.100webcustomers.com/Windmills/thumbnails/gt_milton_6.jpg'', strrpos(''//nordic1966.100webcustomers.com/Windmills/thumbnails/gt_milton_6.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//nordic1966.100webcustomers.com/Windmills/thumbnails/gt_milton_6.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Thanks,<br/>Neil.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks to everybody that left comments and voted. I didn''t honestly think this would end with such a high score (picked up by most that it really didn''t emphasise ''abandoned''). It was a fantastic evening when I shot, the freak passing clouds dumped a load of snow on me whilst sitting in a wind swept field. It had been a lovely day to this point, I went up there with little more than a t-shirt, then this cold front swept in! Some other shots I managed to gat that evening....    Thanks,Neil. ', '2005-04-20 08:52:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1307429, 165271, 34192, '<td valign="top">I thought this image would have done much better.  You just never know what the voters are going to go for!  Seems they really like pretty, sharp, color.  Its a great image - you''ve got a great eye.</td>', 'I thought this image would have done much better.  You just never know what the voters are going to go for!  Seems they really like pretty, sharp, color.  Its a great image - you''ve got a great eye.', '2005-04-20 08:57:47.000000', NULL, 0),
