(1307435, 164803, 34192, '<td valign="top">Sorry I didn''t make it back during the challenge to bump this up.  I really thought this would score higher.  I should have known it was Mexico.  You''ve beautifully captured the tones and texture of the building.  The dappled sunlight adds to the image also.  Really like this one...</td>', 'Sorry I didn''t make it back during the challenge to bump this up.  I really thought this would score higher.  I should have known it was Mexico.  You''ve beautifully captured the tones and texture of the building.  The dappled sunlight adds to the image also.  Really like this one...', '2005-04-20 09:01:26.000000', NULL, 0),
