(1307741, 165720, 31211, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for commmenting.<br/>This was an abandoned house, with a chaotic yard, which I couldn''t enter. On the yard, there was this chair and a white sofa, which I tried to photograph, but didn''t manage to get the right angle and light (it was a very bright sunny day). <br/>DOF should be longer, but I had to zoom in all the way with my tiny point and shot. I believe this was my best angle (without break in and enter), considering I was too far away.<br/>When I edited the photo, I had to decrease contrast and brightness, or the white wall would be completely blown out (and that is why it is a bit dark). <br/>Again, thank you for your comments and tips, wich were all appreciated.</td>', 'Thank you all for commmenting.This was an abandoned house, with a chaotic yard, which I couldn''t enter. On the yard, there was this chair and a white sofa, which I tried to photograph, but didn''t manage to get the right angle and light (it was a very bright sunny day). DOF should be longer, but I had to zoom in all the way with my tiny point and shot. I believe this was my best angle (without break in and enter), considering I was too far away.When I edited the photo, I had to decrease contrast and brightness, or the white wall would be completely blown out (and that is why it is a bit dark). Again, thank you for your comments and tips, wich were all appreciated.', '2005-04-20 11:44:07.000000', NULL, 0),
