(1309000, 166095, 20662, '<td valign="top">Lexa -- I found the comments on your photo an interesting mix. Some complaining about the colors and some loving them. I find the contrast between the dark window frames and windows and the pink of the building to be very interesting. It makes the pink pop. The broken glass adds a visual interest to the photo. Really think this should have scored higher.<br/>Debi</td>', 'Lexa -- I found the comments on your photo an interesting mix. Some complaining about the colors and some loving them. I find the contrast between the dark window frames and windows and the pink of the building to be very interesting. It makes the pink pop. The broken glass adds a visual interest to the photo. Really think this should have scored higher.Debi', '2005-04-20 19:02:47.000000', NULL, 0),
