(1309834, 164034, 32239, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the comments and constructive critism. :)<br/> <br/>When I spotted this I wanted it shot at an angle against the sun, as I did want the sun glare there in the left. The composition is off, but the ground in the background is actually a sloping farmer''s field. It led furthur down into a creek.<br/> <br/>The sky is blotchy, and I hated this, but I did want to give it a try anyhow.  I liked how the tree didn''t have any leaves (or buds) on it yet... still potrayed late winter.<br/> <br/>I did get a lot of good feedback and I hope I get a chance to use some of the pointers in the future.</td>', 'Thank you for all the comments and constructive critism. :) When I spotted this I wanted it shot at an angle against the sun, as I did want the sun glare there in the left. The composition is off, but the ground in the background is actually a sloping farmer''s field. It led furthur down into a creek. The sky is blotchy, and I hated this, but I did want to give it a try anyhow.  I liked how the tree didn''t have any leaves (or buds) on it yet... still potrayed late winter. I did get a lot of good feedback and I hope I get a chance to use some of the pointers in the future.', '2005-04-21 00:29:01.000000', NULL, 0),
