(1310414, 165901, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo, Ursula! I love the choice of the lighter blue sky, which makes the impact of the barn''s colors more vivid.</td>', 'Wonderful photo, Ursula! I love the choice of the lighter blue sky, which makes the impact of the barn''s colors more vivid.', '2005-04-21 06:40:32.000000', NULL, 0),
