(1314653, 165800, 31738, '<td valign="top">Thank you Tracy! This was the same building that my brother took. We actually did go together to take some photos for this challenge. You definitely don''t want to go to that place alone. Too scary. LOL. I mean if you think the pictures look scary you could just imagine how it looks in real life. I did have alot of fun though. This photo happens to be one of my favorites. The exit to this stairwell didn''t have a door so the natural light was beaming in. The lighting was perfect. The vibrancy is what got me . I''m just really disapointed on how many 1''s and 2''s I got. Sometimes I think that the voting on this site is fixed. This would of scored much higher but Oh well, I gave it a shot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-02 12:05:17.</i></td>', 'Thank you Tracy! This was the same building that my brother took. We actually did go together to take some photos for this challenge. You definitely don''t want to go to that place alone. Too scary. LOL. I mean if you think the pictures look scary you could just imagine how it looks in real life. I did have alot of fun though. This photo happens to be one of my favorites. The exit to this stairwell didn''t have a door so the natural light was beaming in. The lighting was perfect. The vibrancy is what got me . I''m just really disapointed on how many 1''s and 2''s I got. Sometimes I think that the voting on this site is fixed. This would of scored much higher but Oh well, I gave it a shot.', '2005-04-23 01:32:57.000000', '2005-05-02 13:05:17.000000', 0),
