(1340430, 166117, 28359, '<td valign="top">I think this came out ok, the weather was real bad. Wish I could had taken a couple of days to look around, I live in old small town outside the big city, there are alot of old barns and structures like this one. One of those shots taken couple hours before the challenge, had to crop it as is, to much distracting objects around. I tried to crop out as much of the white sky as poss............Thanks.......ace</td>', 'I think this came out ok, the weather was real bad. Wish I could had taken a couple of days to look around, I live in old small town outside the big city, there are alot of old barns and structures like this one. One of those shots taken couple hours before the challenge, had to crop it as is, to much distracting objects around. I tried to crop out as much of the white sky as poss............Thanks.......ace', '2005-04-28 23:24:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1344968, 164399, 20330, '<td valign="top">I am one of your 7 "10" votes. I really liked this shot, can''t believe it didnt score better. I would prefer the power lines cloned out on the right side. I hate power lines. If I didnt love electricity so much I would lobby to have them taken down, they have messed up so many of my shots! anyway... nice work and I look forward to seeing more of your work.</td>', 'I am one of your 7 "10" votes. I really liked this shot, can''t believe it didnt score better. I would prefer the power lines cloned out on the right side. I hate power lines. If I didnt love electricity so much I would lobby to have them taken down, they have messed up so many of my shots! anyway... nice work and I look forward to seeing more of your work.', '2005-04-29 23:55:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1344999, 165167, 20330, '<td valign="top">I usually prefer b&amp;w with landscapes involving the woods or old houses, but in this particular shot it blends in too much. The shot has no dramatic effect. You could have darkened the woods and not the house and it would have stood out more. This is a nice shot, just my critique..</td>', 'I usually prefer b&w with landscapes involving the woods or old houses, but in this particular shot it blends in too much. The shot has no dramatic effect. You could have darkened the woods and not the house and it would have stood out more. This is a nice shot, just my critique..', '2005-04-30 00:02:59.000000', NULL, 0),
