(3261292, 166103, 69008, '<td valign="top">It seems that you live and shoot images in the heart of the "Old South" area of the country. The river area around Natchez is full of history and folklore. This image seems to capture a connection to those days with whispers of ghosts and hard living. I am enjoying your portfolio, as I have been to some of the places in your images years ago.</td>', 'It seems that you live and shoot images in the heart of the "Old South" area of the country. The river area around Natchez is full of history and folklore. This image seems to capture a connection to those days with whispers of ghosts and hard living. I am enjoying your portfolio, as I have been to some of the places in your images years ago.', '2007-01-21 00:33:40.000000', NULL, 0),
